<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ghumwanduso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mwand</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mwanduso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Mwanduso</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ichitabu che Ghumwanduso</para>
  <para style="is">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Taghwa Ghumwanduso, mana yake “pfyandusile.” Ichitabu achi cholonga ghuulimwengu pfiulumbighwe, iwanu pfiwanzile, nzambi pfyanzile na kudununzika mne isi. Pfifila chotulongela Imulungu pfyandusille kughwatendela iwanu ipfinu pfingi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu cha Ghumwanduso chodaha kugholighwa hanu heli ng'ulu. (1) Isura 1-11 yokonetsa isi pfiilumbighwe ne Imulungu, na mbuli tse ghumwande tse iwanu. Hano kotsona mbuli tse Adamu ne Eva, Kaini ne Abeli, ligharika na chilingilo cha Babeli. (2) Isura 12-50 amo kotsona mbuli tse iwabala we ghumwande we iwanu we Isiraeli. Imunu we mwanduso kakala Abrahamu, yemanyike kwa kumlolela ne ukumhulikitsa Imulungu. Hambele kotsona mbuli tse Isaka imwanaghe immale, ne Yakobu imtsukulu wake immale. Yakobu pfipfila kakemighwa Isiraeli. Kuya kotsona mbuli tse iwana iwamale longo limwe na weli we Yakobu, kubitila iwanawo, kolo longo limwe na mbili tse Isiraeli tsandusa. Pfipfila imbuli ing'ulu yolangusa imwana yumwe we Yakobu taghwa lyake Yosefu, ne ipfinu pfiwatenda Yakobu ne iwanaghe wangi iwamale na kaye tsao waghende kukala kune isi ya Misiri.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu achino ipfichikoneka chotulongela mbuli tse iwanu, lekeni imbuli ing'ulu ng'ani mne ichitabu achi, iyotulangusa ipfinu Imulungu pfiatendile. Chokwandusila kutulangusa ghendo Imulungu tsakalumba isi yose, na chofambulila kwe kutulongela Imulungu kalonga katsoghendelela kughwalolesa iwanu wake. Mne ichitabu chose yumwe yolongwa ng'ani ka Imulungu. Ayo kolamla na kolagha iwanu watendile ghehile, kowalongotsa na kowapfila iwanu wake, kuwatenda wanoghe mne ughima ghwao.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu achi cha ghumwande chandikwa ukwika mbuli tse iwanu wamlolele Imulungu na chowapfila iwanu</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mne ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Pfiulumbighwe isi yose ne iwanu 1.1-2,25</para>
  <para style="io">Inzambi pfyanzile na kudununzika 3.1,24</para>
  <para style="io">Ukulawa kwe Adamu mbaka kwe Nowa 4.1-5,32</para>
  <para style="io">Nuhu ne ligharika 6.1-10,32</para>
  <para style="io">Chilingilo ichikalile Babeli 11.1-9</para>
  <para style="io">Ukulawa kwe Sem mbaka kwe Abramu 11.10-32</para>
  <para style="io">Iwabala, Abrahamu, Isaka ne Yakobu 12.1-35,29</para>
  <para style="io">Lukolo lwe Esau 36.1-43</para>
  <para style="io">Yosefu ne iwandughu tsake 37.1-45,28</para>
  <para style="io">Iwanu we Isiraeli pfiwakalile Misiri 46.1-50,26.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu kolumba ipfinu pfose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Aho mwanduso ghendo Imulungu tsakalumba lilanga na isi <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Isi yose tsaikala yahela lilumbo na yahela ichinu. Ichisi tsachighubika ghamatsi ghane china chirefu ighaghubike chila hanu. Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu tsangungali ghwoyungayunga mchanya mwe ghamatsi. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Kuya Imulungu kalonga, “Ghumwanga ghulawile.” Baho, ghumwanga ghulawila. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Imulungu kaghwona ghumwanga ghunogha, Imulungu kabaghula ghumwanga ne ichisi. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Imulungu kaghwukema ghumwanga “Misi,” na ichisi kachikema “Chilo.” Mihe ibita, nemitondo itsa, alyo tsatsuwa lya mwanduso.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Kuya Imulungu kalonga, “Lilanga lilawile, lighole ghamatsi na ghamatsi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Apfo Imulungu katenda lilanga, kaghola ghamatsi, ghamwenga ghakale hasi, ghamwenga ghakale mchanya mwe lilanga. Ikala pfipfo. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Imulungu kaling'a taghwa lilanga lila “Kulanga”. Mihe ibita, nemitondo itsa, alyo tsalikala litsuwa lya keli.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Kuya Imulungu kalonga, “Ghamatsi ighali hasi mwe ililanga ghakale hanu hamwe, ne lidongo ilisakale lyoneke.” Ikala pfipfo. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Imulungu kalikema dongo lila ilisakale, “Isi,” na ghamatsi ighakalile hamwe “Ibahari.” Imulungu tsakona pfinogha. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Kuya Imulungu kalonga, “Isi ilapfe imimeya, imimeya iikweleka tsimbeghu, na imibiki ikweleka ghamatunda ghane tsimbeghu.” Ikala pfipfo. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Apfo isi ilapfa imimeya, imimeya iikweleka tsimbeghu ka pfaili, na imibiki iikweleka ghamatunda ghane tsimbeghu ka pfaili. Imulungu tsakona pfinogha. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Mihe ibita, nemitondo itsa, alyo tsalikala litsuwa lya kadatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Kuya Imulungu kalonga, “Pfilawile ipfimuli mlanga, pfibaghule imisi na ichilo. Pfilanguse ukwandusa kwa ghamatsuwa, misimu na miyaka. <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />Pfimulike mlanga na kulapfa ghumwanga muisi.” Ikala pfipfo. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Imulungu kalumba ipfimuli ipfikulu pfibili, litsua litawale nemisi, na lwetsi lutawale nechilo. Pfipfila kalumba na tsinondo. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Imulungu keka ipfimuli mlanga pfimulike muisi, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />pfitawale nemisi na nechilo, napfo pfibaghule ghumwanga ne ichisi. Imulungu kona pfinogha. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Mihe ibita, nemitondo itsa, alyo tsalikala litsuwa lya kane.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Kuya Imulungu kalonga, “Wapfilumbe wengi iwali waghima wameme mna ghamatsi na wapfideghe waghuluke mlanga.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Apfo Imulungu kalumba wapfilumbe wakulu ng'ani we ibahari, wapfilumbe wose waghima iwamemile mna ghamatsi ka pfawali, na wapfideghe wose ka pfawali. Imulungu kona pfinogha. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Imulungu kawabaliki pfilumbe, kawalongela wakeleke, wameme mna tsibahari, na wapfideghe wongetseke muisi. <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Mihe ibita, nemitondo itsa, alyo tsalikala litsuwa lya tano.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Kuya Imulungu kalonga, “Isi ilapfe wapfilumbe waghima ka pfawali, iwanyama iwofughighwa na wa kumuhulo ka pfawali, na wapfilumbe iwotambala ka pfawali.” Ikala pfipfo. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Apfo Imulungu kalumba iwanyama wa kumuhulo ka pfawali, iwanyama iwofughighwa ka pfawali, na wapfilumbe iwotambala ka pfawali. Imulungu tsakona pfikala pfinogha.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Kuya Imulungu kalonga, “Tulumbe iwanu weghale na twetwe, na wawe ka twetwe. Watsowatawala iwasomba, wapfideghe ne iwanyama wose iwofughighwa na wa kumuhulo, na wapfilumbe wose iwotambala.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Apfo Imulungu kawalumba iwanu weghale ne imwenyegho, kawalumba kwa kwighala naye. Kawalumba immale ne ipinga. <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Imulungu kawabaliki, kawalongela, “Mkeleke na mwongetseke. Mmeme muisi mwose, muwe ne uwetso mna ipfinu pfose. Muwatawale iwasomba, wapfideghe na wapfilumbe wose iwali muisi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Kuya Imulungu kalonga, “Noweng'a chila ghummeya ighukweleka tsimbeghu mna isi yose, na chila mbiki ghune ghamatunda ghane tsimbeghu. Pfitsakuwa pfijo pfenu. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Ne wanyama wose wa kumuhulo, wapfideghe wose na wapfilumbe wose iwotambala muisi niweng'a mitsani ya chila ghummeya iwe chijo chawo.” Ikala pfipfo. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Imulungu kona ipfinu pfose pfayalumbile pfikala pfinogha ng'ani! Mihe ibita, nemitondo itsa, alyo tsalikala litsuwa lya sita.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Apfo pfipfo lilanga ne isi pfatsimalile kulumbighwa na wapfilumbe wose iwali mumo. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Mne litsuwa lya saba Imulungu kabwihila, kwaapfila tsakafambula ing'onde yake yose. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Imulungu kalibaliki litsuwa lya saba, kalitenda lihenzeluke, mana mna litsuwa alyo Imulungu tsakabwihila kwaapfila kafambula ing'onde yake yose ya kulumba.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adam na Eva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Aino imbuli ye lilanga ne isi hatsilumbighwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Kulawa litsuwa lila IMNDEWA hayalumbile lilanga ne isi, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />tsakukala kuduhu imimeya kune lidongo. Tsimbeghu tsikala ng'ana tsote baye, kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsang'ana yaileke baye imvula itowe na tsakukala kuduhu imunu iyolima muisi. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Ghamatsuwa ghala ghamatsi ighakalile hasi mwe iisi ghatsa mchanya na ghaghumila iisi yose. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Kuya Imulungu kasola lidongo muisi, kalumba immale kwa lidongo alyo, kamhumulila ghumuhe ghwe ughima mna imula yake, apfo immale kawa imunu mghima. <verse eid="GEN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Kuya Imulungu keka konde ako Edeni, ubali wa kwalilawila litsua. Kamwika immale ayo iyamlumbile. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Ako Imulungu katenda imibiki inoghile ya chila aina ikule na yeleke ghamatunda ghanoghile. Mghati mwe ibostani tsakukala ne mbiki ghwa ughima ne mbiki ighuwatenda iwanu wamanye ghanoghile na ghehile<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Tsakukala na ghumto ighung'ali ghughuluma ghamatsi mna konde lya Edeni, kulawa aho tsaghwighola mna imito mine. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Ghumto ghwa mwanduso taghwa lyake Pisoni, nagho ghubitila kune isi ya Hafila, ako hana nzahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Nzahabu tsa hanu aho tsinogha ng'ani, kuya hana ghamafuta ighonung'ila, na ghamabwe gha bei ng'ulu. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Ghumto ghwa keli taghwa lyake Gihoni, ghobitila kune isi yose ya Kushi <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Ghumto ghwa kadatu taghwa lyake Tigirisi, agho ghobita ubali we ukulawila litsua mwe isi ye Asiriya. Ghumto ghwa kane taghwa lyake Efurati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamwika imunu ayo kune konde lya Edeni alilime na alilolese. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Kwodaha ukuja litunda lya imbiki wowose mna ibostani, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />lekeni uleke ukuja ghamatunda ghe imbiki ighuwatenda iwanu wamanye ghanoghile na ghehile, ung'aja kutsakufa ghendo.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Kuya Imulungu kalonga, “Ng'apfinoghile baye imunu yuno akale yaliyeka. Nitsomtendela yungi wa kumwapfila, iyeghala naye.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Apfo Imulungu kasola lidongo muisi, katendela iwanyama wose na wapfideghe wose. Kuya kamghalila imunu ayo alole mataghwa ghayatsoweng'a, apfo pfipfo wapfilumbe pfawapatile mataghwa ghawo. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Apfo imunu ayo kaweng'a mataghwa iwanyama wose na wapfideghe wose, lekeni tsakuduhu wowose wa kumwapfila Adamu mna awo wose.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamwing'a imunu ayo inongo ndito ng'ani. Hayawasile, Imulungu kalapfa lubapfu lumwe lwe immale ayo kaghubika hanu hala ne inyama. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />IMNDEWA kamlumba ipinga kwa lubapfu alo, kamghalila immale ayo. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Kuya immale ayo kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Ayuno sambi kampate kulawa mna imipate yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">ne inyama ilawile mna inyama yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">taghwa lyake litsakuwa ‘ipinga,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">kwaapfila kalawa mna immale.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Apfo immale katsowaleka aba wake na mai wake, naye katselunga na mwehe wake, nawo watsakuwa lukuli lumwe.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Immale na mwehe wake wose tsawakala chidako, lekeni ng'awonile chinyala baye.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Adam na Eva pfawalemile ukumuhulikitsa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Inzoka tsakakala kakengela ng'ani kubita iwanyama wose wa kwibagho iwalumbighwe ne IMNDEWA. Inzoka kamghutsa ipinga, “Apfi Imulungu kalonga mleke kuja ghamatunda gha mbiki ghwoghwose mkonde?”<verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Ipinga kamwidika, “Ghamatunda ghe imibiki ili mkonde twodaha ukuja, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />lekeni Imulungu kalonga, ‘Mleke ukuja ghamatunda ghali mna imbiki ighuli mghati mwe konde, na mleke kughudonza, mng'atenda apfo, mtsakufa.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Inzoka kamwidika, “Bae, ng'amtsakufa. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Imulungu kalonga apfo kwaapfila komanya mng'aja mtsokuwa ka yeye, na mtsomanya ghanoghile na ghehile.” <verse eid="GEN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Ipinga kaghona ghamatunda ghe mbiki agho ghanogha ng'ani kwa ukuja, na ghanogha kughalola, naye kapfikitsa itsakuwa pfinogha kumanya ghanoghile na ghehile. Apfo kaghondola kaja, pfifila kamwing'a immale wake yakalile hamwe naye, naye kaja. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Bahala hawajile tsinenge tsawo tsipfughuka, watanga ka wachidako. Apfo wasola imitsani ya mkuyu watendela maghwanda weghubika.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Nemihe Adamu na mwehe wake wamhulika IMNDEWA ang'ali yakwanga mkonde, nawo wepfisa mna imibiki IMNDEWA aleke kuwona. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kamkema Adamu, “Adamu Ulikwani?” <verse eid="GEN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Naye kamwidika, “Tsanikuhulika mkonde, nipfuka kwaapfila tsang'ala chidako, apfo nipfisa.” <verse eid="GEN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Imulungu kamghutsa, “Yuhi yakulongele kwachidako? Pfii kuja ghamatunda ighanikughomile uleke kughaja?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Immale ayo kamwidika, “Ipinga yumwikile hano hamwe na nene, kangaya litunda kulawa kune imbiki ghula na nene ndiya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamghutsa ipinga ayo, “Chinu chachi chutendile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Ipinga kamwidika, “Inzoka kangutsukila, na nene ndiya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu kowahigha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela inzoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">“Kwa achino chutendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">ghweghwe kulighitighwa mna iwanyama wose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">na wapfilumbe wose wa kumuhulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">kutsotambala kwa lida lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">naghwe kutsakuja litimbwisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">ghamatsuwa ghose gha ughima wako.<verse eid="GEN 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Nitsokutenda ghweghwe ne ipinga mwihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">ne iwanagho ne iwana we ipinga wehile ghamatsuwa ghose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">Imwana we ipinga katsokuhonda litwi lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">naghwe kutsomluma ichisegheyu.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Kuya kamlongela ipinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">“Nitsokwongetsela usungu mna ukweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">kwa usungu kutsakweleka iwana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">Kutsomsulukila immale wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">naye katsokutawala.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Kuya Imulungu kamlongela Adamu, “Kwaapfila kumhulikitsa mwehe wako, ne ukuja litunda lyanikulaghitse, ‘Uleke ukuja ghamatunda gha imbiki aghwo,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">kwa achino chutendile lidongo lilighitighwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">Kutsopata ichijo kwa ukusang'ana kwa usungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">kulawa mna lidongo ghamatsuwa ghose ghe ughima wako.<verse eid="GEN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Lidongo litsolapfa imibagho na tsimiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:18">naghwe kutsakuja imimeya ya kwibagho.<verse eid="GEN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Naghwe kutsosang'ana na kulawa lijaso</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">ili kutenda lidongo likulapfile ichijo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">mbaka hautsakufa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">Kwaapfila tsanikulumba kulawa mna lidongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">naghwe kutsakuya keli mna lidongo.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Adamu kamwing'a taghwa mwehe wake Eva, kwaapfila ipinga ayo tsakakala mai we iwanu wose iwelekighwe. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />IMNDEWA kawatendela Adamu na mwehe wake maghwanda ghe ngotsi ye imnyama, kuya kawapfatsa.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Eva wowingighwa mkonde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Kuya IMNDEWA kalonga, “Sambi imunu kawa ka yumwe wetu, komanya ghanoghile na ghehile. Apfo aghomighwe kughondola ghamatunda gha mbiki ighulapfa ughima. Kwaapfila ang'aja, katsokala mghima ghamatsuwa ghose.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Apfo IMNDEWA kamuwinga mna likonde lya Edeni, naye kamtenda alilime lidongo, kulawa amo kwayalumbighwe. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Kuya kune ubali wa kwalilawila litsua wa likonde lya Edeni, Imulungu keka Makerubi na lipanga ilikwaka ghumoto, ilitsunguluka chila hanu ukukalitsa imunu wowose aleke kutsa habehi ne imbiki ughulapfa ughima.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Kaini na Abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Kuya Adamu kawasa na Eva, mwehe wake, naye kakinda inda na kumweleka Kaini, kalonga, “IMNDEWA kanyapfila nyeleka mwana mmale.” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Hambele keleka imwana yungi, kamkema Abeli. Abeli tsayang'ali mdimi, na Kaini tsayang'ali yolima. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Hambele, Kaini kamlapfila nambiko ya matsawo ghake gha kumghunda, <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />naye Abeli kamlapfila Imulungu nyama inoghile ye iwana wa mwanduso wa iwang'olo. IMNDEWA kanoghelesighwa na nambiko ya Abeli, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />lekeni ng'anoghelesighwe baye na Kaini wala nambiko yake. Apfo Kaini kona maya ghendo na chihanga chake ching'onang'ona. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Kaini, “Ule kuna maya? Ule chihanga chako ching'onang'ona? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Angu ungatenda ghanoghile, ng'utsotogholighwa baye? Lekeni kwaapfila kutenda ghehile, nzambi yamlibani mwako, yobama ikulongotse, lekeni kobamighwa uihume.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Kuya Kaini kamlongela Abeli ndughu yake, “Tuke kumghunda.” Hawang'ali mna mghunda, Kaini kamuhundukila, kamtowa Abeli ndughu yake, kamkoma.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamghutsa Kaini, “Alikwani ndughu yako Abeli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Kaini kedika, “Simanyile baye. Apfi nene na mwimilitsi wake?” <verse eid="GEN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamghutsa, “Utendile choni? Tegheletsa! Idamu ya ndughu yako yondilila kulawa mna lidongo. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Lelo ghweghwe kulanighwa na ng'utsolima mna lidongo linoghile ilighubule mlomo wake kubokela idamu ya ndughu yako yumkomile. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Haulima lidongo ng'alitsokwelekela baye ghamatsawo. Kutsakwangakwanga na ng'utsakuwa na hanu ha kukala baye muisi.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kaini kamlongela Imtwatsa, “Anzabu ino ndito ng'ani sidaha baye kuidudumila. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Leloli kuniwinga kulawa mna lidongo linoghile na nitsokala kutali naghwe, nitsakwangakwanga na nitsakuwa nahela hanu ho kukala muisi, na imunu wowose iyatsombona katsonikoma.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Bae, imunu iyatsokukoma ghweghwe, katsodununzighwa mala saba kubita ghweghwe.” Kuya IMNDEWA kamwika chitango Kaini, imunu ang'amwona aleke kumkoma. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Apfo Kaini koka hambele he Imulungu, kaghenda kukala mna isi ya Nodi ubali wa kumoso wa Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Kaini kawasa ne mwehe wake, naye mwehe wake kakinda inda kamweleka Enoki. Kuya Kaini kandusa kutsenga ghumji, na kaghukema ghumji agho Enoki, taghwa lya imwanaghe. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Enoki kamweleka Iradi, naye Iradi kamweleka Mehuyaeli, Mehuyaeli kamweleka Metushaeli, naye Metushaeli kamweleka Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameki tsakakwela iwapinga weli, yumwe tsakakemighwa Ada, na yungi tsakakemighwa Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada kamweleka Yabali, Yabali iyakalile mtsehe we iwanu wala iwofugha iwanyama na kukala mna pfibumbulika. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Ndughu yake tsakakala Yabali, iyakalile aba wa wose iwotowa pfilimba na pfimbeta. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Sila kamweleka Tubalikaini, iyakalile mhunzi wa shaba na chuma. Lumbu wake Tubalikaini tsakakala Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lameki kawalongela wehe tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada na Sila, mnitegheletse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">mwemwe wehe wa Lameki ulikeni mbuli tsangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Nene tsanimkoma imunu kwaapfila kandagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">tsanimkoma msongolo kwa kundagha.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Kaini ang'alihighwa mala saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">kuya Lameki katsolihighwa mala sabini na saba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seti na Enoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adamu kawasa keli na mwehe wake Eva, naye keleka imwana mmale, kamkema Seti, kalonga, “Imulungu kangaya mwana yungi hanu ha Abeli, kwaapfila Kaini tsakamkoma.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Seti keleka imwana, tsakamkema Enoshi. Kulawa baho iwanu wanza kulilomba taghwa lya Imtwatsa.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Adamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Aluno lukolo lwa Adamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 5:1">Imulungu hayamlumbile imunu, kamlumba yeghale naye mwenyegho. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Kawalumba immale ne ipinga, kawabaliki. Na hayawalumbile kawakema taghwa lyawo “Iwanu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adamu hayang'ali na miyaka miya imwe na selasini, keleka imwana yeghalile naye, yane chihanga ka chake, kamkema Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Kulawa hayoneke Seti, Adamu tsakakala na miyaka miya nane, kuya keleka iwana wangi iwamale ne iwapinga. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Imiaka yose yakalile Adamu muisi tsaikala miyaka miya tisa selasini, kuya kafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Seti hayang'ali na miyaka miya imwe na mitano, kamweleka Enoshi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Kulawa hayoneke Enoshi Seti tsakakala imiyaka ingi miya nane na saba. Keleka iwana wangi wamale na mapinga. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Imiaka yose yakalile Seti muisi tsaikala miyaka miya tisa na kumi na mili, kuya kafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Enoshi hayang'ali na miyaka tisini, kamweleka Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Kulawa hayoneke Kenani, Enoshi tsakakala muisi miyaka miya nane kumi na mitano. Kuya keleka iwana wangi wamale na mapinga. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Imiyaka yose yakalile Enoshi muisi tsaikala miya tisa na mitano, kuya kafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Kenani hayang'ali na miyaka sabini, kamweleka Mahalaleli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Kulawa hayoneke Mahalaleli Kenani tsakakala miyaka miya nane na alubaini. Kuya keleka iwana wangi wamale na mapinga. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Imiyaka yose yakalile Kenani muisi tsaikala miyaka miya tisa na kumi, kuya kafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Mahalaleli hayang'ali na miyaka sitini na mitano, kamweleka Yaredi. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Mahalaleli tsakakala miyaka miya nane na selasini kulawa honeke Yaredi. Kuya keleka iwana wangi wamale na mapinga. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Imiyaka yose yakalile Mahalaleli muisi tsaikala miyaka miya nane na tisini na tano, kuya kafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Yaredi hayang'ali na miyaka miya imwe na sitini na mili, kamweleka Henoki. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Yaredi tsakakala miyaka miya nane, kuya keleka iwana wangi wamale ne iwapinga. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yaredi tsakakala miyaka miya tisa na sitini na mili, kuya kafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Enoki hayang'ali na miyaka sitini na mitano, kamweleka Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Na hayamweleke Metusela, Enoki tsakakala pfinoghile ne Imulungu kwa miyaka miya tatu, kuya keleka iwana wangi wamale na mapinga. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Enoki tsakakala miyaka miya tatu sitini na mitano. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Enoki tsakakala pfinoghile ne Imulungu, kuya iwanu ng'awamwonile keli baye, kwaapfila Imulungu tsakamsola.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Metusela hayang'ali na miyaka miya imwe na semanini na saba, kamweleka Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Na hayamweleke Lameki, Metusela tsakakala na miyaka miya saba semanini na mili, kuya keleka iwana wangi wamale na mapinga. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Metusela tsakakala miyaka miya tisa na sitini na tisa, kuya kafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Lameki hayang'ali na miyaka miya imwe na semanini na mili, keleka imwana. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Tsakamkema imwana ayo Nuhu, kalonga, “Imwana yuno katsotukanza mna sang'ano tsetu ng'omu tsatusang'ana kwa ghamoko ghetu mna lidongo ililighitighwe ne Imulungu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Nuhu hayaelekighwe, Lameki tsakakala miyaka miya tano na tisini na mitano, kuya keleka iwana wangi wamale na mapinga. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Lameki tsakakala miyaka miya saba sabini na saba, kuya kafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Nuhu hayang'ali na miyaka miya tano, kamweleka Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Ghehile gha iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Iwanu hawongetseke muisi na kweleka iwana mapinga, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />iwana we Imulungu tsawawona iwana we iwanu wanogha, na chila yumwe kamkwela yula iyamsaghule. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Kuya IMNDEWA kalonga, “Sitsowaleka baye iwanu wakale ghamatsuwa ghose, watsakufa. Kulawa sambi na kughendelela ng'awatsokala baye kubita miyaka miya imwe na ishirini.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Mna ghamatsuwa ghala, hata hambele muisi tsakukala ne mitsinu mikulu iyelekighwe ne iwana we Imulungu iwawasile ne iwana mapinga we iwanu. Awo iwo iwanu iwakalile wane ngupfu na iwamanyike ghamatsuwa agho. Tsawakemighwa Wanefili.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />IMNDEWA kawona iwanu wotenda ghehile ng'ani na ghose ghawokwalangula mna mimoyo yawo gheha ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />IMNDEWA kaghanzika ng'ani kumlumba imunu muisi, na kona usungu sideke mmoyo mwake. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Apfo IMNDEWA kalonga, “Nitsowakoma iwanu wose yaniwalumbile iwali muisi, pfipfila nitsowakoma iwanyama na pfilumbe iwotambala na iwapfideghe. Nakona usungu kwaapfila tsaniwalumba muisi.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Lekeni Nuhu tsakoneka kanogha kwe IMNDEWA.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Aino mbuli ya Nuhu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 6:9">Nuhu tsakakala imunu yanoghile yaliheka, tsakakala kahela totso mna ghamatsuwa ghake. Yang'ali yokala pfinoghile ne Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nuhu tsakakala ne iwana wadatu, Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Imulungu kayona isi iha ghendo, imema ughobo. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Imulungu kailola isi, kayona ikala iha, kwaapfila iwanu wose wang'ali wokala pfihile.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Apfo Imulungu kamlongela Nuhu, “Nitsowakoma iwanu wose iwali muisi, kwaapfila woimemesa ughobo isi yose. Nolongesa nitsowakoma wose na isi yose. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Apfo witsengele safina kwa mbiki wa mmingo, utende pfiheleto mghati mwake na uibakatse lami mghati na kunze. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Uitsenge pfino. Utali wake mita mia imwe selasini na tisa, ughatsi wake mita ishilini na tano na kulawa hasi mbaka mchanya iwe mita kumi na tano. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Safina ayo iwe na kano ndatu, ya kuchanya, ya haghati na ya kuhisi, na wike libani mlubapfu. Wike nusu mita mghati mwe chiswili na kano. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Ulole, nitsoghala gharika muisi mwose, kuwakoma iwapfilumbe wose iwali muisi. Ichinu chochose ichili muisi chitsakufa. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Lekeni nitsakwika laghano na ghweghwe, kutsakwingila mna safina, ghweghwe na mwehe wako na iwanagho hamwe ne iwapinga wawo. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Uwaghale mna safina wapfilumbe weli weli, immale ne ipinga, ili wawe waghima hamwe naghwe. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Usole wapfideghe weli weli wa chila aina, wanyama weli weli wa chila aina na awala iwotambala weli weli, ili wawe waghima hamwe naghwe. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Usole pfijo pfose na wikile chijo kwaajili yenu na kwaajili yawo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nuhu katenda ka Imulungu pfayamlaghitse.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Nuhu, “Wingile mna safina, ghwegwe ne iwanu wose wa kaye yako, kwaapfila nikwona ghweghwe uliheka iutenda ghanoghile mna isi yose. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Uwasole iwanyama wose yaniwatoghole kwa nambiko, mmale ne pinga wawe saba saba, lekeni iwanyama yanisiwatoghola kwa nambiko, uwasole weli weli, immale ne ipinga. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Pfipfila uwasole iwapfideghe wose mmale ne pinga wawe saba saba, ili waghendelele kweleka keli muisi. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Ghamatsuwa saba kulawa leloli nitsoilekelela imvula itowe kwa ghamatsuwa alubaini, chilo na misi, nitsowakoma iwapfilumbe wose yaniwalumbile.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Nuhu kaghatenda ghose ka Imulungu pfayamlaghitse.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Nuhu tsakakala na miyaka miya sita gharika haitsile muisi. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Nuhu, mwehe wake, iwanaghe ne iwapinga wawo wengila mna safina ng'ana gharika itse. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Wanyama iwadeghete na yangawadeghete, iwapfideghe na iwapfilumbe wose iwotambala, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />weli weli, immale ne ipinga, wengila mghati mwa safina hamwe na Nuhu, ka Imulungu pfayamlaghitse Nuhu. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Ghamatsuwa saba haghabitile, ghamatsi gha gharika ghanza kuighubika isi.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Nuhu hayang'ali na miyaka miya sita, mna litsuwa lya kumi na saba ghumwetsi ghwa kabili, mbwibwi tsose itsighendese hasi tsilapfa ghamatsi, na kulanga tsakufughuka. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Imvula tsaitowa kwa ghamatsuwa alubaini chilo ne misi. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Mna litsuwa lilila Nuhu na mwehe wake na iwanaghe, Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti na wehe tsawo wadatu wengila mna safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Wengila hamwe na iwanyama wose wa kumuhulo, iwanyama wose wa kupfughighwa, iwanyama wose iwotambala na iwapfideghe wose. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Iwanyama wose iwaghima tsawengila weli weli mna safina hamwe na Nuhu. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Iwanyama wose iwengile tsawakala mmale ne ipinga, ka Imulungu pfayamlaghitse Nuhu. Kuya IMNDEWA kamuhindila.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Gharika ighendelela kwa ghamatsuwa alubaini, ghamatsi ghamema na safina yelela mchanya mwa isi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Ghamatsi ghaghendelela kumema muisi na safina yelela mchanya mwake. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Ghamatsi ghamema ng'ani mna isi, ghaighubika imighongo yose mitali. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Ghamatsi ghamema, imighongo ighubikighwa ka ghamoko kumi na mitano. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Iwapfilumbe wose iwakalile muisi, iwapfideghe, iwanyama iwofughighwa, iwanyama wa kumuhulo, iwapfilumbe wose iwokala muisi ne iwanu wose tsawafa. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Chila chinu chine ughima ichikalile muisi isakale chifa. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Imulungu kawakoma iwapfilumbe wose iwali muisi isakale, iwanu, iwanyama na iwapfideghe. Tsakasighala Nuhu yaliyeka na awala iwengile naye mna safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Ghamatsi agho tsaghakala muisi ghamatsuwa miya imwe na hamsini.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Ghamatsi gha gharika ghonyala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Lekeni Imulungu ng'amsemwile baye Nuhu na iwanyama wa kumuhulo na iwanyama wa kufughighwa iwakalile hamwe naye mna safina, Imulungu kaghala libeho, ghamatsi ghandusa kunyala. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Mana tsimbwibwi itsighendese ma tsatsihindighwa na kulanga tsakuhindighwa, na imvula ma ileka kutowa. <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />Ghamatsi ghaghendelela kunyala lughalugha na haghabitile ghamatsuwa miya imwe na hamsini ghamatsi tsaghauhunguka ng'ani. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Mna litsuwa lya kumi na saba mna ghumwetsi wa saba, safina tsaipfika mna ipfidunda pfa Ararati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Ghamatsi ghaghendelela kunyala lughalugha, na litsuwa lya mwanduso lya ghumwetsi ghwa kumi, pfidando tsapfoneka.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Ghamatsuwa alubaini haghabitile, Nuhu tsakapfughula dilisha lyekile mna safina, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />kamlapfa bondwa kunze, naye ng'oyile baye, kaghuluka ghuluka mbaka ghamatsi haghanyalile. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Kuya kamtuma njiwa aghende kulola ka ghamatsi ghanyala mna isi. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Lekeni njiwa ng'onile baye hanu hu ukughwa kwaapfila isi yose tsaighubikighwa na ghamatsi, apfo koya kwa Nuhu kune safina. Nuhu kagholosa ghumoko ghwake kamsola kamwingitsa mna safina. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Kabetetsa ghamatsuwa ghangi saba, kuya kamlapfa keli njiwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Njiwa hayoile mihe ila, katsa na tsani bisi lya mtsaituni mna mlomo wake! Apfo Nuhu kamanya ka ghamatsi ghanyala. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Nuhu kabetetsa ghamatsuwa ghangi saba, kamtuma keli njiwa, lekeni njiwa ng'oyile keli baye.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Nuhu hayakalile na miyaka miya sita na ghumwe, mna litsuwa lya mwanduso lya ghumwetsi ghwa mwanduso, ghamatsi tsaghanyala muisi. Nuhu tsakaghubula chighubiko cha safina, na hayalolile, kona isi isakala. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Na ghumwetsi ghwa kabili, mna litsuwa lya ishirini na saba isi tsaisakala ghendo.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Kuya Imulungu kamlongela Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Lawa mna safina, ghweghwe na mwehe wako, na iwanagho na wehe tsawo. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Uwalapfe iwapfideghe wose wane ughima, iwanyama wose, iwapfilumbe iwotambala muisi ili weleke ng'ani, wongetseke na kwenela muisi.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Apfo Nuhu kalawa na mwehe wake na iwanaghe hamwe na wehe tsawo. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Iwanyama wose, iwapfilumbe wose iwotambala muisi na iwapfideghe wose, walawa mna safina ka pfawali.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu komlapfila Imulungu nambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Kuya Nuhu kamtsengela IMNDEWA hanu ha kulapfila inambiko ha ghamabwe, kasola chila imnyama yadeghete na chideghe yadeghete, kamlapfila Imulungu nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa hanu hakutambikila. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Inambiko ila imnung'ila ghoya IMNDEWA kuya kelongela mwenyegho, “Sitsoilighita keli baye iisi kwaajili ya imunu, kwaapfila nomanya aghala ighali mna ghumoyo ghwake gheha kulawa udodo wake. Sitsowahinya keli iwapfilumbe wose, ka pfanendile. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Ka isi pfaikala, ghamatsuwa ghose kutsakuwa na msimu ghwa kuhanda na msimu ghwa kupfuna, wa beho na iutsumbuke, chipfeghetsi na chihangatsi, imisi na ichilo.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu kakwika laghano na Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Kuya Imulungu kambaliki Nuhu na iwanaghe, kawalongela, “Mweleke, mwongetseke, muimemese isi. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Iwanyama wose, iwapfideghe, iwasomba na iwanyama iwotambala watsompfukani mwemwe, wose wamna ghamoko ghenu. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Iwanyama wose watsakuwa chijo chenu, nomwing'ani ka pfaniweng'ile imimeya kuwa chijo chenu. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Lekeni mleke kuja nyama ine idamu, nomghomani kwaapfila ughima wamna idamu. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Imunu wowose ang'amkoma miyaghe, katsohighighwa. Nitsomuhigha kwa kumkoma, imnyama wowose iyomkoma imunu.<verse eid="GEN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Wowose iyomkoma imunu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:6">katsokomighwa ne imunu yungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:6">kwaapfila Imulungu kamlumba imunu kwa kwighala naye.<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />“Namwe mweleke, mwongetseke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:7">mweleke ng'ani, mwongetseke muisi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Imulungu kamlongela Nuhu ne iwanaghe, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Lelo nakwika laghano lyangu namwe na iwatsukulu wenu <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />na chila ichilumbe ichili hamwe na mwemwe, iwapfideghe, iwanyama wa kufughighwa na wa kumuhulo, na awala wose iwalawile namwe mna safina. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Nakwika laghano na mwemwe, Sitsowakoma keli baye iwapfilumbe wose wane ughima kwa gharika, gharika ng'alitsoihinya keli baye isi.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Imulungu kalonga, “Achino chicho chitango cha laghano lyanikwika nene na mwemwe na chila chiumbe ichili hamwe na mwemwe kwa pfeleko pfose ipfikutsa. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Nakwika uminde wa mvula mna ghamawingu, nawo utsakuwa chitango cha laghano lyangu na isi. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Hanu hohose hanighala ghamabingu muisi na upinde wa mvula hautsolawila mna ghamabingu, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />nitsolikumbuka lilaghano lyangu na mwemwe na iwapfilumbe wose wane ughima. Gharika ng'alitsowakoma keli baye iwapfilumbe wose. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Uminde wa mvula hautsolawila, nitsowona na kukumbuka laghano lyangu lya ghamatsuwa ghose na iwapfilumbe wose iwali muisi. <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Achino chitsakuwa chitango cha laghano lyanyikile na iwapfilumbe wose muisi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wa Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Iwana wa Nuhu iwalawile mna safina tsawakala Shemu Hamu na Yafeti. Hamu kakala aba wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Awo iwo iwana wadatu wa Nuhu, na kubitila wawo iwanu wose wenela muisi.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Nuhu iyo iyanzile kulima, tsakahanda mitsabibu, <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Nuhu hayanwele dipfai, kapatika, katsula maghwanda ghake, kawasa chidako mna chibumbulika chake. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Hamu, aba wake Kanaani, hayamwonile aba wake kachidako, kalawa kunze kawalongela ndughu tsake weli. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Lekeni Shemu na Yafeti wasola lighwanda walika mmahegha mwawo, kuya waghenda chisoghosogho, wamghubika aba wawo. Pfihanga pfawo pfihundukila kungi, waleke kumwona aba yawo pfayali chidako. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Nuhu hayalamke na hayamanyile mwanaghe mdodo pfayamtendele, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Kanaani yalanighwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Katsakuwa imtumighwa wa ndughu tsake.”<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Kuya kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">“Yatunitsighwe Imtwatsa, Imulungu wa Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaani katsakuwa imtumwa wa Shemu.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Imulungu yamwongetsele Yafeti watsukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">awatende watsukulu wake wakale ne iwanu wa Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanaani katsakuwa imtumwa wa Yafeti.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Kulawa gharika haimalile Nuhu tsakakala miyaka 350. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Kuya kafa hakalile na miyaka 950.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Watsukulu wa Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Gharika haimalile iwana wa Nuhu, Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti weleka iwana. Awano iwo watsukulu wa Nuhu.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Iwana wa Yafeti tsawakala Gomeri, Magogu, Madai, Yavani, Tubali, Mesheki na Tirasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Iwana wa Gomeri tsawakala Ashikenazi, Rifati na Togoma. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Iwana wa Yavani tsawakala Elisha, Tarishishi, Kitimu na Dodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Iwanu wano iwo iwabala we iwanu iwakalile kumwani, chila iwanu kwa chilugha chake, kwa kolo tsawo, na kwa isi tsawo.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Hamu tsakaweleka Kushi, Misiri, Putu na Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Naye Kushi kaweleka Seba, Havila, Sabita, Raama na Sabiteka. Raama kaweleka Sheba na Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kushi kamweleka Nimrodi, Kushi tsakakala imunu wa mwanduso yane ngupfu muisi. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Imulungu tsakamwapfila Nimrodi, naye tsakakala munu iyowinda yane ngupfu, apfo iwanu tsawalonga, “IMNDEWA yakutende muwinda mkulu ka Nimrodi.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Undewa wake wanzila Babiloni, Ereku, Akadi, Kaline na Shinari. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Kulawa ako Nimrodi kaghenda isi ya Ashuru, katsenga imiji ya Ninawi, Rehobotiri na Kala <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />na Reseni ighuli mghati mwa Ninawi na ghumji mkulu ghwa Kala.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Misiri tsakaweleka Waludi, Waanamu, Walehabi, Wanafutuhi, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Wapatirusi, Wakasiluhi, ako kuko kwawalawile Wafilisti na Wakafitori.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanaani kamweleka imwanaghe chaudele, iyakemighwe Sidoni, na Wahiti, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />na Wayebusi na Waamori na Waarigishi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Wahaviti na Wamwariki na Wasini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Warivadi na Wasemari na Wahamati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 10:18">Hambele kolo tsa Wakanaani tsipwililika, <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />ghumbaka ghwa Wakanaani ghwanzila Sidoni ughenda mbaka Gerasi na Gaza, kuya ughendelela Sodoma, Gomora, Adima, Seboimu na Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Hawano iwo iwana wa Hamu, chila yumwe tsakakala mna isi yake, na chila yumwe tsakana likabila lyake na yang'ali yolonga ilugha yake.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Shemu, ndughu mkulu wa Yafeti, tsakamweleka Waeburaniya wose. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Pfipfila tsakamweleka Elamu, Ashuru, Aripakisadi, Ludi na Aramu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Aramu tsakamweleka Usi, Huli Getari na Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Aripakisadi kamweleka Sela, Sela kamweleka Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Eberi tsakana iwana weli, imwanaghe chaudele tsakamkema Pelegi kwaapfila ghamatsuwa agho muisi iwanu tsaweghola, na imwana wa kabili tsakamkema Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yokitani tsakamweleka Alimodadi Shelefu, Hasarimaweti na Yera, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadoramu, Usali na Dikila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obali, Abimaeli na Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofiri, Hawila na Yobabu. Awano wose tsawakala iwana wa Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Isi yawakalile tsayandusila Mesha mbaka Sefari, ubali wa kwalilawila litsua mna isi ya pfidunda. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Hawano iwana wa Shemu, chila yumwe tsakakala na lugha yawo na isi yawo.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Aluno lukolo lwa iwana wa Nuhu, kwa pfeleko pfawo mna isi tsawo. Kulawila mna isi tsino, iwanu tsawenela muisi mwose gharika halimalile.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Ghumnara ghwa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Isi yose tsaikaka na ilugha imwe na ukulonga kwao tsakukala kumwe. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Iwanu hawang'ali woghenda ubali wa kwalilawila litsua, tsawapfika mna chiwala cha Babiloni kuya tsawakala kuko. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Welongela, “Leka, tufatule matofali tughoke pfinoghile.” Ng'awatsengele baye ghamabwe na chokaa, ila tsawatsengela matofali na lami. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Walonga, “Leka twitsengele ghumji na mnara ghupfike kulanga, ili taghwa lyetu limanyike, tuleke kupwililika mna isi yose.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Kuya IMNDEWA kahulumka hasi, kona ghumji na mnara ighutsengighwe ne iwanu. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />IMNDEWA kalonga, “Iwanu wano wolonga lugha imwe na wandusa kutenda pfino, apfo wodaha kutenda chochose chawobama. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Leka tuhulumke hasi tuitiwanyitse lugha yawo ili waleke kwihulikitsa.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Apfo IMNDEWA kawapwililisa muisi mwose, nawo waleka kutsenga ghumji. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Ghumji ghula tsaghukemighwa Babeli, kwaapfila ako Imulungu tsakaitiwanyitsa lugha yose, ako kawapwililisa iwanu chila hanu muisi mwose.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wa Shemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Aghuno mweleko ghwa Shemu. Miyaka mili kulawa gharika haimalile, Shemu hayang'ali miyaka miya, tsakamweleka Arifakisadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Hayamweleke Arifakisadi, Shemu tsakakala keli miyaka miya tano, kuya kaweleka iwana wangi iwamale ne iwapinga.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Arifakisadi hayapfikile na miyaka salasini na tano, kamweleka Shela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Hayamweleke Shela, Arifakisadi tsakakala keli miyaka mia nne na midatu.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Shela hayapfikile miyaka salasini, kamweleka Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Hayamweleke Eberi, Shela kakala keli miyaka miya nne na midatu, kuya keleka iwana wangi iwamale ne iwapinga.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Eberi hayapfikile miyaka salasini na mine, kamweleka Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Eberi hayamweleke Pelegi, kakala keli miyaka miya ndatu na salasini. kuya keleka iwana wangi iwamale ne iwapinga.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Pelegi hayapfikile miyaka selasini kamweleka Reu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Pelegi hayamweleke Reu, tsakakala keli miyaka miya mbili na tisa kuya keleka iwana wangi, iwamale ne iwapinga.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Reu hayapfikile miyaka selasini na mili, kamweleka Serugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Reu tsakakala keli miyaka miya mbili na saba kuya keleka iwana wangi, iwamale ne iwapinga.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Serugi hayapfikile miyaka selasini, kamweleka Nahori. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Kuya Serugi tsakakala keli miyaka miya mbili kuya keleka iwana wangi, iwamale ne iwapinga.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Nahori hayapfikile na miyaka ishirini na tisa, tsakamweleka Tera. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Nahori tsakakala keli miyaka miya imwe kumi na tisa kuya keleka iwana wangi, iwamale ne iwapinga.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Tera hayapfikile miyaka sabini, kamweleka Abramu, Nahori na Harani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wa Tera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Auno mweleko wa Tera. Tera kamweleka Abramu, Nahori na Harani. Harani tsakamweleka Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Harani tsakafila Uri isi ya Wakalidayo, hanu hayelekighwe, aku aba wake yang'ali mghima. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Abramu na Nahori tsawakwela. Pinga wa Abramu tsakakemighwa Sarai na pinga wa Nahori tsakakemighwa Milika, Milika tsakakala neghe Harani, Halani pfipfila tsakakala aba wa Isika. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Sarai tsakakala tasa, tsakahela iwana.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Tera kamsola Abramu iyali imwanaghe, na mtsukulu wake, Loti imwana wa Harani, na mwalifala wake Sarai, pinga wa Abramu, wose tsawalawa Uri isi ya Wakalidayo waghenda Kanaani. Lekeni hawapfikile Harani, wakala baho. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tera kafila Harani aku kana miyaka miya mbili na mitano.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu komkema Abramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Imulungu kamlongela Abramu, “Uileke isi yako, ndughu tsako, na kaye ya aba wako, ughende kune isi yanitsokulangusa. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Nitsokutenda ghweghwe uwe ne iwanu wengi, na nitsolitenda taghwa lyako limanyike. Naghwe kutsakuwa ibalaka. <verse eid="GEN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Nitsowabaliki iwanu iwokubaliki, lekeni nitsowalighita iwanu iwokulighita. Kubitila ghweghwe iwanu wose iwali muisi watsobalikiighwa.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Apfo Abramu koka ka Imulungu pfayamlongele, na Loti tsakaghenda naye. Abram hayalawile Harani tsakana miyaka sabini na tano. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Abramu kamsola mwehe wake Sarai na Loti imwana wa ndughu yake, na ipfinu pfake pfose ne iwanu wose iyawapatile mna isi ya Harani, nawo woka waghenda Kanaani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:5">Kuya hawengile mna isi ayo. <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abramu tsakabita mna isi ayo mbaka kapfika Shekemu, hanu haenzeluke hane Mbiki mkulu ghwa Mole. Ghamatsuwa agho Wakanaani wang'ali wokala mna isi ila. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Imulungu kamlawila Abramu, kamlongela, “Nitsoweng'a iwanagho isi ino.” Apfo Abramu kamtsengela Imulungu iyamlawile hanu ha kulapfila inambiko ha ghamabwe.<verse eid="GEN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Hambele Abramu koka kaghenda mna isi ya pfidunda iili ubali wa kwalilawila litsua wa Beseli, ako keka hema lyake, tsakakala haghati mwa ghumji ghwa Beseli na ghumji ghwa Ai. Baho kamtsengela Imulungu hanu ha kulapfila inambiko kuya kamtambikila. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Kuya Abramu kaghendelela kuka mbaka kapfika Negebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abramu koghenda Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Mna isi ila tsakulawila nzala, nzala ayo tsang'ulu sideke, Apfo Abramu kahulumka, kaghenda Misiri yakakale ako chidogho. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Abramu hayang'ali kahabehi kwingila Misiri, kamlongela mwehe wake Sarai, “Nomanya ghweghwe kwa ipinga unoghile. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Wamisiri hawatsokwona, watsolonga ‘Ayuno mwehe wake,’ kuya watsonikoma lekeni ghweghwe watsokuleka mghima. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Chonde chonde uwalongele ghweghwe kwa lumbu wangu, watsonendela ghoya na nene nitsokala mghima.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Baho Abramu hayengile Misiri, Wamisiri wamwona Sarai kanogha ng'ani. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Iwakulu wa Farao hawamwonile Sarai, wamlongela Farao ipinga ayo pfayanoghile, Apfo Sarai kaghalighwa mng'anda mwa imfalume. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Kwa ukunogha kwake Sarai, Farao kamtendela pfinoghile Abramu kamwing'a Abramu iwang'olo, iwasenga, iwapunda, iwatumwa na iwangamiya.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Lekeni Imulungu kamdununza Farao kwa kumghalila utamu mkulu, yeye ne iwanu iwali mkaye mwake kwa kumsola Sarai, mwehe wa Abramu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Kuya Farao kamkema Abramu, kamghutsa, “Ebali unendele pfino? Ule ng'unongele baye ka Sarai mwehe wako? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Ule tsakulonga ayuno ka lumbu wako, na nene nimsola yawe ipinga wangu? Lelo ayuno ano ipinga wako, umsole mke!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Kuya Farao kalaghitsa iwanu wake, nawo wamghala kunzila Abramu, wamlapfa Misiri hamwe ne ipinga wake na ipfinu pfake pfose.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Abramu na Loti webaghula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Abramu koya kulawa Misiri, kagheluka kaghenda Negeb u, hamwe na mwehe wake na ipfinu pfose pfayalinapfo, kaghenda hamwe na Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Abramu tsakana mali nyingi, iwanyama, fetsa na nzahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Kalawa Negebu kapfosa chila hanu mbaka kapfika Beseli. Kapfika kwatsibakanile isi ya Beseli na Ai, hanu hala hayatsengile lihema. <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />Kuko kwayatsengile hanu he kulapfila nambiko, kuko Abramu hayamlombile Imulungu kwa kulikema taghwa lyake.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Pfipfila Loti tsakelengotsa na Abramu, naye tsakana iwang'olo wengi, iwang'ombe na mahema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Lekeni isi ila ng'aiwenele baye kwa Abramu na Loti kukala hamwe kwaapfila tsawana pfinu pfingi na wanyama wawo tsawengi ng'ani. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Apfo wadimi wa Abramu na wadimi wa Loti tsawesonga. Ghamatsuwa agho Wakanaani na Waperizi tsawakala wenyekaye wa isi ila.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Kuya Abramu kamlongela Lutu, “Tuleke kwisonga nene na ghweghwe, wala wadimi wangu na wadimi wako, mana twetwe twandughu. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Lola isi ili hambele hako. Chonde chonde, twibaghule. Ung'aghenda ghumoko wa kumoso, nene noghenda ghumoko wa kujilo, ung'aghenda ghumoko wa kujilo, nene noghenda ghumoko wa kumoso.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Loti kenula tsinenge tsake, kona lwanda lwose lwa Yoridani, tsalukala na ghamatsi mengi chila hanu, ka konde lya Imulungu na ka isi ya Misiri kumwambu mwa Soari. Aho ng'ana Imulungu aihighe imiji ya Sodoma na Gomora. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Apfo Loti kesaghulila ulwanda lwose lwa Yoridani, kaghendelela ubali wa kwalilawila litsua. Apfo pfipfo wanu wano weli pfawebaghule. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abramu tsakakala mna isi ya Kanaani na Loti tsakakala mna mibululu ya ulwanda ula, kuya katsenga mahema ghake habehi na Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Lekeni iwanu wa Sodoma tsaweha ghendo na wang'ali womtendela Imulungu nzambi nyingi.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abramu koghenda Heburoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Loti hayebaghule na Abramu, Imulungu kamlongela Abramu, “Inula nenge tsako kulawa aho ahuli, ulole ubali wa kuchanya na ubali we kuhisi, ubali wa kwalilawila litsua na ubali wa kwaliswela litsua. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Isi yose yauyona nitsokwing'a ghweghwe na watsukulu wako iwe yenu ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Nitsokwing'a watsukulu wengi ka litimbwisi lili muisi, ka apfila pfakuli haduhu imunu iyodaha kulipeta litimbwisi, apfo pfipfo pfakutsakuwa kuduhu imunu iyodaha kuwapeta watsukulu wako. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Lelo winuke, ughende ukayangile isi ino, ukalole ina ughatsi wachi na utali wachi kwaapfila nitsokwing'a ghweghwe isi ino.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Apfo Abramu kabula mahema ghake, kaghenda kukala habehi ne imibiki mikulu ya Mamre iili ako Heburoni, ako Abramu kamtsengela Imulungu hanu ha kulapfila nambiko.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Abramu komkombola Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Ghamatsuwa agho, mfalume Amrafeli wa Shinari, mfalume Arioko wa Elasari, mfalume Kedorilaomeri wa Elamu na mfalume Tidali wa Goimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />waghenda kwitowa na Bera mfalume wa Sodoma, Birisha mfalume wa Gomora, Shinabu mfalume wa Adima, Shemeberi mfalume wa Seboimu na mfalume wa Bela iikemighwe Soari. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Wandewa wano wose wetingana hamwe mna ulwanda lwa Sidimu, hane Bahari ya Munyu. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Kwa miyaka kumi na mili wang'ali womtumikila Kedorilaomari, lekeni mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na tatu walema kumtumikila. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Mna ghumwaka wa kumi na nne, Kedorilaomeri na wandewa iwelungile naye, kawatowa Warefai ako Ashitaroti Karinaumu, Wazuzi ako Hamu, Waemi ako Shawe Kiriatamu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />Wahori mna chidunda cha isi ya Seiri, wawawinga mbaka Eliparani habehi na nyika <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Kuya woya, waghenda Enimishipati, isi ya Kadeshi, waitowa isi yose ya Waamaleki, na kuwatowa Waamori iwakalile Hasasoni Tamari.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Kuya mfalume wa Sodoma, mfalume wa Gomora, mfalume wa Adima, mfalume wa Seboiimu, mfalume wa Bela au Soari waghenda mna Ulwanda lwa Sidimu <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />kwitowa na Kedolaomeri mfalume wa Elamu, Tidali mfalume wa Goiimu, Amrafeli mfalume wa Shinari, Arioko mfalume wa Elasari, wandewa wane wetowa na wandewa watano. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Ulwanda lwa Sidimu tsaumema ghamapondo gha lami, na iwandewa wa Sodoma na Gomora hawabamile kutsuma, wangi waghwila mna ghamapomdo lekeni wangi watsumila mpfidunda. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Wandewa wala wane tsawasola tsimali tsose na pfijo pfao pfose pfa Sodoma na Gomora, kuya woka. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Pfipfila wamsola Lutu, imwana wa ndughu yake Abramu, iyang'ali yokala Sodoma hamwe na tsimali tsake tsose, woka tsao.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Lekeni imunu yumwe iyahoneke, kaghenda kumlongela ayula Muheburaniya Abramu, iyang'ali yokala habehi na imibiki mikulu ya Mamre Mwaamori, ndughu yake Eshikoli na Aneri, wose tsawelunga ne Abramu.<verse eid="GEN 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Abramu hayahulike ka mwana wa ndughu yake kaghoghighwa na kasolighwa, kalawa na iwanu wake miya ndatu kumi na nane iwalangulitsighwe kwitowa pfinoghile iwelekighwe mkaye mwake, kawawinzilitsa mbaka Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Nechilo chicho Abramu kawaghola iwanu wake wakawatowe iwanu awo, wawatowa na wawawinga mbaka Hoba, ubali wa kuchang'a wa Damasikasi. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Apfo koyitsa mali tsose na kamuyitsa Loti ndughu yake na mali tsake, hamwe na iwapinga na iwanu wangi.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melikisedeki kombaliki Abramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Abramu hayoile kumtowa Kedorilaomeri na wandewa weyaghe, mfalume wa Sodoma tsakalawa yaketingane naye ako kune Ulwanda lwa Imfalume. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Kuya Melikisedeki mfalume wa Salemu, kaghala chighate na dipfai. Melikisedeki tsakakala mlapfa nambiko wa Imulungu iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani, <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />kambaliki Abramu, kamlongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:19">“Abramu kubalikighighwa ne Imulungu iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:19">iyalumbile isi na lilanga.<verse eid="GEN 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Yatunitsighwe Imulungu iyali Kuchang'a Ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:20">iyakwapfile kuwahuma awala iwokwihila.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 14:20">Kuya Abramu kalapfa lifungu lya kumi mna ipfinu pfake pfayalinapfo.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Imfalume wa Sodoma kamlongela Abramu, “Sola mali yose lekeni ungaye iwanu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Abramu kamwidika imfalume wa Sodoma, “Nelaha kwe Imulungu iyali Kuchang'a Ng'ani, iyalumbile isi na lilanga, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />sisola baye ichinu chochose kulawa kuna ghweghwe, hata lutsi au lutsabi lwa mikwabatsa, ili uleke kulonga, ‘Nimtenda Abramu yawe na mali.’ <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Sitsosola chinu chochose kulawa kuna ghweghwe ila pfinu pfawajile iwanu wangu na pfinu pfa iwanu iwaghendile na nene, Aneri, Eshikoli na Mamre, waleke wasole pfinu pfawo.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu kelaghana na Abramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Hambele, imbuli ye Imulungu tsaimtsila Abramu mna ghamaono, “Abramu uleke kupfuka, nene nitsokukinga na nitsokughweka chinu chikulu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Lekeni Abramu kamwidika, “Ghwe IMNDEWA, utsongaya choni, aku noghendelela kukala bila imwana na imunu iyatsohala ing'anda yangu yuyuno Elieseri, munu wa Dameski?” <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Abramu kalonga, “Lola, ng'ungaile baye iwana. Imtumwa iyelekighwe mng'anda mwangu katsohala pfinu pfangu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Baho imbuli ya Imulungu imtsila, “Imunu yuno ng'atsohala baye pfinu pfako, bali nitsokwing'a mwana kulawa mlukuli mwako, ayo katsohala pfinu pfako.”<verse eid="GEN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Imulungu kamlapfa kunze Abramu, kamlongela, “Lola mlanga, tsipete tsinondo ka kwodaha kutsipeta. Apfi pfipfo watsukulu wako pfawatsakuwa wengi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Abramu kamtoghola Imulungu, naye koneka kanogha hambele he Imulungu.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Kuya Imulungu kamlongela, “Nene Imulungu, iyanikulapfile Uri, isi ya Wakalidayo nikwing'e isi ino iwe yako.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Abramu kamghutsa, “Ghwe Imulungu, nitsomanyatse ka isi ino itsakuwa yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Imulungu kamlongela, “Ngalile ng'ombe, imene ne ing'olo, chila yumwe yawe na miyaka midatu, hamwe na tetele na njiwa.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Abramu kamghalila awo wose, kamghana chila mnyama pfihindi pfili, kapfika pfihindi apfo aku pfelolesa, lekeni iwapfideghe ng'awaghanile baye pfihindi pfibili. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Pfimanga waihulumkila mitsogha ayo, lekeni Abramu kawawinga.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Litsua haling'ali lyakuswa, Abramu kawasa ghendo, wogha na chisi chikulu tsapfimghubika. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Kuya Imulungu kamlongela, “Umanye ghendo ka watsukulu wako watsakuwa wagheni mna isi iili si yawo baye, watsakuwa watumwa na kudununzighwa kwa miyaka miya nne. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Lekeni nitsowahigha iwanu wala iwowatenda watumwa, hambele watsolawa muisi amwo na mali nyingi. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Lekeni ghweghwe imwenyegho kutsokala ghamatsuwa mengi no utsakufa tseghamba. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Mna mweleko wako ghwa kane, watsukulu wako watsakuya hano, kwaapfila ghehile gha Waamori ng'ana ghatimile baye ili wahighighwe.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Litsua haliswele na chisi kwingila, baho tanuri ililapfa lihosi na chiwenge ichikwaka tsapfiluta mghati mwa pfihindi pfila. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Litsuwa lila Imulungu tsakalaghana na Abramu, kamlongela, “Watsukulu wako noweng'a isi ino, kulawa ghumto ghwa Misiri mbaka ghumto mkulu ghwa Efurate, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />isi tsa Wakeni, Wakemisi, Wakadimoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Wahiti, Waperisi, Warefai, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Waamori, Wakanaani, Wagirigashi na Wayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Hagari na Ismaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Lelo Sarai, ipinga wa Abramu, yang'ali ng'ana yamwelekele baye iwana. Lekeni tsakakala na mtumwa iyakemighwe Hagari, iyalawile Misiri, <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />apfo Sarai kamlongela Abramu, “Imulungu kanenda ndeke kweleka iwana. Lelo uwase na imtumwa wangu, songaha kodaha kunyelekela iwana.” Abramu katoghola achila chayalongile Sarai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Apfo Sarai kamwing'a Abramu Hagari, mtumwa wake Mmisiri, yawe ipinga wake. Aghano ghalawila Abramu hayakalile Kanaani kwa miyaka kumi. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Abramu kawasa na Hagari, naye Hagari kakinda inda. Hagari hayamanyile kana inda, kandusa kumbetsa Sarai.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Kuya Sarai kamlongela Abramu, “Ukwiha kuno kwanendelighwa, naghwe kwa mumo. Nikwing'a mtumwa wangu mna ghamoko ghako, sambi kona kana inda, konibetsa. Leka Imulungu yatuhighe nene na ghweghwe.”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Abramu kamwidika, “Mtumwa wako kolongotsighwa na ghweghwe, mtendele chochose chaubama.” Kuya Sarai kamdununza Hagari mbaka koka.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Malaika we Imulungu kamwona Hagari habehi na mbwibwi mchiwala, mbwibwi iikalile mna nzila ighenda Shuri. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Malaika ayo kamghutsa, “Hagari, mtumwa wa Sarai, ulawa kwani na ughenda kwani?” Hagari kamwidika, “Nompfuka bibi yangu Sarai.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Kuya malaika ayo kamlongela, “Uye kwa bibi yako na umuhilikitseghe yeye.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Kuya malaika ayo kaghendelea kulonga, “Nitsokwongetsela watsukulu nawo ng'awatsodahika baye kupetighwa kwa apfila pfawatsokuwa wengi.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Kuya malaika ayo we Imulungu kamlongela, “Ghweghwe sambi kuna inda na kutsakweleka imwana mmale. Kutsomkema Ismaili kwaapfila Imulungu kona pfaughatsike. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Imwanagho katsakuwa ka punda wa kumuhulo, katsesonga na chila imunu na chila imunu katsesonga naye, naye katsebaghula na lukolo lwake lwose.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Hagari kamkema Imulungu iyalongile naye, “Ghweghwe kwa Imulungu iyakona,” kwaapfila tsakalonga, “Lelo nimwona ayula iyombona.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Apfo chisima chila tsachikemighwa Beerilahairoi, mana yake ichisima cha iyali ne ughima iyombona. Chisima acho tsachikala haghati ha Kadeshi na Beredi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Hagari kamwelekela Abramu imwana mmale, na Abramu kamkema imwana ayo Ismaili. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Abramu tsakana miyaka semanini na sita Hagari hayamweleke Ismaili.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Abramu kokemighwa Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Abramu hayang'ali ne imiyaka tisini na tisa Imulungu kamlawila kamlongela, “Nene na Imulungu yane ngupfu. Unihulikitse na utende ghanoghile matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Nitsakwika laghano lyangu naghwe na nitsokwing'a watsukulu ketseketse.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Abramu kenama chihanga chake chidonza hasi, Imulungu kamlongela, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Nakwika lilaghano lino naghwe. Kutsakuwa aba wa kolo nyingi. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Taghwa lyako ng'alitsakuwa keli Abramu, ila kutsokemighwa Abrahamu, kwaapfila nokutenda kuwa aba wa kolo nyingi. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Nitsokwing'a watsukulu wengi, na wamwenga watsakuwa wandewa. Naghwe kutsakuwa na watsukulu ketseketse, nawo watsakuwa kolo.”<verse eid="GEN 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />“Na nene nitsakwimitsa laghano lyangu na ghweghwe na watsukulu wako mna kolo itsikutsa ka laghano lya ghamatsuwa ghose. Nene nitsakuwa Imulungu wako ne Imulungu wa watsukulu wako. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Nitsokwing'a ghweghwe na watsukulu wako isi ino iuli mgheni sambi. Isi yose ya Kanaani itsokuwa ya watsukulu wako ghamatsuwa ghose, na nene nitsakuwa Imulungu wawo.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Imulungu kamlongela Abrahamu, “Naghwe pfipfila utoghole kukindilitsa laghano lyangu, ghweghwe na watsukulu wako na kolo itsikutsa. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Alino lilyo laghano lyangu lyautsokinda ghweghwe na watsukulu wako. Chila immale imli naye yengile ngoma. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Ukwingila ngoma kwenu, kutsakuwa chitango cha laghano lyangu na mwemwe. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Chila imwana mmale iyali na ghamatsuwa manane yengile ngoma. Chila mmale mna pfeleko pfenu, yawe mtumwa iyelekighwe mng'anda mwenu au imtumwa yamumghulile kwe iwagheni, kobamighwa yengile ngoma. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Chila immale iyelekighwe mng'anda mwako na hata iyaghulighwe kwa sendi tsako kobamighwa yengile ngoma. Achino chitsakuwa chitango mna ng'uli tsenu cha lilaghano lyangu lya ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Immale wowose yang'engile ngoma baye katsobaghulighwa ne iwanu, kwaapfila ng'akindile baye laghano na nene.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu kelaghana na Abrahamu kumwing'a imwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Kuya Imulungu kamlongela Abrahamu, “Ghweghwe ng'utsomkema keli baye mwehe wako Sarai, kwaapfila taghwa lyake litsokuwa Sara. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Nitsombaliki, naye katsokwelekela imwana immale. Nitsombaliki Sara, naye katsokuwa mai wa kolo nyingi, na kutsolawila iwandewa mna watsukulu wake.” <verse eid="GEN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Abrahamu kenamila hasi na chihanga chake chidonza hasi, lekeni kaseka mmoyo no ukwalangula, “Apfi imunu yane miyaka miya imwe kodaha ukweleka imwana? Apfi Sara yane miyaka tisini kodaha ukweleka imwana?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Kuya Abrahamu kamghutsa Imulungu, “Ebali ung'amleka Isimaili yawe mhala wangu?”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Lekeni Imulungu kamlongela, “Bae, mwehe wako Sara katsokwelekela imwana immale, naghwe kutsomwing'a taghwa Isaka. Na nene nitsakwika laghano lyangu na yeye liwe laghano lya ghamatsuwa ghose kwa watsukulu wake iwakutsa <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Nihulika chaubama nimtendele Ismaili, nitsombaliki ghendo, nitsomwing'a iwana wengi ne iwatsukulu wengi. Katsokuwa aba wa watawala kumi na weli, na nitsomtenda yawe aba we wanu wengi. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Lekeni nolika laghano lyangu ne imwanagho Isaka, iyatsomweleka Sara ghamatsuwa ka ghano ghumwaka we elupfi.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Imulungu hayamalitse kulonga, kamleka Abrahamu.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Litsuwa lilila Abrahamu kamsola mwanaghe Ismaili na wose iwelekighwe mkaye mwake na iyawaghulile kwa sendi tsake, iwamale wose iwali mkaye mwake. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Abrahamu tsakakala na miyaka tisini na tisa hayengile ngoma, <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />na imwanaghe Ismaili tsakakala na miyaka kumi na midatu. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Abrahamu na imwanaghe Ismaili <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />hamwe ne iwamale wose iwali mkaye mwake au iwaghulighwe kulawa mna isi ya wahenza, wose wengila ngoma mna litsuwa lilila.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Iwahenza wadatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />IMNDEWA kamlawila Abrahamu habehi na mibiki mikulu ya Mamre hayakalile hane libani lya hema lyake mmisi, mna chipindi cha pwihi. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Abrahamu kenula nenge tsake, kawona iwanu wadatu hambele hake. Bahala hayawonile kawatsumilila kaghenda kuwabokela. Hayapfikile kenama chihanga chake chidonza hasi. <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />Kalonga, “Wakulu tsangu chonde chonde mleke kumbita nene mtumwa wenu, ila mtse ukaye yangu. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Niwaghalile ghamatsi chidogho muhopfughe ghamaghulu ghenu na mbwihile hane chimbeho cha mbiki. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Niwaghalileni ichijo, mje mghute kuya mghendelele na ghumwanza, kwaapfila mnitsila nene imtumwa wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Wamwidika, “Pfinogha, utende ka pfaulonga.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Apfo Abrahamu katsumila mna lihema kamlongela Sara, “Sola utimbo iunoghile debe limwe wambikile ichijo himahima.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Kuya katsumila mna kingili lya ng'ombe, kasaghula ng'ombe yumwe iyanoghile na iyanenehe, kamwing'a imtumwa, iyamchinjile na kumwabika himahima. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Kuya Abrahamu kawaghalila siagi ne ghamatsiwa ne nyama iyambikighwe, kawekela wahenza awo ichijo, naye tsakema habehi yawo hawang'ali wakuja hasi mwe mbiki.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Kuya iwanu awo wamghutsa Abrahamu, “Alikwani ipinga wako Sarai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Kawedika, “Kamna lihema.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Kuya Imkulu yumwe kamlongela, “Nitsokuyila ghendo ghamatsuwa ka ghano ghumwaka iukutsa na pinga wako Sarai katsakuwa ne imwana mmale.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Sarai tsakakala kuchughu mwa libani lye lihema kotegheletsa. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Abrahamu na Sara tsawalala ng'ani, na Sara tsakakala kalala ng'ani ukweleka imwana. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Apfo Sara kasekelela mmoyo mwake kalonga, “Nene nilala, pfipfila mmale wangu naye kalala, nitsodahatse kudeng'ela na kupata iwana?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamghutsa Abrahamu, “Ule Sara koseka na kolonga, ‘Nene nilala, nitsodahatse kweleka iwana?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Apfi kuna chinu chochose ing'achidahika baye kwe IMNDEWA? Nitsokuyila ghamatsuwa ka ghano ghumwaka iukutsa na Sara katsakweleka imwana mmale.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Lekeni Sara tsakapfuka, kabela kalonga, “Sisekile baye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Lekeni Imulungu kamlongela, “Bae, tsakuseka.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abrahamu kowalombela iwanu wa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Iwanu awo woka, wapfika hanu hawadahile kona ghumji ghwa Sodoma, baho Abrahamu kawahagha. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Kuya IMNDEWA kelongela mmoyo, “Apfi nimpfise Abrahamu chinu chanibama kutenda? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Abrahamu katsakuwa aba we isi ng'ulu na iwanu wose wa tsiisi tsose watsobalikighwa kubitila yeye. <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Nimsaghula yeye, yawalaghitse iwanaghe na iwanu wa kaye yake waiwinze nzila yangu kwa kutenda ghanoghile na gha haki. Wang'atenda apfo, nitsomtendela ghose ghanimlongele.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Abrahamu, “Kuna chililo chikulu che iwanu kwa Sodoma na Gomora na nzambi tsawo tsowotenda tsiha ng'ani. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Lelo nohulumka nikalole ka achila chawatendile cheghala na chililo chanihulike. Ka si pfipfo, nitsomanya.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Kuya iwanu weli mna iwanu wala woka, waghenda Sodoma, lekeni Abrahamu tsakema hambele he Imtwatsa. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Kuya Abrahamu kamsoghelela IMNDEWA kamghutsa, “Apfi kutsowakoma iwanu iwanoghile na iwanu iwehile? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Tulonge mna ghumji ghula hana iwanu iwanoghile hamsini. Apfi kutsohinya ghumji ghwose, ng'utsoghulekela baye ghumji kwa iwanu awo hamsini? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Imane ka kutsotenda apfo. Kukoma iwanu wehile hamwe ne wanoghile, kuwahigha wanoghile hamwe na wehile! Mbe, mlamutsi wa iisi yose ng'atsoleka baye kuhigha pfinoghile!”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Ning'awona iwanu iwanoghile hamsini wamna ghumji ghula ghwa Sodoma, nitsoghulekakela ghumji agho.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Kuya Abrahamu kalonga keli, “Lelo sipfukile baye kulonga ne Imtwatsa, nene yanili timbwisi na lipfu liliheka. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Tulonge hana iwanu iwanoghile alubaini na watano. Pfii kutsoghuhinya ghumji ghwose kwa kuhunguka iwanu wano watano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Sitsoghuhinya baye ghumji aghwo ka nitsawona iwanu iwanoghile alubaini na watano.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Abrahamu kalonga keli, “Pfii ka hana iwanu alubaini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Imulungu kamwidika, “Sitsoghuinya baye ka hana iwanu wanoghile alubaini.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Abrahamu kalonga, “Chonde chonde uleke kumbonela maya, ndeke nonge keli. Pfii ka watsakoneka iwanu selasini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Sitsowakoma baye ning'awona iwanu selasini.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Abrahamu kalonga, “Chonde unilekele mana sipfukile baye kulonga naghwe. Pfii ka hana iwanu ishilini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Imulungu kalonga, “Sitsouhinya baye ghumji agho ning'awona iwanu ishilini.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Kuya Abrahamu kalonga, “IMNDEWA uleke kumbonela maya, ndeke nonge keli mala lumwe luliheka. Pfii ka watsakoneka iwanu kumi waliheka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Sitsoghuhinya baye ghumji agho ka ghuna iwanu awo kumi.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />IMNDEWA hayamalitse kulonga na Abrahamu, koka, naye Abrahamu koya ukaye.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Sodoma na Gomora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Awala malaika weli wa kulanga tsawapfika Sodoma nemihe. Loti tsakakala hane libani lya ghumji. Baho hayawonile, kenuka kaghenda kuwabokela, kenama chihanga chake chidonza hasi, <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />kalonga, “Watwatsa wangu, chonde chonde mwingile mng'anda mwangu mtumwa wenu. Mwopfughe ghamaghulu ghenu na chilo chino muwase hano. Nemitondo mwodaha kughendelela na ghumwanza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Lekeni wamwidika, “Bae, tutsowasa mchibwalu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Loti kawadedetsa ghendo, kuya watoghola wengila mng'anda mwake. Kawatendela ichijo, kawambikila pfibumo ipfilihela usasu, wapfija.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Lekeni ng'ana wawase baye, iwamale wose wa ghumji ghwa Sodoma, wadodo ne iwabala waitsunguluka ing'anda ya Loti. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Wamkema Loti, wamghutsa, “Walikwani iwanu wala iwatsile chilo chino? Walapfe kunze tuwase nawo.” <verse eid="GEN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Loti kalawa kuya kahinda libani kuchisogho. <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />Kawalongela, “Bae, ndughu tsangu mleke kutenda pfinu pfino pfihile. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Loleni, nina neghe tsangu weli ng'ana wawase baye ne mmale. Leka niwalapfileni kunze, muwatendele chochose chambama. Lekeni mleke kuwatendela chinu chochose iwanu wano, kwaapfila watsa mng'anda mwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Lekeni iwanu awo wamwidika, “Seghela hano! Ghweghwe tsakutsa hano ka mhenza, lekeni lelo kwetenda mlamutsi! Tutsokutendela pfihile kubita iwanu awo.” Wamkunughitsa Loti wabama kubena libani. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Lekeni iwanu wala iwakalile mng'anda wagholosa ghamoko ghawo, wamkwegha Loti mng'anda wahinda libani. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Kuya wawabopfula tsinenge iwanu iwali kunze, apfo ng'awadahile baye kulyona libani.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Kuya iwanu wala weli wamghutsa Loti, “Kuna imunu yungi hanu hano? Iwanagho au neghe tsako au wakwe tsako au ndughu yako yoyose? Walapfe hanu hano sambi baha, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />kwaapfila tutsohahinya hanu hano, kwaapfila mtwatsa kahulika masing'iniko makulu ghe iwanu kwaajili ye iwanu iwokala hano, naye katutuma kuhahinya.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Kuya Loti kalawa, kaghenda kuwalongela wakwe tsake iwabamile kuwakwela neghe tsake. Kawalongela, “Mlawe hanu hano sambi baha, kwaapfila IMNDEWA katsoghuhinya ghumji ghuno!” Lekeni wakwe tsake watsagha yang'ali yodawala.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Lupfilipfili wamalaika wamlongela Loti, “Himahima! Msole ipinga wako ne iwanagho weli iwali hano hela mtsakufa ghumji haghutsohinyighwa.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Loti hayang'ali yokawa, iwanu wala wamkinda ghumoko ghwake na ghumoko ghwa ipinga wake na ghamoko ghe iwanaghe wawalongotsa kunze mwe ghumji, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kawonela libatsi. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Hawawalapfile kunze, malaika yumwe kawalongela, “Mtsume muukombole ughima wenu. Mleke kulola kuchughu wala kwima hanu hohose kulwanda. Tsumileni mpfighongo hela mtsokomighwa!”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Lekeni Loti kawedika, “Bae, chonde chonde, watwatsa wangu! <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Nomanya mmbonela libatsi kuukombola ughima wangu. Lekeni mpfidunda kutali ng'ani na nene sidaha baye kutsumila ako. Ghehile ghano ghatsonipfika ng'ana mvike ako, na nene nitsokufa. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Lola, isi ila ndodo, nene nodaha kutsumila hala kwaapfila ya habehi. Mndeke nitsumile hala, hanu hala nene nitsohona.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Kamwidika, “Pfinogha, nitoghola chulombile. Sitsoihinya baye isi ila yaulonga. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Sumka utsume! Sidaha baye kughuihinya ghumji ghuno mbaka upfike hala.” Apfo ghumji ghula tsaghukemighwa Soari.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sodoma na Gomola yoihinyighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Litsuwa ma tsalilawa Loti hayapfikile Soari. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Kuya IMNDEWA kaghala imvula ya ghumoto itowe mna imiji ya Sodoma na Gomora. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Kaihinya imiji yose na ulwanda lwose, kawakoma iwanu wose na chila chinu ichotile mna isi ila. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Lekeni ipinga wake Loti kahunduka kalola kuchughu, kaghaluka, kawa ngutso ya ghumkele.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Lupfilipfili tsuwa liwinzile Abrahamu tsakasumka kaghenda hanu hala hayemile hambele he Imulungu, <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />kuya kalola kuisi kwaili Sodoma na Gomora na isi yose ya ulwanda, tsakona lihosi muisi lyoghenda kulanga ka lihosi lya ghumoto mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Lekeni Imulungu hayahinyile imiji iili mlwanda iyang'ali yokala Lutu, kamkumbuka Abrahamu, kamlapfa Loti kulawa mna maghayo, aleke kukomighwa nawo.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Loti ne iwanaghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Kwaapfila Loti ang'ali yopfuka kukala Soari, yeye ne iwanaghe weli mapinga wagheluka mpfidunda, waghenda kukala mmango. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Litsuwa limwe mwanaghe mkulu kamlongela mdodo wake, “Aba wetu kalala, haduhu mmale mna isi yose iyodaha kutukwela tweleke iwana. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Leka tumnwese aba wetu imbwali, kuya tuwase naye, tumwelekele iwana.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Chilo chila wamwing'a aba wawo imbwali, imwana mkulu kaghenda kuwasa naye, na aba wake ng'amanyile baye chinu ichitendeke.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Ilupfi yake, imwana mkulu kamlongela mdodo wake, “Nechilo tsaniwasa na aba, leka leloli tumnwese keli imbwali, kuya nechilo ughende ukawase naye. Kuya twetwe wose tutsomwelekela iwana aba wetu.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Apfo chilo chila wamnwesa keli mbwali aba wawo, kuya imwana yula mdodo naye kaghenda kuwasa na aba wake, na aba wake ng'amanyile chinu ichitendeke. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Apfo iwana wose weli wa Loti tsawakinda hinda kulawa kwa aba wawo. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Imwana mkulu tsakeleka imwana mmale, kamkema Moabu. Ayo iyo aba wa Wamoabu mbaka leloli. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Imwana mdodo naye tsakeleka imwana mmale, kamkema Benami. Ayo iyo aba wa Waamoni mbaka leloli.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Abrahamu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Abrahamu tsakoka Mamre, kaghenda kukala haghatighati ha Kadeshi na Shuri mna isi ya Negebu. Kuya kaghenda kukala ako Gerari, <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Abrahamu tsakawalongela iwanu ka Sara, mwehe wake, tsakakala lumbu wake. Apfo Abimeleki, imfalume wa Gerari kamsola Sara. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Lekeni chilo chimwe Imulungu kamlawila Abimeleki mndoto, kamlongela, “Ghweghwe kutsakufa, mana pinga ayo yumsolile, pinga we munu.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Lekeni Abimeleki tsang'ana yawase baye na Sara, apfo kalonga, “Imtwatsa, apfi kutsowakoma iwanu iwalihela totso? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Abrahamu mwenyegho tsakanongela Sara ka lumbu wake, kuya naye Sara mwenyegho tsakalonga Abrahamu lumbu wake. Nene nitenda pfino kwa ghumoyo ghunoghile, nene nahela totso.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Imulungu kamwidika Abimeleki mndoto, “Ona, nomanya kutenda apfo kwa ghumoyo ghunoghile, nene iyo inikughomile uleke kunendela nzambi, apfo sikulekile baye umdolitse. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Lelo muyitse kwe mmale wake, kwaapfila Abrahamu nabii, yeye katsokulombela, naghwe kutsakuwa mghima. Lekeni ka ng'umuyitsa baye, umanye ghendo ghweghwe ne iwanu wako mtsakufa.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Abimeleki kalamka nemitondotondo kawakema pfilongotsi wake wose wa isi yake, kawalongela aghala ighamlawile, nawo wapfuka ghendo. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Kuya Abimeleki kamkema Abrahamu, kamghutsa, “Angu ututendiletse? Nikutendile choni chihile mbaka ungalile maghayo ghano nene na undewa wangu? Chaunendile ng'achinoghile baye.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Kuya Abimeleki kamghutsa Abrahamu, “Ule kunendela pfino?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Abrahamu kamwidika, “Tsanitsagha hanu hano haduhu imunu iyompfuka Imulungu, apfo mng'anikomile mumsole mwehe wangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Hata apfo Sara ka lumbu wangu ghendo, yeye imwana we aba wangu lekeni si imwana wa mai wangu baye, apfi pfipfo pfawile mwehe wangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Imulungu hayandapfile mng'anda mwe aba wangu ng'ende hanu hangi, tsanimlongela Sara, ‘Apfi pfipfo pfautsonitendela uluso, kokose kwatughenda ulonge nene na lumbu wako.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Abimeleki kamuyitsila Abrahamu mwehe wake, kamwing'a ne iwang'olo, wang'ombe na watumighwa. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Kuya Abimeleki kamlongela Abrahamu, “Aino yose isi yangu, lelo usaghule kokose kwaubama kukala.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Kuya Abimeleki kamlongela Sara, “Nomwing'a lumbu wako pfihindi elufu imwe pfa pfesa kuwalangusa iwanu iwali naghwe ka ng'utendile chinu chihile, kwahela totso.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Kuya Abrahamu kamlomba Imulungu, Imulungu kamuhonetsa Abimeleki ne ipinga wake ne iwatumwa wake mapinga, nawo wadaha kweleka keli iwana. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Kwa aghala ighamlawile Sara, mwehe wa Abrahamu, IMNDEWA tsakawatenda iwapinga iwali mkaye mwa Abimeleki waleke ukweleka iwana.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Kwelekighwa kwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA tsakamkumbuka Sara, kamtendela ka pfayamlongele. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Abrahamu hayang'ali kalala ng'ani, mwehe wake tsakakinda inda, kuya kamwelekela imwana immale. Imwana ayo tsakoneka msimu uhuhula wayalongile Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Abrahamu tsakamkema imwana ayo iyelekighwe na Sara, Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Isaka hayapfikile ghamatsuwa manane, Abrahamu kamwingitsa ngoma ka Imulungu pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Abrahamu tsakana na miyaka miya ahala hayoneke Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Naye Sara tsakalonga, “Imulungu kangalila chiseko, chila imunu iyatsohulika nene nyeleka imwana katsoseka na nene.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Kuya kaghendelela kulonga, “Yuhi ang'adahile kumlongela Abrahamu, ka nene Sara nitsoghwaghwisa iwana? Mana nimwelekela imwana immale mna unzehe wake.” <verse eid="GEN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Kuya imwana kakula, na litsuwa lyalekile kughwaghwa, Abrahamu kamtendela Isaka chihungo chikulu.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hagari na Ismaili wowingighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Litsuwa limwe Sara tsakamwona Ismaili, mwana wa Abrahamu iyelekighwe na Hagari Mmisiri kombetsa Isaka imwanaghe. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Apfo Sara kamlongela Abrahamu, “Muwinge imtumwa yuno ne imwanaghe, kwaapfila imwana we pinga yuno ng'atsohala baye ne imwanangu Isaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Mbuli ino tsaimtsupfa ghendo Abrahamu mana Ismaili pfipfila tsakakala imwanaghe.<verse eid="GEN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Lekeni Imulungu kamlongela Abrahamu, “Imwana yuno ne imtumwa wako waleke kukutenda ughanzike. Utende chochose choyokulongela Sara, kwaapfila kubitila Isaka ghweghwe kutsakuwa ne watsukulu wanikulongele. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Kuya imwana wa imtumwa wako naye nitsomwing'a iwana wengi, apfo katsokuwa aba we iwanu wengi, mana na yeye ka imwanagho.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Tsuwa liwinzile Abahamu kalamka lupfilipfili, kasola ichijo na chibuyu che ghamatsi kamwing'a Hagari, kamtwika pfinu apfo mmahegha, kammlongela yoke hamwe ne imwanaghe. Hagari koka, yang'ali yakwangakwanga mnyika mwa Beasheba.<verse eid="GEN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Ghamatsi haghamalile, Hagari kamuwasisa msongolo mchimbeho. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Kuya kaghenda kukala utali wa ghamaghulu miya imwe, tsakelongela mmoyo, “Sibama baye kumwona mwanangu pfayakufa.” Kuya kandusa kulila.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Kuya Imulungu tsakamuhulika msongolo ayo kolila, imalaika kamkema Hagari, kamghutsa, “Hagari ichinu chachi ichikutenda ughanzike? Uleke kupfuka, Imulungu kahulika chililo cha imwanagho ako kwayali. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Winuke, umsole imwanagho, mana nitsomtenda yawe aba we wanu wengi.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Kuya Imulungu kampfumbula tsinenge Hagari, kona chisima. Apfo kaghenda kadegha ghamatsi mchibuyu, kamnwesa mwanaghe. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Naye Imulungu tsakakala hamwe ne msongolo ayo, msongolo ayo kaghendelela kukula. Kuya tsayang'ali yowinda. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Tsakakala mna nyika ya Parani, na mai wake tsakamkwelela ipinga kulawa isi ya Misiri.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laghano lya Abrahamu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Chipindi chila Abimeleki na Fikoli imkulu we iwang'ewele wake, wamghendela Abrahamu, wamlongela, “Imulungu kahamwe naghwe mna ghose ghoutenda. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Lelo wilahe hambele he Imulungu ka ng'utsonibugha baye nene au iwanangu au iwatsukulu wangu. Ka pfanikutendele ghweghwe pfinoghile, pfipfila naghwe ututendele pfinoghile nene ne iwanu wangu mna isi ino yaukala.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Abrahamu kelaha, “Imulungu yandiye.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Kuya Abrahamu tsakamsing'inikila Abimeleki kwaajili ya chisima cha ghamatsi chawambokile iwatumwa wa Abimeleki. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Lekeni Abimeleki kalonga, “Simmanyile baye imunu iyatendile apfo. Naghwe ng'unongele baye imbuli ino, na nene sina nihulike baye mbaka leloli.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Abrahamu tsakamwing'a Abimeleki iwang'olo ne wang'ombe, kuya wanu awo weli tsawelaghana. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Abrahamu tsakabaghula iwang'olo mbughuma saba kulawa mna iwang'olo wake. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimeleki kamghutsa, “Ule utenda pfino?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Abrahamu kamwidika, “Uwasole iwang'olo wano saba kulawa kuna nene wawe ukalangama, ka nene iyanihimbile chisima chino.”<verse eid="GEN 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Apfo hanu hala tsahakemighwa Beasheba, kwaapfila iwanu awo weli tsawelaha hanu hala.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Hawafambule kwilaghana ako Beasheba, Abimeleki na Fikoli tsawoya kune isi ya Wafilisti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Kuya Abrahamu kahanda mkwaju ako Beasheba, na baho kamtamanila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Abrahamu tsakakala mna isi ya Wafilisti kwa ghamatsuwa mengi.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu komghetsa Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Hambele Imulungu kamghetsa Abrahamu. Kamkema, “Abrahamu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">Abrahamu kamwidika, “Oo, ulongatse Mtwatsa!”<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Kuya Imulungu kalonga, “Umsole mwanagho Isaka, imwanagho nyalimwe, iyokunoghela ng'ani, mghende isi ya Moriya. Umlapfe ka inambiko ya kulakatsighwa mna lughongo lwanitsokulangusa.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Litsuwa liwinzile Abrahamu tsakalamka mitondotondo, katula tsingodi tsa kulakatsila inambiko, kambapitsa ipunda wake, kamsola Isaka ne iwatumwa wake weli, kuya waghenda hanu hayalongelighwe ne Imulungu yaghende. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Litsuwa lya kadatu Abrahamu kenula tsinenge, kalwona lughongo kwa kutali. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Kuya kawalongela iwatumwa wake, “Mkale hano ne ipunda. Nene ne imsongolo wangu twoghenda hala kumlomba Imulungu, kuya tutsowoyila.” <verse eid="GEN 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Hawang'ali woghenda, Abrahamu kamwing'a imwanaghe Isaka tsingodi tsa kulapfila inambiko, imwenyegho tsakaghala ghummaghe na ghumoto. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Isaka kamkema aba wake, “Aba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Aba wake kamwidika, “Ulongatse mwanangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Isaka kamghutsa, “Tsingodi na ghumoto pfabaha, lekeni yalikwani imwana we ing'olo wa kumlapfa nambiko?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Abrahamu kamwidika, “Mwanangu, Imulungu imwenyegho katsolapfa imwana we ing'olo wa kumlapfila inambiko.” Kuya wose weli waghendelela na ghumwanza.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Hawapfikile hanu Imulungu hayamlongele yaghende, Abrahamu katenda hanu ha kulapfila inambiko ha ghamabwe, keka tsingodi mchanya mwake. Kuya kamwoha Isaka, kamwasisa mna tsingodi hanu he kulapfila inambiko. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Kuya Abrahamu kasola mmaghe yamsubutule imwanaghe. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Lekeni malaika we Imulungu kamkema Abrahamu kulawa kulanga, “Abrahamu! Abrahamu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Abrahamu kamwidika, “Oo!”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Malaika ayo kamlongela, “Uleke kumlagha wala kumtendela chinu chochose imwanagho. Sambi nomanya ka ghweghwe kompfuka na komhulikitsa Imulungu, kwaapfila ng'umwimile baye imwanagho nyalimwe.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Abrahamu kalola mmbalimbali, kamwona ng'unzu yanasile tsimembe mwibagho. Kamlekelela Isaka, kaghenda kumsola ing'unzu ayo, kamlapfa nambiko ya kulakatsighwa hanu ha imwanaghe. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Abrahamu kahakema hanu hala, “IMNDEWA koghola.” Mbaka leloli iwanu wolonga, “Mne lugongo lwe Imtwatsa, Imulungu koghola.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Malaika we IMNDEWA kamkema keli Abrahamu, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />kamlongela, “IMNDEWA kolonga apfi, ‘Nilaha kwa taghwa lyangu, nitsokubaliki, kwaapfila ng'ulemile baye kungaya imwanagho, imwanagho nyalimwe. <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />Nitsokubaliki ghendo, nitsokwing'a watsukulu ketseketse ka itsinondo tsili mlanga, na ka msanga ghuli kumwani. Nawo watsowatawala iwanu iwowahila. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Kubitila watsukulu wako, kolo tsose itsili muisi mwose tsitsobalikiwa, kwaapfila ghweghwe kunihulikitsa.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Kuya Abrahamu kawoyila iwatumwa wake, nawo wose woya Beasheba, naye Abrahamu tsakakala kuko.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwatsukulu wa Nohari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Kuya Abrahamu tsakahulika, “Milika kamwelekela iwana Nohari ndughu yako.” <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Usi, chaudele wake na Busi ndughu yake na Kemueli, aba wake Aramu, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kesedi na Hazo na Pilidashi na Yidilafu na Betueli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betueli kamweleka Rebeka. Milika kamwelekela Nohari, ndughu yake Abrahamu iwana wanane. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Kuya Reuma, pinga wake wa kunze Nohari, naye kamwelekela iwana, Teba na Gahamu na Tahashi na Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Sara tsakakala na miyaka miya imwe na ishirini na saba. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Sara tsakafila Kiriatharaba, iyo Heburoni mna isi ya Kanaani. Abrahamu kamlilila na kamwikila matanga.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Abrahamu tsakaluleka lukuli lwa mwehe wake, kalawa kaghenda kulonga ne Wahiti, kawalongela, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Nene namuhenza mna mwemwe mniutsile hanu ho ukutsikila, nobama nimtsike mwehe wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Wahiti wamwidika Abrahamu, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Tutegheletse imtwatsa wetu, Ghweghwe kwa imunu mkulu kuna twetwe, mtsike mwehe wako kokose kwaubama mna pfibaka pfetu. Kuduhu imunu iyatsokulemela kukwing'a hanu umtsike mwehe wako.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Kuya Abrahamu kawenamila Wahiti. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />Kawalongela, “Ka mwondekela nimtsike mwehe wangu, chonde chonde mlombeni Efuroni mwana wa Sohari, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />yanihutsile mango lila lya Makipela, ilili hane mbaka wa mghunda wake. Mlombeni yanihutsile nihimbe ipfibaka, yanihutsile hambele henu kwa sendi yoyose iyobama.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Efuroni tsakakala na Wahiti wayaghe iwetingane mna libani kulu lya ghumji. Apfo kamwidika Abrahamu hambele he Wahiti, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />kamlongela, “Bae imtwatsa, nitegheletse, nokwing'a mghunda wose na mango ilili mumghunda amwo, kuya nokwing'a hambele he iwanu wangu, umtsike mwehe wako.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Abrahamu kawenamila keli iwanu wa isi ila, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />kamlongela Efuroni, aku iwanu womtegheletsa, “Chonde chonde, nolomba unitegheletse. Nitsoghula mghunda ghwose, nolomba utoghole nikulihe, nimtsike mwehe wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efuroni kamwidika Abrahamu, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Nitegheletse mtwatsa wangu, mghunda ighuhutsighwa kwa pfihindi miya nne pfa fetsa kuna nene na ghweghwe si chinu baye. Mtsike mwehe wako.”<verse eid="GEN 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Abrahamu katoghola chayalongile Efuroni, kampetela ka pfalongile hambele he iwanu, pfihindi miya nne pfa fetsa, ka pfaibamighwe ne iwatsulutsi wa ghamatsuwa agho.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Apfi pfipfo Abrahamu pfayaghulile mali ya Efuroni ako Makipela habehi na Mamre, tsakaghula mghunda na mango na mibiki yose iili mumghunda mbaka hane mibaka. <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Pfinu apfo tsakeng'ighwa Abrahamu pfiwe pfake hambele ye Wahiti wose iwakalile hala mna mtingano ula.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Kuya Abrahamu kamtsika Sara, mwehe wake hane mango alyo lya Makipela habehi na Mamre mna isi ya Wakanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Apfo mghunda aghwo na mango iili amwo, Wahiti tsawamwing'a Abrahamu hawe hanu hake ho ukutsikila.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Isaka na Rebeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Abrahamu tsakakala kalala ng'ani, na Imulungu tsakambaliki mna ghose ghayatendile. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Litsuwa limwe Abrahamu kamlongela mtumwa wake mkulu kubita iwatumwa wangi, iyang'ali yakwimilitsa mali yake yose, “Wike ghumoko ghwako hane hatsa lyangu, <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />nobama wilahe kwa taghwa lye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa kulanga na iisi, ka ng'utsomkwelela baye imwanangu mna iwanu iwokala hano Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />ila uye mna isi iyanyelekighwe, umkwelele ipinga mwanangu Isaka kulawa mna ndughu tsangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Imtumwa ayo kamghutsa, “Pfii lelo ipinga ayo ang'alema kutsa na nene mna isi ino, nimuyitse mwanagho mna isi yulawile?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Abrahamu kamwidika, “Bae! Walangitse uleke kumuyitsa ako mwanangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa kulanga, iyandapfile mkaye mwa aba wangu na mna isi yanyelekighwe, tsakelaha kuna nene ka katsoweng'a watsukulu wangu isi ino. Yeye katsomtuma malaika wake yakulongole ukamghalile mwanangu ipinga kulawa ako. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Ipinga ayo ang'alema kutsa naghwe, ghweghwe ng'utsakwohighwa baye ne ukwilaha kwangu kuno. Lekeni uleke kumuyitsa ako imwanangu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Apfo imtumwa ayo keka ghumoko ghwake hasi mwe hatsa lya Abrahamu, imtwatsa wake, kuya kelaha kutenda aghala ghayamlongele Abrahamu.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Kuya imtumwa ayo kawasola ngamiya kumi kulawa mna ngamiya we imtwatsa wake na pfinu pfingi pfinoghile kulawa kwa imtwatsa wake, kaghenda mna ghumji ghwayakalile Nohari, ubali wa kuchanya wa Mesopotamiya. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Hayapfikile, kawafughamisa ngamiya habehi ne chisima ichikalile kunze mwa ghumji. Tsaikala nemihe iwapinga hawoghenda kudegha ghamatsi. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Kuya kalomba, “Ghwe Imtwatsa, Imulungu wa mtwatsa wangu Abrahamu, unyapfile leloli nimpate ipinga ayo, na umwonele libatsi mtwatsa wangu Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Lola, nyima habehi na chisima chino, na wali we iwanu wa isi ino wakutsa kudegha ghamatsi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Imwali iyanitsomlongela yatule chiha chake yangaye ghamatsi nuwe, naye ang'angaya ghamatsi nene na ngamiya wangu, ayo yawe yuyo yumsaghulile imtumwa wako Isaka. Ing'alawila pfino nitsomanya ka kumwonela libatsi mtwatsa wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Ng'ana yamalitse baye kulomba, baho Rebeka tsakapfika ne chiha chake mwitwi. Rebeka tsakakala neghe Betueli, imwana wa Milika ipinga wa Nohari, ndughu yake Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Mwali ayo tsakanogha ng'ani, na ng'ana yawase baye ne mmale wowose, kahulumka hane chisima, kadegha ghamatsi, kagheluka. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Imtumwa ayo kamtsumila kamlongela, “Chonde chonde ngaya ghamatsi chidogho nuwe.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Mwali ayo kalonga, “Haya nuwa mkulu wangu.” Kuya katula chiha himahima, kachikinda mmoko kamwing'a ghamatsi yanwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Hayamalitse kumwing'a ghamatsi, kamlongela, “Pfipfila nitsoweng'a ghamatsi ngamiya wako, wanwe weghute.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Apfo imwali ayo kaghida ghamatsi himahima hanu ho kunwela ghamatsi iwanyama, kuya katsuma keli hane chisima kadegha ghamatsi ghangi, kawanwesa ngamiya wake wose. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Imtumwa ayo kaghendelela kumlola mwali ayo aku kanyamala tulu, ili yamanye ka Imulungu kamwapfila kumpata mwali ayo.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ngamiya hawafambule kunwa ghamatsi, imtumwa ayo kamwing'a imwali ayo pete ya nzahabu ya bei ng'ulu na kampfatsa bangili mbili tsa nzahabu mna ghamoko. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Kuya imtumwa ayo kamghutsa, “Chonde chonde, nongele ghweghwe uli neghe noni? Pfii mng'anda mwa aba wako hana hanu ho ukuwasa twetwe?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Rebeka ayo kamwidika, “Nene na neghe Betueli, imwana wa Milika mwehe wa Nohari.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Kaghendela kulonga, “Ukaye yetu hana mitsani na ipfijo pfingi, pfipfila hanu ho kuwasa mwemwe habaho.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Baho imtumwa yula kenama, kamtamanila IMNDEWA. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Kalonga, “Yatunyighwe Imulungu, Imulungu wa mtwatsa wangu Abrahamu, iyang'alekile baye kumwonela uluso mtwatsa wangu na kumtendela achila chayamlongele. Na hata nene IMNDEWA kanongotsa mbaka mna lukolo lwa mtwatsa wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Kuya mwali yula katsuma kaghenda kuwalongela iwanu iwali ukaye ha mai wake aghala ghose ighalawile. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Rebeka tsakakala na lumbu wake iyakemighwe Labani, Labani katsumila kuchisima kwayakalile imtumwa wa Abrahamu, <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />kwaapfila Labani tsakayona pete ila na bangili mna ghamoko gha lumbu wake, na tsakahulika mbuli tsayalongelighwe tsa imunu ayo. Kampfika imunu ayo kema habehi na ngamiya wake mmbalimbali mwe chisima. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Labani kamlongela, “Utse ukaye, ghweghwe yubalikighwe ne Imtwatsa. Ule kwima kunze? Nene ma nikuhandalila hanu ho kuwasa na hanu ho kukala ngamiya wako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Apfo imtumwa ayo wa Aburahamu kengila mng'anda. Labani kawadohola ngamiya, kaweng'a chijo, kaweng'a ghamatsi gha kuhopfughila ghamaghulu yeye ne iwanu wake. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Kuya wamwikila chijo, lekeni yeye kalonga, “Sikuja baye mbaka niwalongele chanibama kulonga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Labani kamlongela, “Lelo tulongele.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Imunu yula kalonga, “Nene namtumwa wa Abrahamu, <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Imulungu kambaliki ng'ani mtwatsa wangu, kawa munu mkulu, kana mali nyingi. IMNDEWA kamwing'a iwang'olo ne iwamene na fetsa na nzahabu na iwatumwa wamale ne iwapinga na ngamiya na pfihongwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Sara kamwelekela mtwatsa wangu imwana mna ubala wake, naye kamwing'a imwana ayo mali tsake tsose. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Kuya mtwatsa wangu kanongela nilahe, tsakanongela, ‘Uleke kumkwelela mwanangu ipinga kulawa mna isi ya Wakanaani yanikala nawo. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Ila ughende ukaye kwa aba wangu, mna lukolo lwangu, ukamkwelele ipinga mwanangu Isaka.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Kuya nimghutsa IMNDEWA wangu, ‘Pfihi yang'alema kutsa na nene?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Lekeni yeye kanyidika, ‘IMNDEWA, iyanimtegheletsa ghamatsuwa ghose katsowatuma malaika wake waghende naghwe, na katsoutenda ghumwanza ghwako ghunoghe. Kuya kutsomkwelela mwanangu ipinga kulawa mkaye mwa aba wangu, mna lukolo lwangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Ung'apfika mna lukolo lwangu, ka ng'awatsokwing'a ipinga baye, chawilahile ng'achitsokupata baye.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Leloli hanipfikile hane chisima tsanilomba, ‘Ghwe Imtwatsa, Imulungu wa mtwatsa wangu Abrahamu, chonde chonde unyapfile, ungaye achila chanitsilile. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Ulole, nyima ahano habehi na chisima, yang'atsa mwali kudegha ghamatsi nitsomlongela, “Chonde chonde ngaya ghamatsi chidogho mna ichiha chako nuwe,” <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />Naye yang'anilongela, “Nuwa, pfipfila nitsowadeghela ghamatsi na ngamiya wako,” imwali ayo yuyo Imulungu iyamsaghulile imwana wa mtwatsa wangu.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Ng'ana nimalitse kulomba mna ghumoyo ghwangu, lola Rebeka katsa na chiha mwitwi mwake. Kahulumka kuchisima kudegha ghamatsi. Nimlongela, ‘Chondechonde ngaya ghamatsi nuwe.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Rebeka katula himahima ichiha chake ichikalile mwitwi mwake, kalonga, ‘Nuwa, pfipfila nitsowanwesa ngamiya wako.’ Apfo nene nuwa, kuya kawanwesa ngamiya wangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Nimghutsa, ‘Nongele ghweghwe uli neghe nani?’ Naye kanyidika, ‘Nene neghe Betueli, imwana wa Nohari na Milika.’ Baho nimpfatsa pete na bangili mna ghamoko ghake. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Kuya ninama, nimtamanila Imtwatsa. Nimtunya Imulungu, Imulungu wa mtwatsa wangu Abrahamu, iyanilongotse mnzila kughenda kwa lukolo lwa mtwatsa wangu, kumkwelela ipinga imwana wa mtwatsa wangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Lelo mng'amwonela libatsi na kumtendela uluso mtwatsa wangu mnongele, ka si pfipfo baye, mnongele na nene nitsomanya nitendetse.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Labani na Betueli wamwidika, “Imbuli ino yolawa kwa IMNDEWA, ng'atudaha baye kulonga chinu chochose. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Rebeka ayuno ano, umsole mke. Leka yawe ipinga wa imwana wa mtwatsa wako, ka IMNDEWA pfayalongile.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Imtumwa wa Abrahamu hayahulike achila chawalongile, kenama kamtamanila Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Kuya imtumwa ayo kalapfa pfinu pfa fetsa na nzahabu na ghamaghwanda kamwing'a Rebeka. Pfipfila kaweng'a pfinu pfa bei ng'ulu lumbu wake Rebeka na mai wake.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Kuya imtumwa wa Abrahamu na iwanu iwelongotse naye waja chijo na wanwa, na chilo chila wawasa baho. Hawalamke nemitondo, kalonga, “Mndeke mbuye kwa mtwatsa wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Lekeni lumbu wake Rebeka na mai wake tsawalonga, “Mleke Rebeka yakale na twetwe ka ghamatsuwa kumi, kuya mwodaha kuka naye.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Lekeni yeye kalonga, “Mleke kunikawitsa, mana IMNDEWA kaghutenda ghumwanza ghwangu ghunoghe, mndeke mbuye kwa mtwatsa wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Kuya walonga, “Leka tanu tumkeme Rebeka mwenyegho tumghutse.”<verse eid="GEN 24:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Apfo wamkema Rebeka wamghutsa, “Pfii kwobama kuka na imunu yuno?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Naye kedika, “Ona, nakuka naye.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Apfo, wamleka yoke na imtumwa wa Abrahamu ne iwanu wake, aku kelongotsa na mtumwa pinga wa ukaye yawo. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Wambaliki Rebeka, wamlongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">“Ghwe lumbu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">uwe mai we iwanu ketse ketse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">iwanagho waitawale imiji ya wanebe wawo!”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Kuya, Rebeka na iwatumwa wake mapinga wadina ngamiya, wamuwinza mtumwa wa Abrahamu, woka naye.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Ghamatsuwa agho, Isaka tsakalawa Beerilahairoi, na ang'ali yokala Negebu. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Tsuwa limwe nemihe Isaka tsakaghenda kuchiwala ukwalangula, na hayalolile, kawona ngamiya wakutsa. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Rebeka hayamwonile Isaka, kahulumka mna ngamiya wake. <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />Kamghutsa imtumwa wa Abrahamu, “Angu ayula iyakutsa kutubokela kuchiwala nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Imtumwa ayo kamwidika, “Ayuno iyo mtwatsa wangu. Kuya Rebeka kasola chitambala chake keghubika chihanga.”<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Kuya imtumwa ayo kamlongela Isaka ghose ghatendile. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Isaka kamsola Rebeka, kamghala mna chibumbulika chayang'ali yokala Sara, mai wake, kawa mwehe wake. Rebeka kamnoghela Isaka, apfo kamkanza Isaka kwa lifwa lya mai wake.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Watsukulu wa Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Abrahamu tsakakwela ipinga yungi, taghwa lyake Ketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Ketura kamwelekela Abrahamu iwana, Zimrani, Yokishani, Medani, Midiani, Ishibaki na Shua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokishani tsakaweleka Sheba na Dedani, watsukulu wa Dedani tsawakala Waashuru, Waletushi na Waleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Iwana wa Midiani tsawakala Efa, Eferi, Hanoki, Abida na Elidaa. Awano wose tsawakala watsukulu wa Ketura.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abrahamu tsakamwing'a Isaka pfinu pfose pfayakalile napfo. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Lekeni hala hayang'ali mghima, iwana we iwapinga wake wangi kaweng'a nzawadi. Kuya kawaghala iwana awo isi ya ubali mashaliki, kutali na mwanaghe Isaka.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Abrahamu tsakakala kwa miyaka miya imwe sabini na tano. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Kuya Abrahamu tsakafa aku kalala pfinoghile, kuya kahupa kaghenda kuwasa ne iwabala wake iwalongole kufa. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Iwana wa Aburahamu Isaka na Ismaili wamtsika aba wawo mna mango ya Makipela habehi na Mamre, mna mghunda ghwaghulile kwa Efuroni imwana wa Zohari, Mhiti. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Abrahamu tsakaghula mghunda aghwo kwa Wahiti. Abrahamu tsakatsikighwa ako kwatsikighwe mwehe wake, Sara. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Abrahamu hayafile, tsakambaliki Isaka mwanaghe. Isaka tsakakala habehi ne Beerilahairoi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Ismaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Aluno lweleko lwa Ismaili imwana wa Abrahamu, iyelekighwe na Hagari mtumwa wa Sara iyalawile Misiri. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Awano iwana wa Ismaili ka pfawelekighwe, chaudele Nebayosi, Kedari, Adibeeli, Mibusamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Mishima, Duma, Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadadi, Tema, Yeturi, Nafishi na Kadema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Awano iwo iwana wa Ismaili, kolo kumi na mbili ghalawila mna iwana wano, kaye tsawo na pfijiji pfawo tsapfimanyika kwa mataghwa ghawo. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ismaili hayafile tsakakala na miyaka miya imwe na selasini na saba, naye kahupa kaghenda kuwasa ne iwabala wake iwamlongole ukufa. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Watsukulu wa Ismaili tsawang'ali wokala Hawila na Shuri, habehi na Misiri, ka kwoghenda Ashuru. Tsawakala webaghula na watsukulu wangi wa Abrahamu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Aluno lweleko lwa Isaka, imwana wa Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Isaka tsakakala na miyaka alubaini hayamkwelile Rebeka neghe Betueli, Mwaramu wa Padani Aramu. Rebeka tsakakala lumbu wa Labani. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Kwaapfila Rebeka tsakakala ng'akweleka baye, Isaka kamlombela kwe Imulungu. Imulungu kamwidika chayalombile, naye Rebeka, tsakakinda hinda. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Inda yake tsaikala ya wana weli, nawo tsawebanyabanya munda mwake, naye kalonga, “Ule ghano ghondawila nene?” Kuya kaghenda kumghutsa Imtwatsa.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />IMNDEWA kamlongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Kolo mbili tsamunda mwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Iwanu weli iwali munda mwako watsesonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">yumwe katsakuwa na ngupfu kubita yungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">imkulu katsomtumikila mdodo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Ghamatsuwa gha kweleka aghapfikile, Rebeka keleka iwana weli. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Chaudele tsakakala mdung'u, na lukuli lwake lwose tsalumema tsimvili. Apfo tsawamkema Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Imwana wa keli tsakelekighwa aku kamkinda Esau chisegheyu, apfo wamkema Yakobu. Isaka tsakakala na miyaka sitini Esau ne Yakobu hawelekighwe.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kohutsa haki yake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Iwana awo tsawakula, Esau tsakakala imunu iyamanyile ghendo kuwinga, yeye yang'ali yoghendagha kunyika, ila Yakobu tsakahola, tsakakala imunu wa kukala ukaye. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Isaka tsakamnoghela Esau, kwaapfila Isaka tsaanga'ali yodengelelagha ukuja inyama ye iwanyama iwakomighwe na Esau, lekeni Yakobu tsakamnoghela Rebeka.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Litsuwa limwe Yakobu hayang'ali yakwambika ghamapande, Esau koya ukaye kalawa kuwinga aku kana nzala ng'ani.<verse eid="GEN 25:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Apfo kamlongela Yakobu, “Chonde chonde, ngaya chijo acho chidung'u ndiye miyagho nzala yakwawa.” Ndo mana tsawamkema taghwa lyake Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobu kamwidika, “Tanu nihutsile haki yako ya chaudele.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esau kalonga, “Ulole, miyagho nahabehi ukufa, haki ya chaudele inyapfila choni?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakobu kamlongela, “Tanu wilahe.” Apfo Esau kelaha na kamuhutsila Yakobu haki yake ya uchaudele.<verse eid="GEN 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Kuya Yakobu kamwing'a Esau chighate na ghamapande. Esau kaja, kanwa, kuya kenuka koka. Apfo pfipfo Esau pfayaibetsile haki yake ya mwana chaudele.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Mne isi ila tsakukulawila inzala ng'ulu kubita nzala ila ya ghamatsuwa gha Abrahamu. Isaka kamghendela Abimeleki imfalume wa Wafilisti ako Gerari. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Imulungu kamlawila Isaka, kamlongela, “Uleke kughenda Misiri, ukale kune isi yanitsokulongela. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Ukale mna isi ayo, nitsokala naghwe na nitsokubaliki. Kwaapfila nitsokwing'a isi tsino tsose ghweghwe na watsukulu wako. Nitsolitimitsa laghano lyanitendile na aba wako Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Nitsokwing'a watsukulu wengi ka tsinondo itsili kulanga na nitsoweng'a isi tsino, na kubitila iwanagho iwanu wa isi tsose watsobalikighwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Nitsokubaliki, kwaapfila Abrahamu kanihulikitsa, katenda ghanimlongele atende na kakinda ghamalaghitso ghangu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Apfo Isaka tsakakala ako Gerari. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Iwanu wa Gerari hawamghutsile mbuli tsa ipinga wake, yeye tsakedika, “Ayuno lumbu wangu.” Mana tsakapfuka kulonga ka Rebeka mwehe wake, kwaapfila iwanu wa isi ila wang'amkomile wamsole Rebeka iyanoghile ng'ani. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Isaka tsakakala hala ghamatsuwa mengi, tsuwa limwe Abimeleki imfalume wa Wafilisti, tsaangali yolola kunze hane dirisha lyake, kamwona Isaka komkinda kinda Rebeka, mwehe wake. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Apfo Abimeleki tsakamkema Isaka, kalonga, “Ayuno mwehe wako ghendo! Mbona tsakulonga ayo lumbu wako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Isaka kamwidika, “Tsanipfuka ning'akomighwe na wang'amsolile Rebeka.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Kuya Abimeleki kalonga, “Ule kututendela pfino? Immale yumwe ang'awasile ne ipinga wako, ambe ung'atughalile ghamaghomba.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Apfo Abimeleki kawakanya iwanu wake, kawalongela, “Imunu wowose iyatsomtendela pfihile imunu yuno au ipinga wake, ayo katsokomighwa.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Mna ghumwaka ghughula, Isaka tsakahanda tsimbeghu mna isi ila na tsakapfuna mala miya imwe ya achila chahandile, kwaapfila Imulungu tsakambaliki. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Isaka tsakapata ipfinu pfingi, kuya kawa na mali nyingi. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Isaka tsakakala ne iwang'olo wengi, wang'ombe wengi na watumwa wengi mbaka Wafilisti wamwonela chepfu. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Apfo Wafilisti tsawapfifukia ipfisima pfose ipfihimbighwe ne iwatumwa wa Abrahamu, hala Abrahamu hayang'ali mghima.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Kuya Abimeleki kamlongela Isaka, “Ulawe mna isi yetu, mana sambi kuna ngupfu kubita twetwe.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Apfo Isaka kalawa mna isi ila, kaghenda kukala kune ulwanda lwa Gerari. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Kuya Isaka kapfihimba keli ipfisima apfila ipfihimbighwe mna ghamatsuwa gha Abrahamu, naye kapfikema mataghwa ghaghala ghapfing'ile aba wake.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Iwatumwa wa Isaka wahimba chisima mna ulwanda na wapata ghamatsi ghanoghile. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Lekeni iwadimi wa Gerari tsawesonga ne iwadimi wa Isaka walonga, “Ghamatsi ghano ghetu.” Apfo Isaka kachikema chisima chila, “Kwisonga.”<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Iwatumwa wa Isaka wahimba keli chisima chingi, lekeni wesongela keli chisima acho. Naye kachikema “Tsengwe.” <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Isaka kalawa hanu hala, kahimba chisima chingi lekeni ng'awesongele baye chisima acho, apfo kachikema Rehoboti. Kalonga, “Kwaapfila IMNDEWA katulekelela, twetwe tutsakongetseka mna isi ino.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Isaka kalawa ako kaghenda Beerisheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Chilo chila Imulungu kamlawila kamlongela, “Nene na Imulungu wa aba wako Abrahamu. Uleke kupfuka, nahamwe naghwe. Nitsokubaliki na nitsokwing'a watsukulu wengi kwa laghano lyanikile na mtumighwa wangu Abrahamu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Isaka katsenga hanu ha kulapfila inambiko ha ghamabwe, kamtanila Imtwatsa. Kuya katsenga hema, na iwatumwa wake wahimba chisima chingi.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimeleki welamlitsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Abimeleki, Ahusati sale yake, na Fikoli mkulu wa iwang'ewele walawa Gerari wamghendela Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Isaka kawaghutsa, “Ule mtsa kuna nene, ambe tsamnihila na mniwinga?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Wamwidika, “Lelo twomanya Imulungu kahamwe naghwe, apfo twetwe twakona pfinogha ghweghwe na twetwe twilahe, kuya twilaghane na ghweghwe, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />ka ng'utsotutendela ghehile, ka twetwe pfang'atukutendele ghehile, ila tsatukutendela ghanoghile na tukuleka ughende tseghamba. Ghweghwe sambi Imulungu kakubaliki.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Isaka kawatendela chihungo, wose waja na kunwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Walamka nemitondotondo litsuwa liwinzile, welaha ka pfawalongile. Kuya Isaka kawasindikitsa kawaleka waghende tseghamba. <verse eid="GEN 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Mna litsuwa lilila watumwa wa Isaka wamtsila wamlongela mbuli tsa achila ichisima chawahimbile, walonga, “Tupata ghamatsi.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Isaka kachikema chisima chila Sheba, apfo tsawaghukema ghumji agho Beerisheba.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kowakwela iwapinga Wakanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esau hakalile na miyaka arubaini, kakwela iwapinga weli Wakanaani, Yudisi imwana wa Beeri na Basemati imwana wa Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Iwapinga awo weli tsawaghala usungu kwa Isaka na Rebeka.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Isaka kombaliki Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Isaka tsakalala na nenge tsake ng'atsing'ali tsikona baye. Isaka kamkema Esau imwanaghe mkulu kamlongela, “Mwanangu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Naye kamwidika, “Oo aba wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Isaka kamlongela, “Ulole, sambi nene nilala kuya simanyile baye ka nitsakufa tsuwachi. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Lelo usole mghowa ghwako, ughende kwibagho ukaniwindile imnyama. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Kuya unyambikile chijo chinoghile chanibama, ungalile ndiye, ili nikubaliki ng'ana nife.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Isaka hayang'ali yolonga na Esau, Rebeka yang'ali yotegheletsa. Esau haghendile kuwinga, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Rebeka kamlongela Yakobu, “Nimuhulika aba wako kolonga na ndughu yako Esau, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‘Ungalile mnyama wa kwibagho, unyambikile chijo chinoghile ndiye, ili nikubaliki hambele he IMNDEWA ng'ana nife.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Lelo mwanangu unitegheletse na utende achila chanikulongela. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Ughende kune likingili lya iwamene usole mene weli wanoghile, ungalile nimwambikile aba wako chijo ichinoghile, achila ichimnoghela. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Kuya usole chijo acho umghalile aba wako, ili yakubaliki ng'ana yafe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Lekeni Yakobu kamlongela mai wake, “Mai, ambe Esau kana mvili mlukuli, lekeni nene nahela. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Lelo itsakuwatse aba wangu ang'anikinda? Ang'amanya ka nombugha ambe katsonilani, kuya ng'atsonibaliki baye.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Mai wake kamlongela, “Mwanangu, ka kulanighwa leka nilanighwe nene. Tenda chanikulongela, ghenda ungalile iwamene awo.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Apfo kaghenda kawasola iwamene awo kamghalila mai wake, naye mai wake kambika ichijo chinoghile, achila ichimnoghela Isaka, aba wake. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Kuya Rebeka kasola lighwanda ilinoghile lya Esau mwanaghe mkulu, ilikalile mng'anda mwake, kampfatsa Yakobu imwanaghe mdodo. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Kuya kamghubika ghamoko ne singo kwa ngotsi ye iwamene. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Kuya kamwing'a Yakobu chijo ichinoghile na chighate chayambike.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Kuya Yakobu kamghendela aba wake kamkema, “Aba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Naye kamwidika, “Oo mwanangu, ghweghwe uli nani?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakobu kamwidika aba wake, “Nene Esau imwanagho chaudele. Nitenda ka pfaunongele. Lelo ukale hasi uje inyama yanikughalile, ili unibaliki.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Lekeni Isaka kamghutsa, “Mwanangu, pfii mbona kupata himahima?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Yakobu kamwidika, “Kwaapfila Imtwatsa, Imulungu wako kanyapfila.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Isaka kamlongela Yakobu, “Haya mwanangu seghela habehi nikukinde, nimanye ka ghweghwe kwa mwanangu ghendo Esau au kwa imunu yungi.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Yakobu kamsoghelela habehi aba wake, naye kambamasa kuya kalonga, “Litsi lyino, litsi lya Yakobu, lekeni ghamoko ghano, ghamoko gha Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Isaka ng'amtangile baye, kwaapfila ghamoko ghake tsaghakala ne tsimvili ka ghamoko gha Esau ndughu yake, apfo ang'ali yobama kumbaliki, <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />kamghutsa keli, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa mwanangu ghendo Esau?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Kamwidika, “Ona, nene.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Kuya Isaka kalonga, “Mwanangu, ngalile nyama yuwindile ndiye nikubaliki.” Yakobu kamghalila chijo kaja, pfipfila kamghalila idipfai, kanwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Kuya aba wake kamlongela, “Mwanangu, utse ano twihagatile.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Yakobu kamsoghelela habehi aba wake, nawo wehaghatila, Isaka hayanusile ghamaghwanda ghake, tsakambaliki kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">“Lola mwanangu, pfaunung'ila ghoya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">ka mghunda ighubalikighwe ne Imtwatsa.<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Nomlomba Imulungu yakuhulumsile litungwe kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">akwing'e lidongo linoghe, ipfijo ne idipfai!<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Makabila ghasokutumikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na iwanu watsokutowela ghamaghoti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Kutsowatawala ndughu tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na iwana wa mai wako watsotowa ghamaghoti hambele hako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Iwanu iwatsokulani watsolanighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na iwanu wala iwokubaliki watsobalikiwa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kolomba yabalikighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Isaka hamalitse kumbaliki Yakobu, na bahala Yakobu hayang'ali yolawa kwa aba wake, Esau koya kulawa kuwinda. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Naye Esau kamwambikila aba wake chijo ichinoghile. Kuya kamlongela, “Aba wangu, winuke uje nyama yanikughalile, ili unibaliki.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Aba wake kamghutsa, “Ghweghwe uli nani lelo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Naye kamwidika, “Nene Esau, mwanagho chaudele.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Isaka tsakadedema ng'ani kalonga, “Angu nani yula iyawindile na kunighalila nyama? Kuya ma ndiya ng'ana ghweghwe utse, na ma nimbaliki, naye katsobalikiwa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Esau hayahulike apfo, kalila kwa ukukemelela kwa usungu mkulu kalonga, “Aba wangu, unibaliki na nene!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Aba wake kamwidika, “Ndughu yako katsa kangutsukila, nani nimbaliki.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esau kalonga, “Ayu ghendo taghwa lyake Yakobu. Kanibugha mala mbili, tanu tsakasola haki yangu ya mwana chaudele, na sambi kasola balaka yangu!” Kuya kamghutsa aba wake, “Lelo ng'undekele balaka baye na nene?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Isaka kamwidika, “Nimtenda Yakobu yawe mtwatsa wako na niwatenda ndughu tsake wawe watumwa wake, na nimwing'a pfijo na idipfai. Lelo nikutendele choni mwanangu?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esau kamlongela aba wake, “Aba wangu, apfi kwahela balaka ingi? Unibaliki na nene!” Kuya Esau kalila ng'ani.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Kuya Isaka kamwidika, “Kaye yako itsokuwa kutali na lidongo linoghile, na kutsokala kutali na tungwe lya kulanga. <verse eid="GEN 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Kutsokala kwa lipanga lyako, na kutsomtumikila ndughu yako. Lekeni hautsoswekuka, ngutsolongosighwa naye keli.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Apfo Esau kamuhila Yakobu, kwaapfila aba wake tsakambaliki Yakobu. Esau tsakelongela, “Ghamatsuwa gha kumlilila aba wetu ghahabehi, apfo nitsomkoma ndughu yangu Yakobu.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Lekeni Rebeka hayahulike achila chayobama kutenda Esau, kamtuma imunu aghende kumkema Yakobu, imwanaghe mdodo, kamlongela, “Lola, ndughu yako Esau kobama yakukome. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Lelo mwanangu, utende chanikulongela. Utsumile kwa ndughu yangu Labani iyokala ako Harani. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Ukale naye chidogho mbaka maya ya ndughu yako haitsohola. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Maya ya ndughu yako haitsohola na kwisemwa aghala ghumtendele, nitsomtuma imunu yakuitse ukaye. Ebali nimwaghitseni wanangu wose weli mala lumwe?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu koghalighwa kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Rebeka kamlongela Isaka, “Iwapinga wano Wahiti wonidesa ghendo. Yakobu ang'akwela ipinga mna isi ino, iwapinga ka Wahiti wano, ughima wangu utsakuwa wahela mana.”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Apfo Isaka kamkema Yakobu kambaliki, kamlaghitsa kamlongela, “Uleke kukwela pinga Mkanani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Ghenda Pedani Aramu sambi baha, ukaye kwa sekulu wako Betueli, umkwele neghe yumwe wa mtumba wako Labani. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Imulungu yane ngupfu ng'ani yakubaliki, yakwing'e iwana ketseketse, ili uwe aba wa isi nyingi. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Imulungu yakubaliki ghweghwe ne watsukulu wako ka pfayambaliki Abrahamu, ili isi iuli mgheni sambi iwe yako, isi ino Imulungu yammwing'ile Abrahamu!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Kuya Isaka kamghala Yakobu, naye kaghenda Padani Aramu, kwa Labani imwana wa Betueli, Mwaramu. Labani lumbu wake Rebeka, mai wawo tsina Yakobu na Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kokwela pinga yungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Esau hayonile Isaka kambaliki Yakobu na kamlongela aghende kukwela Padani Aramu. Pfipfila tsakahulika ka Isaka hayambalikile Yakobu, kamlaghitsa aleke kukwela ipinga Mkanani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Kuya Esau tsakamanya ka Yakobu kawategheletsa mai wake na aba wake, kaghenda Padani Aramu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Kuya Esau kamanya ka aba wake ng'onoghelwa baye ne iwapinga Wakanani. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Apfo Esau kaghenda kwa Ismaili imwana wa Abrahamu, kamkwela ipinga yungi, yakemighwe Mahalati, neghe Ismaili, lumbu jake Nebayoti.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu kolota ako Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakobu kalawa Beesheba, kaghenda Harani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Hayapfikile hanu hamwenga, tsakawasa aho kwaapfila litsua tsaliswa. Kasola libwe lya hanu ho, kalika hasi he litwi lyake, kawasa. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Kalota, kona ludanala lwimitsighwa muisi, na kusa kwake kupfika kulanga. Kuya malaika we Imulungu wang'ali wogheluka na kuhulumka mludanala. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Na mludanala amo kema IMNDEWA, kamlongela, “Nene Imtwatsa, Imulungu wa Abrahamu na Imulungu wa Isaka, aba wako. Nitsokwing'a ghweghwe na watsukulu wako isi ino yuwasile. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Watsukulu wako watsokuwa wengi ka litimbwisi lya iisi. Nawo watsakwenela ubali wa kwalilawila litsua na kwaliswela litsua, na ubali wa kuchang'a na wa kuhisi. Kubitila ghweghwe ne iwatsukulu wako, iwanu wose muisi watsobalikiwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Nene nahamwe naghwe na nitsokulolesa kwokwose kughenda, no ukukuyitsa mna isi ino. Sitsokuleka mbaka nikutendele achila chanikulongele.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Kuya Yakobu kalamka, kalonga, “IMNDEWA kahano ghendo, tsasimanyile baye!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Yakobu kapfuka, kalonga, “Hanu hano honikangawatsa! Aino ng'anda ye Imulungu ghendo, na alino libani lya kulanga.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Nemitondotondo litsuwa liwinzile Yakobu kasola libwe lyaliwasile, kalika ka ngutso na kalighidila ghamafuta liwe lya Imtwatsa. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Yakobu kahakema hanu hala Beseli, mana yake ng'anda ye Imulungu, lekeni ghumji ghula tsaghukemighwa Lusu. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Kuya Yakobu kelaha kalonga, “Imulungu ung'akala hamwe na nene na kunilolesa mna ghumwanza ghwangu na ung'angaya chijo na ghamaghwanda, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />nani ning'oya tseghamba ukaye kwa aba wangu, ghweghwe IMNDEWA kutsokuwa Imulungu wangu. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Libwe lyino lyanikile hano ka ngutso, hatsakuwa hanu ho ukukutamanila ghweghwe Imulungu, nani nitsokwing'a hanu ha kumi mna pfinu pfose pfaungayile.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu kopfika ukaye kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Kuya Yakobu kaghendelela na ghumwanza, kapfika isi ya iwanu wa ubali wa kwalilawila litsua. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Hanu hala kona chisima kuchiwala, hamwe na makingili madatu ghe iwang'olo iwawasile habehi ne ichisima, kwaapfila tsawang'ali wakunwagha ghamatsi ghe chisima chila ichighubikighwe ne libwe likulu. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Makingili ghe iwang'olo haghetinganagha hanu hala, wadimi wolibimbilisa libwe alyo kulawa mchisima na kuwanwesa ghamatsi iwang'olo. Kuya woliyuitsa libwe hanu hake.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakobu kawaghutsa wadimi awo, “Hamlamke ndughu tsangu, mlawa kwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Wadimi wamwidika, “Twolawa Harani.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Kawaghutsa keli, “Pfii Labani mtsukulu wa Nohari mummanya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Wamwidika, “Ona, tummanya.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Kuya Yakobu kawaghutsa, “Pfii kalamka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Wamwidika, “Ona kalamka, na Raheli, neghe wake ayula hala kakutsa ne iwang'olo.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yakobu kalonga, “Kwaapfila kung'ali misi, na chino si chipindi che iwanyama kwitingana. Wanweseni ghamatsi na muwasole mkawadime.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Wamwidika, “Ng'atudaha baye kutenda apfo mbaka wanyama wose wetingane, na libwe libimbilisighwe kutali ne chisima. Kuya tutsowanwesa ghamatsi iwang'olo.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Yakobu hayang'ali yolonga nawo, Raheli kafika ne iwang'olo wa aba wake, kwaapfila yeye iyo iyang'ali yowadima. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Yakobu hayamwonile Raheli neghe Labani, mtumba wake na iwang'olo wa Labani, kaghenda kulibimbilisa libwe lilawe hane chisima, kawanwesa ghamatsi iwang'olo wa mtumba wake. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Kuya Yakobu kamnonela Raheli, na kandusa ukulila kwa kudamilila. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Yakobu kamlongela Raheli yeye tsakakala mwiwa wa aba wake na tsakakala imwana wa Rebeka. Apfo Raheli katsuma kaghenda kumlongela aba wake. <verse eid="GEN 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Bahala Labani hayahulike mbuli tsa Yakobu, mwiwaghe, katsuma kaghenda kumbokela, kamkumbatila, kamnonela, kamghala ukaye yake. Kuya Yakobu kamlongela Labani ghose ighalawile. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Labani kamlongela, “Ghweghwe kwa mwiwangu ghendo, twolawa lukolo lumwe.” Yakobu kakala hala ghumwetsi ghwose.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu kowakwela Lea na Raheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Labani kamlongela Yakobu, “Kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa ndughu yangu, lelo unisang'anile hela? Nongele nikulihe choni?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Labani tsakana neghe weli, neghe wake mkulu tsakakemighwa Lea, na neghe wake mdodo tsakakemighwa Raheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Lea tsakana nenge tsinoghile, lekeni Raheli tsakana lukuli lunoghile, yeye tsakanogha sideke.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Raheli tsakamnoghela Yakobu, apfo Yakobu kamlongela Labani, “Ung'angaya Raheli, neghe wako mdodo nimkwele, nitsokusang'anila kwa miyaka saba.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Labani kamwidika, “Ng'apfu nikwing'e ghweghwe, na si kumwing'a imunu yungi baye. Ukale hano na nene.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Yakobu tsakasang'ana miyaka saba ili yamkwele Raheli, miyaka saba kuna yeye tsayoneka ka si chinu baye, kwaapfila Raheli tsakamnoghela sideke.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Kuya Yakobu kamlongela Labani, “Ungaye mwehe wangu, ghamatsuwa ghangu ghamala, nobama nimkwele.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Apfo Labani kawakema iwanu wose, katenda chihungo. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Lekeni chilo chila, Labani kamsola Lea, kamghala kwa Yakobu, Yakobu kawasa naye. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Labani kamlapfa Silipa, imtumwa wake ipinga, kamwinga Lea ili yamsang'anile. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Nemitondo haifikile, Yakobu tsakamanya ka ayula tsakakala Lea! Apfo Yakobu kaghenda kummanila Labani, “Ebali unitendele pfino? Ambe nikusang'anila nimkwele Raheli. Ule unibughile?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labani kamwidika, “Muisi mwetu ng'atutendagha apfo baye, mdodo ukukwelighwa ng'ana mkulu wake yakwelighwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Mtimilitsile Lea ghamatsuwa ghake saba gha ukukwelighwa, kuya tutsokwing'a Raheli, kwa kunisang'anila miyaka saba ingi.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yakobu katoghola, ghamatsuwa saba gha kukala na Lea haghamalile, Labani kamwing'a Yakobu Raheli, neghe wake yamkwele. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Labani kamlapfa Biliha, mtumwa wake ipinga, kamwing'a Raheli ili yamsang'anile. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Yakobu pfipfila tsakawasa na Raheli, kamnoghela ng'ani Raheli kubita Lea. Kuya kamsang'anila Labani miyaka ingi saba.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wa Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />IMNDEWA hayonile Lea ng'omnoghela baye Yakobu, kamtenda yeleke iwana, lekeni Raheli tsakakala ng'akweleka baye. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Lea tsakakinda inda keleka imwana, tsakamkema imwana ayo Rubeni. Lea kalonga, “IMNDEWA kona ukudununzika kwangu, lelo nitsomnoghela mmale wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Lea kakinda keli inda, keleka keli imwana, kalonga, “Kwaapfila Imulungu kahulika ka simnoghela baye Yakobu, kangaya imwana yungi.” Apfo tsakamkema imwana ayo Simoni. <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Lea kakinda hinda ingi, keleka imwana yungi mmale. Kalonga, “Lelo mmale wangu katselunga na nene, kwaapfila nimwelekela iwana wadatu.” Apfo kamkema mwana ayo Lawi. <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Kuya Lea kakinda keli inda, keleka imwana yungi. Kalonga, “Chipindi chino nitsomtunitsa Imtwatsa.” Apfo tsakamkema Yuda. Kuya Lea tsakema ukweleka.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Raheli hayonile ng'odaha baye kumwelekela Yakobu iwana, kamwonela chepfu mkulu wake. Kamlongela Yakobu, “Ngaya iwana, hela nitsakufa!”<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yakobu kamwonela maya Raheli kamlongela, “Nene si Imulungu baye. Imulungu iyo iyakutendile uleke ukweleka.”<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Kuya Raheli kalonga, “Ayuno ahano Biliha mtumwa wangu. Uwase naye, yanyelekele nene iwana. Nene nitsopata iwana kubitila yeye.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Apfo Raheli tsakamwing'a Yakobu mtumwa wake Biliha. Naye Yakobu kawasa naye. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Kuya Biliha kakinda inda, kamwelekela Yakobu mwana mmale. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Raheli kalonga, “Imulungu kanendela ghoya kahulika chililo changu, kangaya imwana.” Apfo tsakamkema mwana ayo Dani. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Biliha kakinda keli inda, kamwelekelawa Yakobu imwana mmale. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Kuya Raheli kalonga, “Nitowa ng'ani na mkulu wangu, lekeni nihuma.” Apfo tsakamkema imwana ayo Nafutali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Lea hayonile kaleka ukweleka, kamwing'a Yakobu mtumwa wake Zilipa yawe ipinga wake. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Kuya Zilipa kamwelekela Yakobu imwana mmale. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Lea kalonga, “Aino ndondokela.” Apfo tsakamkema imwana ayo Gadi. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Zilipa kamwelekela Yakobu imwana yungi mmale. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Kuya Lea kalonga, “Nibweda! Iwapinga wose watsonikema nibweda.” Apfo tsakamkema imwana ayo Asheri.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Mna ghamatsuwa gha ukupfuna, Rubeni tsakaghenda kulwanda, ako tsakapata mitsitsi ya mbiki iughukemighwe mandilake, kamghalila Lea, mai wake mitsitsi ayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:14">Raheli kamlongela Lea, “Chonde chonde ngaya chidogho mitsitsi ayo ye imwanagho.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iwanu tsawafikitsa mitsitsi ye mbiki awo yodaha kumtenda ipinga yadahe kweleka iwana</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Lea kamwidika, “Apfi ghweghwe kwakwona pfidodo pfaunibokile mmale wangu, kuya sambi kobama usole mitsitsi ye imwanangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Raheli kamlongela, “Ung'angaya mitsitsi ye imwanagho, chilo chino kutsowasa na Yakobu.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Mihe ila Yakobu hayang'ali yolawa kumghunda, Lea kaghenda kumbokela, kamlongela, “Kutsowasa na nene chilo chino, kwaapfila nikulihila ghweghwe kwa mitsitsi ye imwanangu.” Apfo chilo chila Yakobu tsakawasa na Lea.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Imulungu kamtegheletsa Lea, naye kakinda inda, kamwelekela Yakobu imwana wa tano. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Kuya Lea kalonga, “Imulungu kanighweka, kwaapfila tsanimwing'a mmale wangu mtumwa wangu.” Apfo kamkema imwana ayo Isakari. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Lea kakinda inda keli kamwelekela Yakobu imwana wa sita. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Kuya Lea kalonga, “Imulungu kanighweka pfinoghile. Lelo immale wangu katsonitoghola, kwaapfila nimwelekela imwana wa sita.” Apfo tsakamkema imwana ayo Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Hambele keleka imwana pinga, tsakamkema Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Kuya Imulungu ng'amsemwile baye Raheli, kamtegheletsa chayalombile, kamtenda yadahe kweleka iwana. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Raheli kakinda inda keleka imwana mmale, kalonga, “Imulungu kaleghusa chinyala changu.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Apfo tsakamkema imwana ayo Yosefu, kalonga, mana yake, “Imulungu yangaye imwana yungi mmale.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mifugho ya Yakobu yakongetseka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Raheli hamweleke Yosefu, Yakobu kamlongela Labani, “Ndekelele mbuye ukaye yetu, mna isi yangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Ngaya iwapinga wangu ne iwanangu, yanikusang'anile, nobama mbuke nawo. Kwomanya pfanikusang'anile ghoya.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Lekeni Labani kamlongela, “Undeke nonge chinu chimwe tanu, chondechonde uleke ukuka. Nimanya IMNDEWA kanibaliki kubitila ghweghwe.” <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Labani kalonga, “Nongele chubama nikulihe, nani nitsokuliha.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yakobu kamlongela, “Kwomanya pfanikusang'anile na pfanikulolelesele iwanyama wako. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Ahala ng'ana nipfike ghweghwe tsakukala na pfinu pfidodo lekeni kulawa hanipfikile IMNDEWA kakubaliki, pfinu pfako pfongetseka sideke, kwokwose kwanighendile. Lelo tsuwachi nene hanitsoilolesa kaye yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Labani kamghutsa, “Nikwing'e choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yakobu kamwidika, “Uleke kungaya chinu chochose. Lekeni ung'anendela pfino, nitsoghendelela kuwalolesa iwanyama wako. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Leloli ndekelele nilute mna kingili lye iwanyama wako, nibaghule chila ng'olo yane madowadowa na mabaka, na chila ng'olo mtitu kulawa mna iwang'olo awo, na wamene wane madowadowa na mabaka. Iwanyama awo watsokuwa maliho ghangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Ghamatsuwa ighakutsa wende wangu utsakoneka ghendo hautsokutsa kulola maliho ghangu. Imene wowose iyalihela madowadowa au mabaka, au ng'olo wowose iyali si mtitu baye, ang'akwoneka mna iwanyama wangu, ayo katsopetighwa ka kebighwa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Labani kamwidika, “Pfinogha, iwe ka pfaulongile.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Litsuwa lilila kawabaghula wamvulati wose wane mabaka na madowadowa, na mbughuma wose iwali na mabaka na madowadowa, na chila mnyama iyali na dowa tselu mlukuli, na iwang'olo wose watitu, kaweng'a iwanaghe wawalolese. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Labani tsakaghenda kukala kutali na Yakobu, utali wake tsaukala wa ghumwanza wa matsuwa madatu. Naye Yakobu yang'ali yowadima iwanyama wa Labani iwasighale. <verse eid="GEN 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Yakobu kasola tsifito mbisi tsa imibiki ya mlubina, mlotsi na mwalamoni, katsibambula ili misitali mitselu yoneke mna tsifito atso. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Kuya katsihomeka tsifito atso hanu ho ukunwela ghamatsi iwanyama. Na kwaapfila wanyama Ftsile kunwa ghamatsi wang'ali webebesela hanu hala, <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />wapata tombo hambele he tsifito atso, kuya weleka iwanyama wane imisitali, ghamabaka na madowadowa.<verse eid="GEN 30:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yakobu kawabaghula iwang'olo awo kulawa mna iwamene, kuya kawatenda wawalolese iwanyama wala iwali ne misitari na watitu mna kingili lye iwanyama wa Labani. Kwa kutenda apfo kepatila kingili lyake mwenyegho, na kawabaghula iwanyama wake, kutali ne iwanyama wa Labani.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Kuya chila ghamatsuwa gha iwanyama wane ngupfu kutitsa haghapfikile, Yakobu katsika tsifito tsila hambele hawo hanu ha kunwela ghamatsi, ili webebesele habehi ne tsifito tsila. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Lekeni ng'atsikile baye tsifito tsila kuchughu mwe iwanyama iwalihela ngupfu. Apfo iwanyama iwalihela ngupfu tsawakala wa Labani, na iwanyama wane ngupfu tsawakala wa Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Apfo Yakobu tsakapata mali nyingi. Tsakakala ne iwanyama wengi, iwatumwa, ngamiya na pfihongwe.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu kotsuma kulawa kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Yakobu tsakahulika iwana wa Labani wang'ali wolonga, “Yakobu kasola pfinu pfose pfa aba wetu, na kawa na mali ketseketse kulawa mna mali tsa aba wetu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Pfipfila Yakobu tsakamanya ka ng'amnoghele Labani ka pfamnoghele ghumwande.<verse eid="GEN 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Kuya IMNDEWA kalomngela Yakobu, “Uye kune isi ye iwabala wako na ndughu tsako, na nene nitsokuwa naghwe.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Apfo Yakobu kawatuma iwanu wakawalongele Raheli na Lea watingane naye kunyika kwawali iwanyama wake. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Yakobu kawalongela, “Nakona simnoghela keli baye aba wenu ka mwanduso, lekeni Imulungu wa aba wangu kahamwe na nene. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Namwe mwomanya ka nimsang'anila aba wenu kwa ngupfu tsangu tsose. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Kuya aba wenu tsakangutsukila kwa kughalusa maliho ghangu mala kumi. Lekeni Imulungu ng'amlekelele baye yanendele chinu chihile. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Chila hayalongile, ‘Iwanyama iwali ne madowadowa nitsokuliha ghweghwe,’ kuya iwanyama weleka iwanyama wane madowadowa. Na hayalongile, ‘Iwanyama iwali ne misitali nitsokuliha ghweghwe,’ kuya iwanyama wose weleka iwanyama wane misitali. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Apfo Imulungu kawasola iwanyama wa aba wenu, kuya kangaya nene.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Ghamatsuwa gha iwanyama kutitsa, tsanilota mvulati wowabebesa mbughuma wane misitari, wane madowadowa na wane ghamabaka. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Malaika we Imulungu kanongela mndoto, ‘Yakobu!’ Nimwidika, ‘Oo.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Naye kanongela, ‘Winule tsinenge wone mvulati wowabebesa mbughuma wane misitali, wana madowadowa na wana ghamabaka, kwaapfila nighona aghala ghayakutendele Labani. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Nene na Imulungu iyanikulawile akula Beteli, akula kwaughidile ghamapfuta mna ingutso na ukwilaha kuna nene. Lelo ulawe isi aino, uye ukaye yako kwawoneke.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Kuya Raheli na Lea wamwidika, “Twetwe twahela ipfinu pfa ukuhala mkaye mwa aba wetu. <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Katutenda twetwe ka wahenza. Katuutsa, kuya katsija sendi tsetu tsose. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Mali tsose Imulungu tsayasolile tsa aba wetu, tsakwetu ghendo na tsa wenetu. Apfo utende chochose chayakulongele Imulungu.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Kuya Yakobu kawabapitsa iwanaghe na wehe tsake mna wangamiya.<verse eid="GEN 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Yakobu kasola iwanyama wake wose na mali tsake tsayapatile ako Padani Aramu, kandusa ghumwanza gho ukuya mna isi ya Kanaani kwa aba wake, Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Ng'ana woke Yakobu na wehe tsake, Labani hayaghendile kuwaghana mighala iwang'olo wake, Raheli kamwibila aba wake pfinyagho pfa imilungu yake. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Pfipfila Yakobu tsakambugha Labani, munu wa Aramu, ng'amlongele baye ka kakuka. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Apfo katsuma ne pfinu pfake, kaloka ghumto Efurati, kaghenda isi ya pfidunda ya Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Labani komuwinza Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Mne litsuwa lya kadatu Labani kahulika Yakobu katsuma koka. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Labani kawasola ndughu tsake, wamkoleletsa Yakobu kwa ghamatsuwa saba, kuya wampfika mna isi ya pfidunda ya Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Lekeni chilo chila Imulungu kamtsila Labani, munu wa Aramu, mndoto, kamlongela, “Wilolese uleke kumlongela Yakobu imbuli yoyose imtenda yone maya.” <verse eid="GEN 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Yakobu katsenga chibumbulika chake mna isi ya pfidunda ya Gileadi, na Labani na ndughu tsake watsenga chibumbulika chao baho.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Kuya Labani kamlongela Yakobu, “Utendile choni? Mbona kunibugha, kuwasola neghe tsangu ka wanu iwasolighwe mng'ondo? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Ebali ukile chinyelenyele na kunibugha? Ung'anilongele, ning'akuwaghile kwa kudeng'elela, kukwimbila na kukutowela ngoma na pfimbeta. <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Ule ng'undekelele niwaaghe kwa kuwanonela watsukulu wangu na iwanangu? Achi chutendile chinu ng'achinoghile baye. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Nene nodaha kukulagha, lekeni chilo chino Imulungu wa aba wako kanongela, ‘Wilolese uleke kumlongela Yakobu imbuli yoyose, imtenda yone maya.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Lelo ghweghwe tsakutsuma, kwaapfila tsakusulukila sideke kuya ukaye kwa aba wako. Lekeni ebali unyibile pfinyagho pfangu?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobu kamwidika Labani, “Tsanipfuka, kwaapfila tsanitsagha ung'anibokile neghe tsako. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Lekeni ung'amwona imunu yane pfinyagho pfako, katsokomighwa. Ulole chinu chochose ichili chako hambele ha ndughu tsetu, kuya uchisole.” Yakobu ng'amanyile baye ka Raheli tsakeba pfinyagho pfa Labani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Apfo Labani kengila mna chibumbulika cha Yakobu, cha Lea, na cha iwatumwa mapinga wala weli, lekeni ng'apfonile baye. Kalawa mna chibumbulika cha Lea, kengila mna chibumbulika cha Raheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Raheli tsakapfisola pfinyagho apfo, kapfipfisa mghati mwe ipfilagho pfa ngamiya, kapfikalila. Labani tsakabama mna chibumbulika chose lekeni ng'apfone baye. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Raheli kamlongela aba wake, “Aba wangu, uleke kumbonela maya, sidaha baye kwima hambele hako, nakumto.” Labani kapfibama pfinyagho pfake lekeni ng'apfonile baye.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Yakobu tsakona maya, kesonga na Labani, kamghutsa, “Chinu chachi chihile chanikutendele? Nitotsile choni mbaka unikoleletse pfino? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Kubama mna pfinu pfangu pfose lelo upatile choni? Uchike hambele ha ndughu tsako na ndughu tsangu, ili watulamle nene ne ghweghwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Tsanikala naghwe kwa miyaka ishilini. Ghamatsuwa agho ghose wang'olo wako wala wamene wako ng'awalekile baye kweleka, wala sijile baye ng'unzu kulawa mna iwanyama wako. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Nene sikughalile baye hata mala lumwe imnyama wako yakomighwe ne iwanyama wa kumuhulo, ila nene tsanikuliha. Ghweghwe tsakubama nikulihe kwa chochose ichibighwe nemisi au nechilo. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Nemisi litsuwa tsalinyalikila, na nechilo chipfeghetsi tsachinipfegha. Tsasipatile baye tsinongo. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Miyaka ishirini tsanikala mkaye mwako. Tsanikusang'anila miyaka kumi na mine niwakwele neghe tsako, na miyaka sita niwadima iwanyama wako, naghwe tsakughalusa maliho ghangu mala kumi. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Ka Imulungu wa aba wangu, yuyo Imulungu wa Abrahamu, Imulungu wa Isaka, ng'akalile na nene baye, ung'aniwingile ghendo mbuke ghamoko gheliheka. Lekeni Imulungu kaghona maghayo ghangu, na sang'ano ya ghamoko ghangu, na chilo chilutile kakumanila.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu na Labani wakwika laghano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Labani kamwidika Yakobu, “Awano hano neghe tsangu, awano nawo watsukulu wangu, na awano iwanyama wangu, na ghose ghaukona ghangu. Angu nidahatse kuwatendela chihile neghe tsangu ne iwana yawaweleke? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Leka twilaghane nene na ghweghwe, laghano alyo liwe ukalangama kuna nene na ghweghwe.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Apfo Yakobu kasola libwe, kalimisa ka ngutso. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Kawalongela ndughu tsake, “Mkunge ghamabwe.” Apfo wasola ghamabwe waghalundika, kuya waja ichijo habehi na ghamabwe agho. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Labani kaghakema ghamabwe ghala Yegasahaduta, lekeni Yakobu kaghakema Galedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Labani kamlongela Yakobu, “Ghamabwe ghano gha ukalangama kuna nene na ghweghwe leloli.” Apfo tsaghakemighwa Galedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Pfipfila Labani kalonga, “IMNDEWA yatulolese hata ka tung'awa kutali nene na ghweghwe.” Apfo hanu hala pfipfila tsahakemighwa Mispa. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Labani kaghendelela kulonga, “Ung'awadununza neghe tsangu au ung'akwela iwapinga wangi, uleke kusemwa Imulungu ka mkalangama wetu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Labani kamlongela Yakobu, “Aghano hano ghamabwe na haino hano ngutso yatwikile haghati hetu. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Ghamabwe ghano gha ukalangama, sitsoghaloka ghamabwe ghano kutsa kuna ghweghwe kukulagha. Naghwe ng'utsoghaloka baye ghamabwe ghano na ngutso ino haukutsa kunilagha. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Imulungu wa Abrahamu, Imulungu wa Nahori, na Imulungu wa aba tsetu, yatuhighe twetwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 31:53">Yakobu tsakelaha kwa Imulungu wa Isaka, aba wake kwika laghano lyino. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Yakobu kamsubutula imnyama, kalapfa nambiko hana ichidunda, kawakema ndughu tsake watse waje ichijo. Hawamalitse ukuja, wakala ako chilo chose. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Nemitondotondo litsuwa liwinzile Labani kalamka, kawanonela iwatsukulu wake na neghe tsake, kawabaliki. Kuya koka, koya ukaye yawo.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu keyandaa kwitingana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Yakobu tsakaghendelela na ghumwanza na mzila ketingana ne wamalaika we Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Yakobu hawonile kalonga, “Alino kingili lya iwang'ewele we Imulungu!” Apfo kahakema hanu hala Mahanaimu.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Yakobu tsakawatuma wasenga wamlongole kughenda kwa Esau ndughu yake, ako Seiri, isi ya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Kawalaghitsa wakalonge apfino, “Nene mtumighwa wako Yakobu nolonga kwa mkulu wangu Esau ka nikala na Labani mbaka leloli. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Nina ng'ombe, pfihongwe, wang'olo, wamene na watumwa. Mtwatsa wangu nokutumila usenga uno ili hanifika umbonele libatsi.”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Wasenga hawoyile kwa Yakobu, wamlongela, “Tughenda kwa ndughu yako Esau, naye kamnzila kakutsa kwitingana naghwe. Kakutsa ne iwanu miya nne.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Yakobu tsakadedema na kupfuka. Kawaghola makingili meli iwanu iwakalile naye, pfipfila tsakawaghola wang'olo, wamene, wang'ombe na wangamiya. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Tsakepfikitsa, “Esau ang'atsa na kulikoma kingili limwe, kingili lingi litsohona.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Kuya Yakobu kalomba, “Ghwe Imulungu wa aba wangu Abrahamu, Imulungu wa sekulu wangu Isaka, ghwe IMNDEWA yunongele, ‘Uye muisi mwako na kwa ndughu tsako nitsokutendela ghanoghile.’ <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Nene sibamighwe baye ukubokela uluso waunendele nene mtumighwa wako. Kwaapfila hanilokile ghumto ghwa Yoridani tsang'ala na ng'weku iliyeka, lekeni sambi nina makingili meli. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Nokulomba, ung'ombole mna ghumoko ghwa Esau, nompfuka kwaapfila katsotukoma, nene, tsina mai ne iwana wawo. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Lekeni kunongela kutsonendela pfinoghile na kutsongaya iwana ketseketse ka ghumsanga ghwa kumwani ing'aghupeteka” <verse eid="GEN 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Chilo chila Yakobu tsakawasa hala. Kuya kabaghula iwanyama yalinawo kamwing'a nzawadi Esau ndughu yake, <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />mbughuma miya mbili na mvulati ishirini, ng'olo wapinga miya mbili na wang'unzu ishirini, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />ngamiya selasini iwoghwaghwitsa, ng'ombe wapinga alubaini na ng'ombe iwamale kumi, na pfihongwe iwapinga ishilini na pfihongwe iwamale kumi. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Kaweng'a iwatumwa wake wawalolese, chila yumwe na kingili lyake. Kawalongela watumwa wake, “Mnilongole, mwike nyafwasi kulawa kingili limwe na kingili lingi.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Kamlaghitsa imtumwa yula iyalongole, “Hautsetingana na ndughu yangu Esau na ang'akughutsa, ‘Ghweghwe mtumwa wa nani? Ughenda kwani? Iwanyama wano iwali hambele yako wa nani?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Ghweghwe umwidike, ‘Iwanyama wano wa mtumwa wako Yakobu, kakughalila ghweghwe ka nzawadi mkulu wangu Esau. Na Yakobu mwenyegho kakuchisogho kakutsa.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Pfipfila kamlaghitsa pfipfo mtumwa wa kingili lya kabili na lya kadatu na iwanu wangi wose, “Hamtingana naye mumlongele pfipfo. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Mlonge pfino, ‘Mtumwa wako Yakobu kakuchisogho kakutsa.’ ” Kwaapfila tsakapfikitsa, “Nitsomuhotsa kwa nzawadi tsanilongotsa, songaha hanitsotingana naye kodaha kunibokela ghoya.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Apfo Yakobu katsilongotsa nzawadi atso, lekeni chilo chila yeye tsakawasa mna chibumbulika.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu kokemighwa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Chilo chichila tsakalamka, kawasola wehe wake weli, watumwa wake mapinga weli, iwanaghe kumi na yumwe, kaloka ghumto Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Kawalosa wose ne pfinu pfose pfawalinapfo. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Apfo Yakobu kalekighwa yaliyeka, kuya imunu yumwe katsa, tsaketowa naye mbaka lupfilipfili. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Imunu yula hayonile ng'odaha baye kumhuma Yakobu, kamtowa mna lihatsa, ghumghulu ghugholojoka. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Imunu yula kalonga, “Ndeke mbuke, kwaapfila sambi kwakwenzeluka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Yakobu kamwidika, “Sikulekelela baye mbaka unibaliki.”<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Imunu ayo kamghutsa, “Taghwa lyako nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Kamwidika, “Yakobu.” <verse eid="GEN 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Imunu yula kalonga, “Ng'utsokemighwa keli Yakobu, ila kutsokemighwa Isiraeli, kwaapfila kwitowa ne Imulungu ne iwanu, kuya kuhuma.”<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Yakobu kalonga, “Chonde chonde nongele taghwa lyako nani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Imunu yula kamwidika, “Ule ubama kumanya taghwa lyangu?” Kuya kambaliki Yakobu.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Yakobu kahakema hanu hala Penueli, kwaapfila tsakalonga, “Nimwona Imulungu chihanga kwa chihanga, nani ning'ali mghima.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Litsua tsalilawa Yakobu hayang'ali yopfosa Penueli, Yakobu yang'ali yodeng'uka kwaajili ye lihatsa lyake. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Apfo mbaka leloli Waisiraeli ng'awakuja baye nyughe ili mna lihatsa, kwaapfila Yakobu tsakatowighwa hanu hao.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu ketingana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Yakobu tsakamwona Esau kakutsa ne iwanu miya nne. Apfo Yakobu kawaghola iwanaghe kuna Lea, Raheli na watumwa wala mapinga weli. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Yakobu tanu kaweka hambele iwatumwa ne iwana wawo, kuya kawinza Lea ne iwanaghe, kuya Raheli na Yosefu imwanaghe. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Yakobu imwenyegho tsakawalongola, kuya kenama mbaka chihanga chake chidonza hasi mala saba mbaka hayapfikile habehi na ndughu yake. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Lekeni Esau katsuma kumbokela, kamkumbatila, kamwikila ghamoko. Kuya wose weli tsawalila. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Esau hayenule tsinenge kawona iwapinga wala ne iwana, kaghutsa, “Apfi iwanu wano iwali na ghweghwe tsina nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakobu kamwidika, “Awano iwana yangaile Imulungu nene mtumwa wako kwa uluso wake.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Kuya awala iwatumighwa ne iwana wawo wamsoghelela, wenama wamtowela ghamaghoti. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Kuya Lea ne iwanaghe wamsoghelela, wenama wamtowela ghamaghoti. Kuya wawinza Yosefu na Raheli, pfipfila wenama wamtowela ghamaghoti.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esau kaghutsa, “Lelo Pfii kingili lya wanyama lyanitingane nalo mzila lina maana yachi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakobu kamwidika, “Nzawadi yako, tsambama umbonele libatsi mtwatsa wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Lekeni Esau kalonga, “Ndughu yangu nina mali nyingi. Ukale nayo mali yako.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yakobu kalonga, “Bae, ka kunitoghola ubokele nzawadi yangu. Mana ukwona chihanga chako ka nichona chihanga cha Imulungu, sambi kumbokela pfinoghile. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Chondechonde ubokele nzawadi yanikughalile, Imulungu kambonela libatsi, kangaya ghose ighanibamile.” Yakobu kaghendelela kulonga naye mbaka Esau katoghola.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Esau kalonga, “Ona, uleke tuke. Nitsokulongola.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Lekeni Yakobu kamwidika, “Mtwatsa wangu kwomanya iwana wano wadodo, iwang'olo ne iwang'ombe woghwawitsa, nobamighwa niwalolese. Ning'awadima kwa litsuwa limwe, wanyama wose watsokufa. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Nokulomba ulongole, nitsokuwinza lughalugha, nitsoghenda ka wanyama na iwana pfawoghenda, mbaka tutingane Seiri.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Esau kalonga, “Leka nikulekele iwanu wangu wamwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Yakobu kamghutsa, “Ule kwotenda apfo? Ghwe mbonele hela libatsi mtwatsa wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Apfo litsuwa lilila Esau kandusa ghumwanza ghwa ukuya Seiri. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Yakobu tsakaghenda mbaka Sukoti. Ako tsaketsengela pfibumbulika ne iwanyama wake. Ndo mana hanu aho hakemighwa Sukoti.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Yakobu tsakalawa Padani Aramu, kafika habehi ne Shekemu mna isi ya Kanaani, tsakatsenga pfimbulika habehi na isi ayo. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Yakobu kaghula mghunda kwa pfihindi miya imwe pfa pfesa, hanu hatsengile pfibumbulika pfake. Kaghula mghunda awo kwa wana wa Hamori, aba wake Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Kuya baho katsenga hanu ha kulapfila nambiko ha ghamabwe, kahakema Elelohe Isiraeli, mana yake Imulungu iyo Imulungu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Dina na Washekemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Litsuwa limwe, Dina imwana wa Lea na Yakobu, kaghenda kuwona iwapinga wa isi ila. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Shekemu imwana wa Hamori, Mhivi, imkulu wa isi ila, hayamwonile Dina, kamsola, kawasa naye chingupfu. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Ghumoyo wake tsaghumbama ng'ani Dina, kanoghelwa naye na kandusa kumtewetsa. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Kuya Shekemu kamlongela aba wake, “Unikwelele pinga yuno, yawe mwehe wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Yakobu hayahulike Shekemu kamtendela pfihile Dina, iwanaghe wang'ali kunyika wodima iwanyama, tsakanyamala mbaka hawoyile. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Hamori, aba wake Shekemu, tsakaghenda kulonga na Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Iwana wa Yakobu hawoyile kulawa kunyika, baho wahulika ichilawile. Wona usungu na maya, kwaapfila Shekemu katenda chinu chihile na kawaligha iwanu wa Isiraeli kwa kuwasa na neghe Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Lekeni Hamori kamlongela, “Mwanangu Shekemu konoghelwa na Dina. Chondechonde mwing'eni yamkwele. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Mleke twikwele, twetwe tukwele neghe tsenu namwe mkwele neghe tsetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Kuya mwodaha kukala na twetwe mna isi yetu, mwodaha kukala hohose hambama, mwodaha kutsuhutsa na kupata sendi.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Kuya Shekemu kalonga na aba wake Dina, na ndughu tsake, “Mboneleni libatsi, na nitsomwing'ani chochose chambama. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Mnongele tsengele likuwatse na chochose chambama niwaghweke, nitsolapfa ka pfamtsonilongela. Lekeni ngayeni ipinga yuno nimkwele.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Iwana wa Yakobu wawedika kwa ukuwabugha Shekemu na aba wake, kwaapfila Shekemu ma tsakamtendela pfihile lumbu wawo Dina. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Wawalongela, “Ng'atudaha baye kumleka lumbu wetu yakwelighwe ne imunu yang'engile ngoma baye. Kutenda apfo kutsotughalila chinyala. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Tutsowatoghola kwa laghitso lyino, muwe ka twetwe, chila immale mna mwemwe yengile ngoma. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Kuya twetwe tutsowakwela neghe tsenu, namwe mtsowakwela neghe tsetu. Apfo tutsokala hamwe na kuwa wamwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Mng'alema kutoghola malaghitso na kwingila ngoma, tutsomsola lumbu wetu na kuka naye.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Hamori na Shekemu imwanaghe wanoghelwa na malaghitso agho, <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />na mbwanga ayo ng'akawe baye kutenda apfo kwaapfila pfayanoghelighwe na neghe Yakobu. Shekemu yang'ali yotogholighwa ng'ani mkaye mwawo kubita wose.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Hamori na Shekemu, imwanaghe, waghenda hanu ha mtingano hane libani likulu lya ghumji ghwawo, walonga ne iwanu wa isi yawo. <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />Walonga, “Iwanu wano sale tsetu. Leka wakale mna isi yetu na watsuhutse kwaapfila tuna isi ng'ulu. Twodaha kuwakwela neghe tsawo na wawo wodaha kuwakwela neghe tsetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Lekeni iwanu wano watsotoghola kukala na twetwe na kuwa wanu wamwe kwa laghitso lyino, chila immale mna twetwe yengile ngoma ka wawo pfawengile ngoma. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Apfi iwanyama wawo wose na pfinu pfawo ng'apfitsokuwa pfetu? Leka tuwatoghole wakale kuna twetwe.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Iwanu wose wa isi ila watoghola achila ichilongighwe na Hamori na imwanaghwe, Shekemu, apfo iwamale wose tsawengila ngoma.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Ghamatsuwa madatu hambele, iwamale wose hawang'ali ne usungu wo ukwingila ngoma, iwana weli wa Yakobu, Simeoni na Lawi, lumbu tsake Dina, wasola mimaghe yawo wawedukitsa mmakaye mwawo, wawakoma iwamale wose. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Wamkoma Hamori na Shekemu kwa mimaghe, wamsola Dina kulawa mng'anda mwa Shekemu woka naye. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Iwana wa Yakobu wawoyila keli iwanu awo iwawakomile na waghusola ghumji ghose kwaapfila tsawamtendela pfihile lumbu wawo. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Wawasola wang'olo wawo, ng'ombe wawo, pfihongwe wawo, na pfinu pfose ipfili mna ghumji na ipfili kumghunda. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Wasola mali tsawo tsose, iwana wawo wose ne iwapinga wawo na pfose ipfili mna tsing'anda tsawo. <verse eid="GEN 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Kuya Yakobu kawalongela Simeoni na Lawi, “Mngalila maghayo, lelo Wakanaani, Waperizi na iwanu iwokala mna isi ino watsonihila. Nene nahela iwanu wengi, wang'elunga na kunitowa, nene na kaye yangu tutsohinyighwa.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Lekeni wamwidika, “Ng'atudaha baye kumleka lumbu wetu yatendighwe ka mhembu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu kakuya Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Kuya Imulungu kamlongela Yakobu, “Ugheluke ughende Beteli, ukakale ako, ukanitsengele nene Imulungu hanu ha kutambikila, nene Imulungu yanikulawile haung'ali utsuma kumpfuka ndughu yako Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Apfo Yakobu kawalongela iwanu wa mkaye mwake na iwanu iwali naye, “Pfilapfeni pfinyagho pfe imilungu pfamlinapfo, kuya mwoghe na mpfale ghamaghwanda ghangi. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Twakuka, twoghenda Beteli, ako nitsomtsengela Imulungu hanu ha kutambikila, Imulungu yula iyanyapfile litsuwa lila hanidununzike, yuyo iyakalile na nene kokose kwang'endile.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Apfo wamwing'a Yakobu pfinyagho pfose pfe imilungu pfawali napfo na heleni tsose tsawapfalile mmaghutwi mwawo, Yakobu kapfitsika hasi mwe mbiki ighukemighwe mwaloni ako Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Yakobu ne iwanaghe hawang'ali wakuka, Imulungu kawaghela wogha iwanu wa imiji iili habehi, ng'awadahile baye kuwakoleletsa. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Yakobu ne iwanu wake tsawapfika hanu hakemighwe Luzu, sambi hokemighwa Beseli, mna isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Tsakatsenga hanu ha kulapfila nambiko, na kahakema hanu hala Eli Beteli, kwaapfila hanu hala Imulungu tsakamlawila Yakobu hayang'ali yotsuma kumpfuka ndughu yake. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Kuya Debora iyakalile mtumwa wa Rebeka, tsakafa na kutsikighwa hasi he mbiki ighukemighwa mwaloni, ubali wa kuhisi wa Beteli, apfo mbiki aghwo tsaghukemighwa Aloni Bakuti, mana yake mbiki wa chililo.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Yakobu hayoyile Padani Aramu, Imulungu kamlawila keli, kambaliki. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Imulungu kamlongela, “Taghwa lyako Yakobu, lekeni ng'utsokemighwa keli Yakobu, ila kutsokemighwa Isiraeli.” Apfo Imulungu tsakamwing'a taghwa Isiraeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Imulungu kamlongela, “Nene na Imulungu Yane Ngupfu tsose. Weleke iwana wengi na wongetseke. Wanu wengi watsolawila mna iwana wako, na wandewa watsolawa mlukuli mwako. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Isi yanimwing'ile Abrahamu na Isaka nitsokwing'a ghweghwe, pfipfila nitsoweng'a na watsukulu wako isi ino.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Imulungu hayamalitse kulonga naye, kamleka koka. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Yakobu kemitsa libwe hanu hala Imulungu hayalongile naye, kaghida nambiko ya chokunwa, pfipfila kaghida ghamafuta mna libwe alyo, kalitenda liwe lye Imtwatsa. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Yakobu kahakema Beteli, hanu aho hayalongile ne Imulungu.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Raheli kakufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Yakobu na kaye yake woka kulawa Beteli, hawang'ali wahabei na kupfika Efurati, Raheli tsakona usungu ng'ani wo ukweleka. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Naye hayang'ali mna usungu awo mkulu wo ukweleka, mkunga kamlongela, “Raheli, uleke kupfuka, kwaapfila kuna imwana yungi immale.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Lekeni Raheli hayang'ali yohila no ukufa, kamwing'a mwanaghe taghwa Benoni, mana yake mwana wa usungu wangu, lekeni aba wake tsakamkema Benjamini, mana yake, mwana wa nondokela.<verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Kuya Raheli kafa, katsikighwa mmbalimbali mwa inzila iighenda Efurati, sambi yomanyika ka Betilehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakobu keka libwe mchang'a mwa chibaka cha Raheli, libwe lila lyolangusa chibaka cha Raheli mbaka leloli. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Kuya Yakobu, pfipfila iyakemighwe Isiraeli, kaghendelela na ghumwanza, katsenga chibumbulika chake kumwambu mwa ghumnala ghwa Ederi.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wa Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Isiraeli hayang'ali yokala mna isi ila, Rubeni tsakawasa na Biliha, pinga wa aba wake, naye Isiraeli tsakahulika mbuli atso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobu tsakana iwana kumi na weli. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Iwanaghe Lea tsawakala Rubeni, chaudele wa Yakobu, Simeoni, Lawi, Yuda, Isakari na Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Iwanaghe Raheli tsa Yosefu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Iwana wa Biliha, mtumwa wa Raheli, tsawakemighwa Dani na Nafutali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Iwana wa Zilipa, mtumwa wa Lea, tsa Gadi na Asheri. Awano iwo iwana wa Yakobu, iwelekighwe Padani Aramu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka kakufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yakobu tsakaghenda kwa aba wake, Isaka iyakalile ako Mamre, habehi na Heburoni, hanu hawakalile Abrahamu na Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Isaka tsakana miyaka miya imwe na semanini. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Naye kafa aku kalala ng'ani. Iwanaghe, Esau na Yakobu wamtsika.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Watsukulu wa Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Awano iwo watsukulu wa Esau, pfipfila wakemighwa Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esau tsakawakwela iwapinga Wakanani, tsakamkwela Ada neghe Eloni, Mhiti, tsakamkwela Oholibama neghe Ana na mtsukulu wa Sibeoni, Mhivi, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />pfipfila tsakamkwela Basemati, neghe Ismaili, lumbu wake Nebayoti. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada tsakamwelekela Esau imwana yakemighwe Elifazi, na Basemati tsakamweleka Reueli, <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Oholibama tsakamwelekela Esau iwana, Yeushi, Yalamu na Kora. Awano tsa iwana wa Esau iwelekighwe mna isi ya Kanani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Kuya Esau kawasola iwapinga wake, iwanaghe na iwanu wose iwali mkaye mwake, hamwe ne iwanyama wake wose ne pfinu pfose pfayapatile mna isi ya Kanani, kaghenda kukala isi ili kutali na Yakobu, ndughu yake. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Tsakoka kwaapfila isi ila iyang'ali yokala yeye na Yakobu tsa ndodo kuna wawo kukala hamwe, tsawana iwanyama wengi na ng'awadahile baye kukala hamwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Apfo Esau tsakakala mna isi ya pfidunda pfa Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Awano watsukulu wa Esau, aba wa Waedomu iwakalile mna isi ya pfidunda pfa Seiri. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Aghano mataghwa gha iwana wa Esau, Elifazi, imwana wa Ada ipinga wake Esau, na Reuli, imwana wa Basemati, ipinga wa Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Iwana wa Elifazi tsa Temani, Omari, Sefo, Gatamu na Kenazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Elifazi tsakana hawala iyakemighwe Timna, naye kamwelekela imwana yakemighwe Ameleki. Awano tsa watsukulu wa Ada ipinga wake Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Basemati, ipinga wake yungi Esau tsakamweleka Reueli. Naye Reueli tsakamweleka Nahati, Zera, Shama na Miza.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Oholibama ipinga wa Esau, imwanaghe Ana, iyakalile mtsukulu wa Sibeoni, kamwelekela Esau iwana, Yeushi, Yalamu na Kora.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Awano wawo iwakulu wa kolo itsilawile mna watsukulu wa Esau, iwana wa Elifazi, chaudele wa Esau, wang'ali wakulu wa kolo tsa Temani, Omari, Sefo, Kenazi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Kora, Gatamu na Ameleki. Awano tsa wakulu wa kolo iwalawile kwa Elifazi mna isi ya Edomu, awano tsa watsukulu wa Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Awano tsa iwana wa Reueli, iyelekile na Esau, tsa wakulu wa kolo tsa Nahati, Zera, Shama na Miza. Iwakulu wano tsawalawila kwa Reueli mna isi ya Edomu. Awano tsa watsukulu wa Basemati, ipinga wake Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Awano iwana wa Oholibama, ipinga yungi wa Esau, tsa wakulu wa kolo tsa Yeushi, Yalamu na Kora. Awano wose iwana wa Oholibama, imwana wa Ana, ipinga wake Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Awano tsa iwana wa Esau na awano tsa wakulu wawo.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watsukulu wa Seili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Awano iwana wa Seiri, Mhori, wenyekae wa isi ila ya Edomu, Lotani, Shobali, Sibeoni, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Dishoni, Eseli na Dishani. Iwana wano wa Seiri tsa wakulu wa kolo tsa Wahori, mna isi ya Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Iwana wa Lotani tsa Hori na Hemamu, na lumbu wake Lotani tsakakemighwa Timna. <verse eid="GEN 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Iwana wa Shobali tsa Aluvani, Manahati, Ebali, Shefo na Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Sibeoni tsakeleka wana weli, Aya na Ana. Ana iyo yuyo iyonile mbwibwi ya ghamatsi ighosoma akula kunyika, hayang'ali yowadima pfihongwe wa Sibeoni aba wake. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Naye Ana, tsakaweleka Dishoni na Oholibama, Oholibama tsa imwanaghe Ana. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Dishoni tsakaweleka Hemdani, Eshibani, Itirani na Kerani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Bilani tsakaweleka Zaawani na Akani.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Dishani tsakaweleka, Usi na Arani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Awano tsa iwakulu wa kolo tsa Wahori, Lotani, Shobali, Sibeoni, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Dishoni, Eseri na Dishani. Awano tsa iwakulu wa kolo tsa Wahori, mna isi ya Seiri.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwandewa wa Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Awano tsa wandewa iwatawale isi ya Edomu ng'ana mfalume wowose wa Isiraeli yawatawale.<verse eid="GEN 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela imwana wa Beori tsakatawala isi ya Edomu. Ghumji ghwake tsaghukemighwa Dinaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela hayafile, Yobabu imwana wa Zera yalawile ghumji ghwa Bosira tsakawa mfalume. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobabu hayafile, Hushamu iyolawila ghumji ghwa Watemani, tsakawa mfalume.<verse eid="GEN 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Hushamu hayafile, Hadadi imwana wa Bedadi tsakatawala hanu hake. Ghumji ghwake tsaghukemighwa Aviti. Ayu yuyo iyawatowile na kuwahuma Wamidiani mna isi ya Moabu. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadadi hayafile, Samla kulawa Masireka, tsakawa mfalume. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samla hayafile, Shauli kulawa ghumji ghwa Rehoboti, isi ihili habehi na ghumto Efulate, tsakawa mfalume. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Shauli hayafile, Baalanani imwana wa Akibori, tsakawa mfalume. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Baalanani imwana wa Akibori hayafile, Hadadi tsakatawala hanu hake. Ghumji ghwake tsaghukemighwa Pau. Ipinga wake tsakakemighwa Mehetabeli, neghe Matiredi, mtsukulu wa Mezahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Aghano mataghwa gha wakulu wa kolo yawalawile kwa Esau kwa mataghwa ghawo, kwa imiji yawalawile na isi tsawalawile, Timna, Aliva, Yeteti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholibama, Ela, Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenazi, Temani, Mibusari, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Magidieli na Iramu. Awano tsa wakulu wa kolo tsa Edomu, iye Esau aba wa Wahedomu. Wandikighwa kwa imiji yawo na isi tsawakalile.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu na ndughu tsake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakobu tsakaghendelela kukala mna isi ya Kanaani, isi iyakalile aba wake. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Atsino mbuli tsa iwanaghe Yakobu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yosefu hayang'ali na miyaka kumi na saba, yang'ali yodima iwang'olo na iwamene na ndughu tsake, iwana wa Bila na Zilipa, iwapinga wa aba wake. Yosefu yang'ali yomlongelagha aba wake mbuli tsihile tsa ndughu tsake.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Yosefu tsakamnoghela ng'ani Yakobu kubita iwanaghe wangi, kwaapfila tsakamweleka aku yeye kalala. Kamtendela Yosefu lighwanda litali linoghile. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Ndughu tsake hawamanyile aba wawo konoghelwa ng'ani na Yosefu kubita wawo, tsawamuhila ng'ani na ng'awabamile kulonga naye pfinoghile.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Chilo chimwe Yosefu kalota ndoto, lekeni hayawalongele ndughu tsake, wose tsawamuhila ghendo. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Kawalongela, “Mtegheletse ndoto yanilotile. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Tsanilota pfino, wose tsatung'ali kumghunda twakoa makinza ghe mibeleghe, bahala kinza lyangu linuka wima. Baho, makinza ghenu tsaghatsunguluka na kughwinamila mbeleghe ghwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Ndughu tsake wamghutsa, “Pfii kwobama ututawale? Apfi kutsotutawala?” Apfo wose tsawamuhila ghendo kwa ndoto yake na achila chayawalongele.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Kuya Yosefu kalota keli, kawalongela ndughu tsake, “Mtegheletse, nilota keli, litsua, lwetsi na tsinondo kumi na imwe tsininamila nene.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Hayawalongele aba wake na ndughu tsake, aba wake kammanila kamlongela, “Aino ndoto yachi yulotile? Apfi mai wako, nene na ndughu tsako tutsokwinamila?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Ndughu tsake tsawamwonela chepfu, lekeni aba wake kayalangula mbuli ino.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu kohutsighwa na ndughu tsake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Litsuwa limwe ndughu tsake Yosefu hawaghendile kudima iwang'olo habehi na Shekemu, <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Isiraeli kamlongela, “Ka pfaumanya, ndughu tsako waghenda kudima iwang'olo habehi na Shekemu. Utse, nobama nikutume kuna wawo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yosefu kamwidika, “Ona aba.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Apfo aba wake kamlongela, “Ughende ukawalole ndughu tsako na iwang'olo ka waghima, kuya utse unongele.” Kuya kamtuma aghende lwanda lwa Heburoni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Yosefu hayapfikile Shekemu, <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />imunu yumwe kamwona kakwangakwanga kunyika, kamghutsa, “Ubama choni?” <verse eid="GEN 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yosefu kamwidika, “Nowabama ndughu tsangu. Chondechonde nongele hanu kwawodimila iwang'olo.”<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Imunu yula kamlongela, “Ahano woka. Tsanihulika wolonga woghenda Dotani.” Apfo Yosefu kaghenda kuwabama na kawafika habehi na Dotani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Ndughu tsake hawamwonile kwa kutali, na ng'ana yawapfikile, tsawalamla wamkome. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Welongela, “Mlole, mlota ndoto kakutsa. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Leka tumkome tumwase mpondo, kuya tutsolonga mnyama wa kumuhulo kamkoma. Lelo tutsakona ndoto tsake tsitsakuwatse.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Rubeni hayahulike apfi, kabama kumkombola Yosefu, apfo kawalongela ndughu tsake, “Tuleke kumkoma.” <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Rubeni kaghendelela kulonga, “Tumwase mpondo mno, hano kunyika, lekeni mleke kumlagha.” Rubeni tsakalonga apfi kumkombola Yosefu kulawa mna ghamoko ghawo, na yamuyitse kwa aba wake. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Yosefu hayapfikile kwa ndughu tsake, ndughu tsake wamtsula kwa ngupfu lighwanda lila litali line unzolingo lyayapfalile. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Kuya wamsola, wamwasa mna pondo, pondo lila tsalyahela chinu na tsalyahela ghamatsi.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Hawang'ali wakuja, wawona wachuhutsi wa lukolo lwa Ishimaeli wolawa Gileadi woghenda Misiri. Wawabapitsa ngamiya wawo imitsigho ya ubani, ziri na manemane. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Yuda kawalongela ndughu tsake, “Tutsopata choni tung'amkoma ndughu yetu na kupfisa ukufa kwake? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Leka tumuhutse kwa Waishimaeli wano, tuleke kumlagha, kwaapfila ayu ka ndughu yetu, yeye na twetwe twa iwana wa aba yumwe.” Ndughu tsake wamtogholela. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Apfo wachuhutsi awo wa Midiani hawapfikile hanu aho, ndughu tsake Yosefu wamkwegha kulawa mpondo, tsawamuhutsa kwa watsukulu awo wa Ishimaeli kwa pfihindi ishilini pfa pfetsa, nawo wamsola Yosefu mbaka Misiri.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Rubeni hayoile mna pondo lila, na ukwona Yosefu ng'ali baho, kadegha ghamaghwanda ghake kwa usungu. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Rubeni koya kwa ndughu tsake, kawalongela, “Msongolo ng'ali baho! Lelo nitendetse?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Kuya walisola lighwanda lya Yosefu, wamkoma imene walipfabika lighwanda lila mna idamu. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Walisola lighwanda lila, walighala kwa aba wawo, wamlongela, “Tulidondola lighwanda lino. Ulilole wone ka lighwanda lyino lya imwanagho.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Aba wawo kalitanga lighwanda lila, kalonga, “Alino ghwanda lya mwanangu ghendo! Mnyama wa kumuhulo kamkoma mwanangu. Mwanangu Yosefu kadeghighwa pfihindi pfihindi.” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Kuya Yakobu kaghadegha ghamaghwanda ghake kwa usungu, kapfala ghamaghunila, kamlilila mwanaghe kwa ghamatsuwa mengi. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Iwanaghe wose wamtsila kumkanza, lekeni tsakalema kukanzighwa, kalonga, “Mndeke, nitsoghendelela kumlilila mwanangu mbaka hawatsonitsika na nene.” Apfo kaghendelela kumlilila Yosefu, imwanaghe.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Ghamatsuwa ghagho, akula Misiri, Wamidiani wala tsawamuutsa Yosefu kwa imunu yumwe iyakemighwe Potifa, yumwe we iwakulu wa Farao, iyakalile mkulu wa iwabetetsi.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Yuda na Tamari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Ghamatsuwa ghala, Yuda kawaleka ndughu tsake, kahulumka kaghenda kukala na imunu yumwe wa Adulami, taghwa lyake Hira. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Ako Adulamu, Yuda tsaketingana na ipinga Mkanaani taghwa lyake Shua. Tsakamkwela, <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Shua tsakakinda hinda keleka imwana mmale, Yuda tsakamkema imwana ayo Eri. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Shua tsakakinda keli hinda keleka imwana mmale, tsakamkema Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Kuya Shua keleka imwana yungi, tsakamkema Shela. Shela hayelekighwe, Yuda yang'ali yokala Kezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Yuda kamkwelela Eri ipinga, imwanaghe chaudele, ipinga ayo tsakakemighwa Tamari. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Lekeni Eri, imwana chaudele wa Yuda, tsakeha hambele he Imtwatsa, apfo IMNDEWA tsakamkoma. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Kuya Yuda kamlongela Onani, “Umkwele mlamu wako, umwelekele ndughu yako iwana.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Lekeni Onani tsakamanya ka ng'aidahika iwana wala kuwa wake, apfo hayawasile na mlamu wake, tsakakotsela hasi aleke kumwelekela ndughu yake iwana. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Achila chayatendile Onani, tsachiha hambele he Imtwatsa, apfo IMNDEWA pfipfila tsakamkoma Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Kuya Yuda kamlongela Tamari, mwehe we iwanaghe, “Uye ukaye kwa aba wako na ukale bila kukwelighwa mbaka mwanangu Shela akule.” Yuda kalonga apfi kwaapfila yang'ali yopfuka Shela yang'akomighwe ka ndughu tsake. Apfo Tamari koya ukaye.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Ghamatsuwa mengi haghalutile mwehe wa Yuda, neghe Shua tsakafa. Yuda hayafambule chililo, kagheluka Timna kwa iwanu wake iwoghana mighala iwang'olo, tsakaghenda na Hira sale yake, munu wa Adulami. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Munu yumwe kamlongela Tamari ka aba wa mmale wake kamnzila koghenda Timna kuwaghana mighala iwang'olo wake, <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />apfo Tamari katsula maghwanda ghake gha usaka, keghubika shela, kuya kakala hanu he kwingila Enaimu, habehi na inzila ighenda Timna. Tsakatenda apfo kwaapfila tsakamanya Shela tsakakula, lekeni ng'eng'ighwe baye yamkwele Tamari.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Yuda hayamwonile, tsakepfikitsa yang'ali malaya, kwaapfila tsakeghubika chihanga chake. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Kamghendela aho hambalimbali he nzila, kamlongela, “Nobama niwase naghwe.” Yuda ng'amanyile baye ka ayula tsa ipinga wa mwanaghe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Tamari kamghutsa, “Ning'atoghola utsongaya choni?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Kamwidika, “Nitsokughalila imene kulawa mna iwanyama wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Naye kamghutsa, “Ungaya choni nikale nacho mbaka hautsongalila imene?”<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yuda kamghutsa, “Nikwing'e choni ukale nacho mbaka hanikughalila imene ayo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Tamari kamwidika, “Ungaye pete iili na chitango, lutsabi lwake na ng'weku iili mna ghamoko ghako.” Apfo Yuda kamwing'a, kuya kawasa naye, na Tamari tsakakinda hinda. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Tamari koka ukaye, katsula shela yake, kapfala maghwanda ghake gha usaka.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Yuda tsakamtuma Hira sale yake aghale imene kwa pinga yula na yasole ipfinu pfayamwing'ile, lekeni Hira ng'amwonile baye ipinga ayo. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Hira kawaghutsa iwanu iwakakalile hala, “Alikwani ipinga yula iyang'ali iyeutsa hambalimbali he nzila iighenda Enaimu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Iwanu wala wamwidika, “Hanu hano tsang'ana akale ipinga iyeutsa.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Apfo Hira koya kwa Yuda, kamlongela, “Simwonile baye. Na iwanu wa hanu hala walonga tsang'ana akale ipinga iyeutsa hanu hala.”<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yuda kamlongela, “Mleke akale napfo, hela tutsosekighwa. Nikwing'a imene umghalile, lekeni ng'aumwonile baye.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Miyetsi midatu hambele, imunu yumwe kamlongela Yuda, “Tamari, ipinga yula we imwanagho katenda ughoni, na sambi kana hinda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yuda kalaghitsa, “Mlapfeni kunze mumlakatse mbaka yafe.”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Hawang'ali womlapfa kunze, kamtumila usenga aba wake mkwe, kalonga, “Imunu iyane pfinu pfino iyo iyangaile hinda. Mtange pfinu pfino, mmanye ka pfa nani, pete ino, lutsabi luno na ng'weku ino.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yuda kapfitanga pfinu pfila, kalonga, “Ipinga yuno kana haki kubita nene, kwaapfila simwing'ile Shela mwanangu yamkwele.” Kulawa litsuwa lila Yuda ng'awasile keli na Tamari.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Litsuwa lya Tamari lya ukweleka halipfikile, tsaimanyika tsakana hinda ya wana weli. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Hayang'ali yakweleka, imwana yumwe kalapfa ghumoko, mkunga kamwoha lutsi ludung'u, kalonga, “Ayuno chaudele.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Lekeni imwana ayo kaghuyitsa ghumoko ghwake mghati, na ndughu yake kalawa. Kuya mkunga kalonga, “Mbona kulawa kwa ngupfu?” Apfo tsakamkema mwana ayo Peresi. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Kuya ndughu yake kelekighwa na lutsi mna ghumoko ghwake, naye tsakakemighwa Zera.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu na mwehe wa Potifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Kuya Waishimaeli wala wamghala Yosefu Misiri na wamuhutsa kwa Potifa, Potifa tsa akida wa Farao na tsa mkulu wa iwabetetsi wake. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />IMNDEWA tsa kahamwe na Yosefu na kamtenda yaghendelele pfinoghile. Na Yosefu tsakakala mna ing'anda ya imkulu wake Mmisiri. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Imkulu wake kamwona Yosefu kahamwe ne Imulungu, na Imulungu kamwapfila yadahe kutenda ghoya mna chila chinu chayatendile. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Potifa tsakanoghelwa na Yosefu, kamwika yamsang'anile yeye mwenyegho, pfipfila kamwika yawe mwimilitsi wa ing'anda yake na ipfinu pfake pfose. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Kulawa Potifa hayamwikile Yosefu yawe mwimilitsi wa ing'anda yake na ipfinu pfose, IMNDEWA kapfibaliki pfose ipfili mng'anda mwa Mmisiri ayo na ipfili mumghunda mwake. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Potifa kamwing'a chila chinu chayali nacho chiwe mna ghamoko ghake naye Potifa ng'epfikitse baye mna chinu chochose, ila mna ichijo chake chiliyeka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yosefu tsakana lukuli lunoghile na chihanga ichideghete. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Hambele chidogho, ipinga wa imtwatsa wake tsakambama, kamlongela, “Wasa na nene!” <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Yosefu tsakalema, kamlongela, “Bae! Mkulu wangu ng'epfikitsa baye mna chinu chochose ichili mng'anda mwake, ipfinu pfake pfose kangaya nene nipfilolese. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Mne ing'anda ino kuduhu imunu mkulu kubita nene. Mkulu wangu ng'angomile chinu chochose ila ghweghwe, kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa mwehe wake. Pfii lelo nende chinu chihile na nimtotsele Imulungu?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Hata ka ipinga yula tsakaghendelela kumtewetsa Yosefu chila litsuwa, lekeni Yosefu tsakalema kuwasa naye na ng'amtegheletse baye.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Litsuwa limwe Yosefu tsakengila mng'anda kusang'ana, na mng'anda tsakuduhu imunu wowose. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Ipinga wa Potifa kamkinda Yosefu lighwanda lyake, kamlongela, “Utse tuwase!” Lekeni Yosefu kalileka lighwanda lyake mna ghamoko ghake, katsumila kunze. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Ipinga yula hayonile Yosefu kalileka lighwanda mna ghamoko ghake na katsumila kunze, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />ipinga ayo kawakema iwatumwa wake, kawalongela, “Mtse mlole! Mheburaniya yuno iyamghulile mmale wangu kotuligha. Kengila mng'anda mwangu na kabama awase na nene, lekeni nidamilila. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Hayahulike nodamilila, kalileka ghwanda lyake, katsumila kunze.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Ipinga yula kalika ghwanda lya Yosefu mbaka mkulu wa Yosefu yoye. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Kuya kamlongela imbuli iila, “Mtumwa yuno Mheburaniya yumghulile, katsa mng'anda mwangu kunighela chinyala. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Lekeni hanidamilile, kalileka ghwanda lyake, katsumila kunze.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Imkulu ayo wa Yosefu hayahulike Yosefu pfayamtendele mwehe wake, tsakona maya. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Kamsola Yosefu, kamwika mchifungo. Tsakohighwa hanu hawohighwe woighwa we imfalume. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Lekeni IMNDEWA tsakahamwe na Yosefu, kambaliki, imkulu wa geretsa tsakanoghelwa naye. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Apfo kamsaghula Yosefu yawe imkulu wa woighwa wose na kulolesa ghose ighotendeka mghati. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Imkulu wa geretsa ng'asang'ane baye ne ichinu chochose chayamwing'ile Yosefu yachilolese, kwaapfila Imulungu tsa kahamwe na Yosefu na kamwapfila mna ghose ghayatendile.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu na ndoto tsa wohighwa weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Ghamatsuwa tsaghabita, lelo tsuwa limwe mwika dipfai wa imfalume wa Misiri na mwambika pfighate wake mkulu, wamtotsela mkulu wawo, imfalume wa Misiri. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Farao kawonela maya iwakulu wano weli, <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />kaweka mna geretsa mng'anda mwa imkulu wa iwabatetsi, hanu hayohighwe Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Imkulu wa iwabetetsi kamsaghula Yosefu yawasang'anile. Tsawakala mchifungo ghamatsuwa mengi.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Chilo chimwe mumula mna geretsa mwika dipfai kalota ndoto na mwambika pfighate naye pfipfila tsakalota. Chila ndoto tsaing'ali ilonga chinu chake. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Nemitondo Yosefu hayaghendile kuwona, wose weli tsa wana usungu. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Apfo kawaghutsa iwakulu awo iwang'ali hamwe naye mchifungo, mng'anda mwa imtwatsa wake, “Ebali pfihanga pfenu pfolangusa mna usungu?” <verse eid="GEN 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Wamwidika, “Wose tulota ndoto, lekeni kuduhu imunu iyodaha kutulongela ndoto atso tsilonga choni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Kuya Yosefu kawalongela, “Apfi kulangusa ndoto tsilonga choni si sang'ano ya Imulungu baye? Nongeleni ndoto tsenu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Apfo mghida dipfai kalonga, “Mna indoto yangu nighwona mbiki ghwa mtsabibu hambele yangu, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />na mbiki aghwo tsaghukala na maputila madatu. Haung'ali ghutula, ghamaluwa ghake ghasanula na mikungwi yake tsa ina nzabibu itsipfile. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Chikombe cha Farao tsa chamna ghamoko ghangu, apfo nisola tsabibu, nitsikama mna chikombe cha Farao, nimwing'a.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yosefu kamlongela, “Ndoto yako ilonga pfino, maputila madatu ghagho matsuwa madatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Mne matsuwa madatu Farao katsokulekelela na kukuyitsa mna sang'ano yako, na kutsomwing'a Farao chikombe mna ghamoko ghake ka pfautendile ghumwande. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Lekeni ipfinu hapfitsokughendela ghoya, ng'umbuke na unitendele uluso, ulonge mbuli tsangu kwa Farao ili yandapfe mna gheletsa lino. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Mana nene tsanisolighwa kwa ngupfu kulawa mna isi ya Waheburaniya, na hano Misiri sitendile chochose ichinitenda nyohighwe.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Imkulu wa iwambika pfighate hayonile Yosefu kailonga pfinoghile ndoto ila, kamlongela Yosefu, “Nene pfipfila ndota. Tsandota nighala pfiseghe pfidatu pfa pfighate mwitwi mwangu. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Mna chiseghe cha kuchanya, tsahana ipfijo pfingi kwa Farao. Lekeni iwapfideghe wang'ali wopfija kulawa mna chiseghe acho mwitwi mwangu!”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yosefu kamwidika, “Indoto ayo yolonga pfino, pfiseghe pfidatu ghagho matsuwa madatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Mne matsuwa madatu imfalume katsokulapfa mwigheletsa, na katsokughana litwi lyako na katsokukondeka mna mbiki, na wapfideghe watsoluja lukuli lwako.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Mne litsuwa lya kadatu, litsuwa lya kwelekighwa kwake Farao, Farao kawatendela chihungo wakulu wake wose. Kuya kawalapfa mchifungo mwika dipfai wake na mwambika pfighate wake, kaweka hambele he iwakulu wake. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Farao kamuyitsa mwika dipfai mna sang'ano yake, yamwing'eghe Farao chikombe. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Lekeni kamghana litwi mkulu yula we iwakwambika pfighate, kamkondeka mna mbiki. Ghose ghalawila ka Yosefu pfayawalongele. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Lekeni mwika dipfai ng'amkumbuke baye Yosefu, tsakamsemwa ghendo.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Ndoto tsa Imfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Miyaka mili hailutile, Farao kalota ndoto kema mmbalimbali mwa ghumto Naili. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Kawona ng'ombe saba iwanenehe na iwadeghete wolawa kune ghumto, wakuja mitsani. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Kuya ng'ombe wangi saba wehile na iwasokile ghendo walawa mna ghumto Naili, watsa na kwima habehi na ng'ombe wala iwanoghile iwemile mmbalimbali mwa ghumto. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Ng'ombe wala saba iwehile na iwasokile tsawawaja ng'ombe wala saba iwanoghile. Kuya Farao kalamka. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Hayawasile keli, kalota lwakeli. Kona mikungwi saba ya uhemba ikomale na inoghile tsaisanula mna beleghe limwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Kuya mikungwi ingi saba ya uhemba isokile na iinyalile kwa libeho lya kunyika tsaisanula. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Pfipfila mikungwi ila saba iisokile tsaihija ahila mikungwi saba inoghile. Kuya Farao kalamka, baho katanga yang'ali yolota. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Nemitondo, Farao tsakaghanzika ng'ani, tsakawakema wahawi wose iwali Misiri ne iwanu iwane ihekima. Farao kawalongela ndoto tsake, lekeni tsakuduhu imunu wa kumlongela ndoto tsake tsilongatse.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Kuya mghida dipfai kamlongela Farao, “Leloli nikumbuka nenda pfihile. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Tsakutwonela maya nene na mwambika pfighate mkulu, na tsakutwoha mchifungo mng'anda mwa mkulu wa iwabetetsi. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Chilo chimwe, chila yumwe kalota ndoto yake na chila ndoto ing'ali ilonga mbuli yake. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Ako mchifungo tsakung'ali na mbwanga Mhebulaniya, mtumighwa wa mkulu wa iwabetetsi. Tsatumpetela ndoto tsetu, naye tsakatulongela ndoto tsetu tsilongatse. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Ghose ghalawila ka pfayatulongele. Ghweghwe kumbuyitsa mna sang'ano yangu na mwambika pfighate mkulu kakondekighwa.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Apfo Farao kawatuma iwanu waghende kwa Yosefu, naye kalapfighwa himahima mchifungo. Hayaghetile mvili tsake na kupfala maghwanda ghangi, kaghalighwa hambele ya Farao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Farao kamlongela Yosefu, “Tsanilota ndoto na kuduhu imunu iyodaha kunilongela ndoto atso tsilongatse. Nihulika ghweghwe kwodaha kunilongela ndoto tsangu tsilongatse.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yosefu kamwidika, “Mbe nene sidaha baye, lekeni Imulungu kodaha kutulongela pfinoghile ndoto tsilongatse.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Kuya Farao kamlongela Yosefu, “Nilota ndoto nyima mmbalimbali mwa ghumto Naili. <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />Niwona ng'ombe saba iwanenehe na iwadeghete wolawa kumto wakuja imitsani. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Kuya watsa ng'ombe wangi saba iwehile na iwasokile. Kulawa nyelekighwe sina mbone baye ng'ombe iwasokile ka wano mna isi ya Misiri. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Kuya ng'ombe awo iwasokile tsawawaja ng'ombe wala iwanenehe. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Lekeni hata ka tsawawaja ng'ombe awala iwanenehe, kuduhu imunu iyodaha kulonga ka tsawatenda apfo, kwaapfila tsawoneka wasoka ka mwanduso. Kuya ndamka. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />kuya nilota ndoto ingi, niyona mibeleghe saba ine uhemba ikomale, ikula mna beleghe limwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Kuya mikungwi ya uhemba iinyalile kwa libeho lya kunyika tsailawila. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Mikungwi ila saba iinyalile tsaiija ahila mikungwi saba inoghile. Niwalongela wahawi, kuduhu iyadahile kulonga ndoto tsilongatse.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Kuya Yosefu kamlongela Yosefu, “Ndoto tsako tsose tsina mana imwe. Imulungu kakughubulila Farao chayatsochitenda hambele. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Ng'ombe saba iwanenehe iyo miyaka saba, na mikungwi saba inoghile iyo miyaka saba. Ndoto tsino tsolonga chinu chimwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Ng'ombe wala iwasokile, awala iwalawile hambele ha awala iwanenehe, iyo miyaka saba, na ahila mikungwi saba ilihela chinu, ila ihinyalile kwa libeho lya kunyika, iyo miyaka saba ya nzala. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Ka pfanikulongele ghweghwe mfalume Farao, Imulungu kakughubulila achila chayatsochitenda hambele. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Miyaka saba iikutsa kutsakuwa na ichijo ketseketse. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Lekeni hambele itsowinza miyaka saba ya nzala, na miyaka yose saba ye ichijo mna isi ya Misiri mtsoisemwa, nzala itsoihinya isi. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Chijo acho chitsosemwighwa ghendo kwaapfila kutsolawila nzala ng'ali ng'ani. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Mndewa Farao tsakulota mala mbili, kwaapfila Imulungu kalamla imbuli ino, naye katsoitenda ilawile sambi baha.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Lelo mfalume umsaghule imunu yane tsimbutsi na ihekima, umwike yailolese isi ya Misiri. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Farao uwasaghule wakulu wangi muisi mno, wasole lifungu lya tano lye ipfijo pfawopfuna iwanu mna isi ya Misiri mna chipindi cha miyaka saba ya ipfijo pfingi. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Walongele wakunge pfijo pfose mna miyaka ino saba inoghile. Pfijo apfo wapfike hane hatsina yako, iwe akiba kwa imiji yose ya Misiri, nawo wapfilolese. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Chijo achi ichikighwe chitsakujighwa mna miyaka saba ya nzala iikutsa mna isi ya Misiri. Apfo iwanu ng'awatsakufa nzala baye.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu kakwing'ighwa ukulu mna isi ya Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Imbuli yalongile Yosefu yoneka imnoghelesa Farao ne iwakulu wayaghe wose. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Farao kawaghutsa iwakulu wayaghe, “Apfi tutsompata kwani imunu ka yuno, yane muhe wa Imulungu?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Kuya Farao kamlongela Yosefu, “Kwaapfila Imulungu kakughubulila agha ghose, kuduhu imunu iyane tsimbutsi na ihekima kubita ghweghwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Nitsokwika uilolese isi yangu, na iwanu wangu wose watsokutegheletsa. Nene niliheka namkulu kubita ghweghwe kwaapfila nene na mfalume.” <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Kuya Farao kamlongela Yosefu, “Kulawa sambi nokwika uwe mkulu we isi yose ya Misiri.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Kuya Farao katsula pete yake ine ichitango mna chidole chake, kampfatsa Yosefu. Kampfatsa Yosefu maghwanda ighanoghile na mkufu ghwa nzahabu msingo. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Kamdinitsa Yosefu mna mtuka ghwake wa kabili wa falasi. Iwanu wamdeng'elela, wakemelela, “Seghelani mnzila, seghelani mnzila!” Apfo Yosefu tsakasaghulighwa yawe mkulu wa isi yose ya Misiri. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Kuya mfalume kamlongela Yosefu, “Nene iyo mfalume! Nolonga, imunu wowose mna isi yose ya Misiri aleke kwinula ghumoko au mghulu wake bila ya ghweghwe kumlongela.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Farao tsakamwing'a taghwa Yosefu Safenatipanea. Kuya Farao kamkwelela Yosefu ipinga, Asenati neghe Potifera, mlapfa nambiko wa ghumji ghwa Oni.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Yosefu tsakana miyaka selasini hayandusile kumsang'anila Farao imfalume wa Misiri. Yosefu tsakalawa mna ing'anda ya Farao, kayangila isi yose ya Misiri. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Mne miyaka ila saba ya pfijo, imighunda ya Misiri tsayeleka mapfuno mengi. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Mne miyaka ila saba Yosefu tsakakunga pfijo pfose ipfili mna isi ya Misiri. Mna chila ghumji tsakeka ipfijo ipfilawile mna imighunda ya habehi. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yosefu tsakakunga pfijo ketseketse ka msanga ighuli kumwani mbaka ng'adaile baye kupeta.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Ng'ana miyaka ya nzala itse, Asenati neghe Potifera, mlapfa nambiko wa Oni, tsakamwelekela Yosefu iwana weli. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yosefu tsakamkema imwanaghe chaudele Manase na kalonga, “Imulungu kanenda nisemwe maghayo ghangu ghose na chawanitendele ndughu tsangu.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Imwanaghe wa keli tsakamkema Efremu kalonga, “Imulungu kangaya iwana mna isi yanighanzika.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Miyaka ila saba ya pfijo tsapfimala mna isi ya Misiri, <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />na miyaka saba ya nzala tsayanza ka Yosefu pfayalongile. Tsakulawila nzala mna isi tsose, lekeni isi ya Misiri tsaina chijo. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Wamisiri hawawonile nzala, iwanu wamlilila Farao yaweng'e chijo. Farao kawalongela Wamisiri wote, “Mghende kwa Yosefu na mtende chochose chayawalongelani.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Nzala yongetseka muisi, yenela mna isi yose ya Misiri, Apfo Yosefu tsakapfughula tsing'anda tsawekile ichijo, kawahutsila pfijo Wamisiri, kwaapfila nzala tsang'ali ng'ani. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Iwanu kulawa chila hanu tsawaghenda Misiri kwa Yosefu kughula pfijo, kwaapfila nzala tsang'ali ng'ani chila hanu.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Ndughu tsake Yosefu woghenda Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Yakobu hayahulike kuna pfijo ako Misiri, kawaghutsa iwanaghe, “Pfii mbona mwelolesa?” <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Kaghendelela kulonga, “Nihulika kuna pfijo ako Misiri. Muhulumke mkatughulile chijo tuleke kufa.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Kuya ndughu tsake Yosefu kumi wahulumka, waghenda Misiri kughula chijo. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Lekeni Yakobu ng'amlekile Benjamini, ndughu yake Yosefu, aghende na ndughu tsake, tsakapfuka chinu chihile chileke kumlawila.<verse eid="GEN 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Apfo wana wa Isiraeli pfipfila tsawammo mna iwanu iwaghendile kughula chijo, kwaapfila mna isi ya Kanaani nako tsakulawila nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Yosefu tsamkulu wa isi ya Misiri, yang'ali yowahutsila chijo iwanu kulawa isi yose. Apfo ndughu tsake Yakobu nawo tsawapfika, wamwinamilla mbaka pfihanga pfao pfidonza hasi. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Yosefu hawonile ndughu tsake, kawatambula, lekeni tsakatenda ka ng'awamanyile baye na kawaghutsa kwa ukali, “Mlawile kwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Wamwidika, “Twolawa isi ya Kanaani, tutsa kughula chijo.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Hata ka Yosefu tsakawatambula ndughu tsake, lekeni wawo ng'awamtambule baye. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Kuya Yosefu tsakakumbuka ndoto tsayawalotele ndughu tsake, kawalongela, “Mwemwe mwa wapelembi. Mtsa kuipelemba isi yetu mmanye pfaili.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Wamwidika, “Bae mkulu. Twetwe twa watumwa wako tutsa kughula chijo. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Twetwe twandughu, wose aba wetu yumwe. Twetwe twa wanu wanoghile wala si wapelembi baye.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Yosefu kakomangitsa, kawalongela, “Mbe. Mtsa kwiyona isi yetu pfaili.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Lekeni wamlongela, “Twetwe watumwa wako twa kumi na weli, wose hano aba wetu yumwe, yeye kokala mna isi ya Kanaani. Mtsuwanda wetu kaukaye na aba wetu, na mdodo wetu yungi kafa.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Yosefu kawalongela, “Ka pfaniwalongele. Mwemwe mwa wapelembi. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Apfi pfipfo pfamtsoghetsighwa, nelaha kwa taghwa lya Farao, ng'amtsakuka mbaka mtsuwanda wenu hayatsakutsa hano. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Mlaghitseni yumwe wenu yaghende yakamsole mtsuwanda wenu, wamwenga mtsokala mchifungo mbaka haitsomanyika ka chayamlongile cholongesa. Ka si pfipfo baye, nelaha kwa taghwa lya Faraho mwemwe mwa wapelembi!” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Kuya tsakaweka wose mchifungo kwa ghamatsuwa madatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Mna litsuwa lya kadatu Yosefu kawalongela, “Nene na imunu yanimpfuka Imulungu, mtende chaniwalongela na mtsokala waghima. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Ka mwolongesa, mlekeni yumwe wenu akale mchifungo, na wamwenga wawaghalile chijo ndughu tsenu iwane nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Kuya mngalile mtsuwanda wenu. Mng'atenda apfo nene nomanya mwemwe mwolongesa, namwe ng'amtsokomighwa baye.” Kuya tsawatoghola kutenda apfo.<verse eid="GEN 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Welongela, “Lelo twetwe wose twoghaya kwa achila chatumtendele ndughu yetu, tsatumwona hayang'ali koghanzika, naye hayatulombile tumwapfile, twetwe ng'atumtegheletse baye. Apfo sambi twoghanzika.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Rubeni kamwidika, “Apfi siwalongele tuleke kumlagha msongolo? Lekeni mwemwe ng'amnitegheletse baye! Sambi twoghanzika kwa achila chatumtendele.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Wawo ng'awamanyile baye ka Yosefu yang'ali yowahulika, kwaapfila Yosefu yang'ali yolonga kubitila imunu yungi. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Yosefu kahunduka mmbalimbali kalila. Kuya kawoyila na kalonga nawo keli. Kamghogha Simeoni, kamwoha hambele yawo.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndughu tsake Yosefu wakuya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Yosefu tsakalaghitsa maghunila ghawo ghameme ipfijo, na chila imunu sendi yake ikighwe mna ghunila lyake, na weng'ighwe maho yokuja mnzila. Tsawatendelighwa pfipfo. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Kuya ndughu awo wawabapitsa mitsigho pfihongwe wawo, woka. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Hanu hala hawemile wawase, yumwe wawo kadohola ghunila lyake yasole ichijo yamwing'e chihongwe wake, kakangawala kuyona sendi yake yohighwa mchang'a mwa ghunila. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Kawalongela ndughu tsake, “Sendi yangu wambuyitsila, mlole yamna ghunila lyangu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:28">Hawahulike apfi, mimoyo yawo itenyuka, wehundukila aku wodedema, weghutsa, “Angu achi choni Imulungu chayatutendele?” <verse eid="GEN 42:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Hawapfikile kwa aba wawo, mna isi ya Kanaani, wamlongela ghose ighawalawile. Walonga, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Imunu iyali mkulu wa isi ya Misiri tsakatulonga kwa ukali na katona twetwe twa wapelembi muisi mwake. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Lekeni tumwidika, ‘Twetwe twa wanu wanoghile, wala si wapelembi baye. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Twetwe twa ndughu, wose hano aba wetu yumwe. Mdodo wetu yumwe kafa, na mtsuwanda wetu kaukaye na aba wetu mna isi ya Kanaani.’ <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Imkulu wa isi ila katulongela, ‘Apfi pfipfo pfanitsomanya ka mwolongesa. Mlekeni ndughu yenu yumwe akale na nene, wamwenga wenu muwaghalile pfijo ndughu tsenu iwane nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Lekeni ngalileni mdodo wenu, apfo nitsomanya mwemwe si wapelembi ila mwa wanu iwanoghile. Kuya nitsomwing'ani ndughu yenu, na mwodaha kuchuhutsa mna isi ino.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Hawang'ali womwagha maghunila ghawo, chila yumwe kona mkoba ghwake ghwa sendi mna ghunila lyake. Hawonile apfo, wawo na aba wawo tsawapfuka. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Yakobu aba wawo kawalongela, “Mwobama nyaghitse wanangu wose! Yosefu ng'alibaha, Simeoni naye ng'alibaha baye, lelo mwobama mumsole Benjamini. Agho ghose ghandawila nene!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Kuya Rubeni kamlongela aba wake, “Ning'aleka kumuyitsa Benjamini, wakome wanangu weli. Ndekelele Benjamini mbuke naye nani nitsomlolesa na nitsomuyitsa kuna ghweghwe.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Lekeni Yakobu kalonga, “Mbe, ng'amdaha baye kuhulumka na mwanangu, mkulu wake kafa naye kaheka. Ang'atingwa mnzila, usungu wodaha kung'oma na unzehe wangu na mvili tsangu nzelu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Ndughu tsake Yakobu wakuya Misiri na Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Kuya inzala tsang'ali mna isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Hawamalitse ichijo chawaghulile Misiri, aba wawo kawalongela, “Mghende keli Misiri mkatughulile ichijo chingi.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Lekeni Yuda kamlongela aba wake, “Imunu yula katukanya ghendo, kalonga, ‘Sitsowabokela baye ka ng'amkutsa baye na mtsuwanda wenu.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Ung'amleka ndughu yetu yaghende na twetwe, tutsoghenda kukughulila ichijo. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Ung'alema aleke kughenda na twetwe, twetwe ng'atughenda baye, kwaapfila imunu yula katulongela, ng'amtsombona baye ka ng'amkutsa na mdodo wenu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Isiraeli kawaghutsa, “Ule mnighalile maghayo ghano kwa kumlongela imunu ayo ka mna mdodo wenu yungi?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Wamwidika, “Munu yula tsakatughutsa ng'ani mbuli tsetu na mbuli tsa kaye yetu. Kalonga, ‘Pfii aba wenu mghima? Pfii mna mdodo yungi?’ Apfo tsatumwidika ka pfayatughutsile. Twetwe tung'amanyiletse ka ang'atulongele tumghalile mdodo wetu?”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Kuya Yuda kamlongela Isiraeli aba wake, “Mleke ng'ende naye, na tutsoghenda sambi baha kughula chijo, hela twetwe, ghweghwe ne iwana wetu tuleke kufa nzala. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Nene nitsomlolesa, pfipfila nitsomuyitsa. Ning'aleka kumuyitsa na kumwika hambele hako, ghweghwe undilile nene ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Kwaapfila ka ng'atukawile baye, tung'aghendile ako no ukuya lwakabili.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Kuya aba wawo kawalongela, “Ka apfo pfipfo pfaili, msole pfijo ipfinoghile pfa isi yetu, mumghalile nzawadi imunu ayo. Mumghalile mafuta chidogho gha ukwaju, uki chidogho, ubani, manemane, kungu na lotsi. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Msole sendi kubita aila iibamighwa, kwaapfila mwobamighwa muitse sendi tsila itsikighwe mna maghunila ghenu, songaha tsawasemwa kutsisola. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Pfipfila msoleni mdodo wenu mghende naye kwa imunu ayo. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Nomlomba Imulungu yawonele libatsi hambele he imunu ayo ili yawalekelele ndughu yenu na Benjamini muye nawo. Wanangu wang'ahupa wose leka iwe pfipfo.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Apfo wasola mighweko na sendi kubita atsila tsa mwanduso, aku welongotsa na Benjamini, wasumkila Misiri. Hawapfikile, waghenda kwima hambele ya Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Yosefu hayamwonile Benjamini kelongotsa nawo, kamlongela mbetetsi wa ing'anda yake, “Wasole iwanu wano waghale ukaye yangu, umchinje imnyama, wambikile chijo, kwaapfila watsakuja na nene nemisi ino.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Imunu yula katenda ka Yosefu pfayamlongele, kawaghala iwanu wala ukaye kwa Yosefu.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Lekeni hawonile woghalighwa mng'anda mwa Yosefu, tsawapfuka, welongela, “Tughalighwa kuno kwa sendi tsila tsawatuyitsile mna maghunila ghetu hatutsile mwanduso. Kobama yatughoghe, yatuboke pfihongwe wetu na kututenda tuwe watumwa wake.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Apfo tsawamghendela mbetetsi wa Yosefu, walonga naye hawang'ali mna libani. <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />Wamlongela, “Chondechonde mkulu wetu, mwanduso tsatuhulumka hano kughula chijo. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Lekeni chilo chila hatupfikile hanu ho ukuwasa, tsatupfughula maghunila ghetu na chila munu kona sendi tsake mna ghunila lyake. Lelo tutsuyitsa sendi tsenu. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Pfipfila tutsa na sendi tsingi tsa kughulila ichijo. Ng'atumanyile baye iyekile sendi tsila mna maghunila ghetu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Mbetetsi yula kawalongela, “Mleke kupfuka, Imulungu wenu, yeye iyali Imulungu wa aba wenu, kamwing'ani fetsa atso mna maghunila ghenu, ma nibokela sendi tsenu.” Kuya kawaghalila Simoni.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Mbetetsi yula kawengitsa iwanu wala mng'anda mwa Yosefu. Kaweng'a ghamatsi waopfughe ghamaghulu ghawo, kaweng'a chijo pfihongwe wawo. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Nawo tsawaandaa nzawadi tsawo wamwing'e Yosefu hayatsopfika nemisi, kwaapfila tsawahulika watsakuja naye. <verse eid="GEN 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Yosefu hayapfikile ukaye, wamwing'a ipfinu apfila pfawatsile napfo kumghweka, kuya wamwinamila. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Kawalamsa baho kawaghutsa, “Tsamnongela mbuli tsa aba wenu iyalalile, pfii kalamka? Pfii kamghima?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Wamwidika, “Aba wetu, iyali mtumwa wako kamghima.” Kuya wamwinamila.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Yosefu hayenule tsinenge kamwona Benjamini, mdodo wake, imwana wa mai wake, kawaghutsa, “Pfii ayuno iyo mdodo wenu yamnilongele mbuli tsake?” Kuya kalonga, “Msongolo, Imulungu yakubaliki.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Bahala Yosefu katsumka kalawa, kwaapfila ghumoyo ghwake tsaghumwonela usungu mdodo wake, tsakabama alile, apfo kaghenda mng'anda mwake, kalila. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Hayahopfughe chihanga chake, kalawa, keghanamitsa, kalaghitsa watumwa waghale chijo. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Yosefu tsakeng'ighwa ichijo yeye yaliyeka, ndughu tsake wawo waliyeka, na Wamisiri iwatsile nawo waja waliyeka, kwaapfila Wamisiri tsawaghomighwa ukuja na Waheburaniya. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Ndughu tsake Yosefu tsawakala hambele hake kwa kulola ukulu wawo, kwanzila chaudele mbaka mtsuwanda. Tsawelolesa nawo wakangawala. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Tsaweng'ighwa chijo kulawa mmetsa mwa Yosefu, lekeni Benjamini tsakeng'ighwa mala tano kubita ndughu tsake. Apfo tsawaja, wanwa no ukudeng'elela naye.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Ichikombe chaghile chakoneka kwa Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Yosefu kamlaghitsa mbetetsi yula we ing'anda yake, kamlongela, “Ughamemese maghunila ghe iwanu wano chijo chingi ka pfawodaha kughala, kuya wike sendi ya chila imunu mna ghunila lyake. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Kuya wike ichikombe changu cha fetsa mna ghunila lya ayula mdodo hamwe na sendi yake ye ichijo.” Naye tsakatenda ka Yosefu pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Hakuchele nemitondotondo, wawaleka woke hamwe na pfihongwe wawo. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Ng'awaghendile baye kutali kulawa mna ghumji, Yosefu kamlongela mbetetsi wake, “Sambi baha wawinze iwanu wala, na hautsowapfika, waghutse, ‘Ule mliha ghehile kwa ighanoghile? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Ule mwemwe mwiba chikombe cha mkulu wangu? Angu achi si ichikombe chayonwela mkulu wangu baye, kuya kochilaghulilagha? Chinu chino chamtendile chiha ghendo!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Mmbetetsi yula hayawapfikile tsakawalongela mbuli atso. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Lekeni wawo wamghutsa, “Mtwatsa una mana yachi haulonga pfino? Twetwe watumwa wako ng'atudaha baye kutenda chinu ka acho! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Ulole, hata sendi tsatwonile mna maghunila ghetu tsatumuyitsileni kulawa mna isi ya Kanaani. Lelo twodahatse ukwiba fetsa au nzahabu kulawa mng'anda mwe imtwatsa wako? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Imunu wowose mna twetwe ang'oneka nacho, yakomighwe, na twetwe tutsakuwa watumwa wako.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Imunu yula kalonga, “Pfinogha, iwe ka pfamlongile. Imunu wowose ang'oneka nacho katsakuwa mtumwa wangu, namwe wangi mtsolekelighwa.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Chila imunu kahulumsa hasi ghunila lyake himahima, kalipfughula. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Kuya imunu yula kaghendelela ukubama, kandusila kwa imkulu mbaka kwa mdodo. Ne ichikombe tsachoneka mna ghunila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Baho waghadegha maghwanda ghawo kwa usungu. Kuya wawabapitsa pfihongwe wawo imitsigho, woya mna ghumji.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yuda na ndughu tsake hawapfikile ukaye kwa Yosefu, Yosefu mwenyegho tsayang'ali baho, nawo wamwinamila. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Yosefu kawaghutsa, “Ebali mtendile pfino? Apfi ng'ammanyile baye imunu ka nene nodaha kulaghula?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yuda kamwidika, “Mtwatsa, tukulongele choni? Twodaha kulonga choni? Tulonge choni ili ghweghwe umanye ka twetwe tutotsa? Imulungu kaghona matotso ghetu. Twetwe wose sambi twa watumwa wako, twetwe na yula yoneke ne ichikombe.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Lekeni Yosefu kalonga, “Mbe! Sidaha baye kutenda apfo. Imunu yula iyoneke ne ichikombe yaliheka iyo iyatsakuwa mtumwa wangu. Mwemwe wangi muye tseghamba kwa aba wenu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda komwamila Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Yuda kamghendela Yosefu kamlongela, “Chondechonde mtwatsa wangu, ndeke nonge naghwe chidogho. Uleke kumbonela maya mtumwa wako, kwaapfila ukulu winawo weghala ne Farao mwenyegho. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Mkulu wangu tsakutughutsa, ‘Apfi aba wenu kamghima na mwinaye ndughu yungi?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Kuya tukwidika, ‘Ona Aba wetu mghima, lekeni kalala, na tunaye mdodo wetu yungi, ayu aba wetu kamweleka hayang'ali kalala. mbala wake mdodo ayo ma kafa, naye kwa mai wake kakala kayeka, naye konoghelwa ng'ani na aba wetu.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Kuya tsakutulongela watumwa wako, ‘Mghaleni kuna nene nimwone.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Mtwatsa wangu tsatukulongela, ‘Msongolo ng'odaha baye kumleka aba wake, ang'amleka, aba wake katsakufa.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Lekeni tsakutulongela watumwa wako, ‘Ka ng'amtsohulumka ne imdodo wenu, ng'amtsombona keli baye.’<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />“Hatuyile kwa aba wetu, tsatumlongela ka pfautulaghitse. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Kuya aba wetu katulongela, ‘Mghende mkaghule keli ichijo chidogho.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Lekeni tsatumlongela, ‘Ng'atudaha baye kuhulumka, mbaka tughende na ndughu yetu mdodo. Ka ng'atsoghenda na twetwe, ng'atudaha baye kumwona imunu yula.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Kuya mtumwa wako, aba wetu, katulongela, ‘Mwomanya mwehe wangu Raheli tsakanyelekela iwana weli. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Yumwe tsakagha. Nani tsanilonga, “Nomanya ghendo ayo wamtsaulatsaula ne imnyama wa kumuhulo.” Mana kulawa baho sina nimwone keli. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Mng'amsola hayuno naye, na ghehile ghang'amlawila, mwodaha kunitsika mchibaka kwa usungu na unzehe wangu.’<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />“Apfo mtwatsa, ning'oya kwa mtumwa wako, aba wangu bila ya mbwanga yuno, aku ugima wa aba wangu wouhila ugima wa mbwanga ayuno, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />yang'ona mbwanga yuno ng'ali na twetwe baye, katsakufa. Apfo twetwe watumwa wako, tutsomkoma aba wetu kwa usungu. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Nene mtumwa wako, tsanimlongela aba wangu nitsomlolesa msongolo ayuno. Ning'aleka kumuyitsa kuna ghweghwe, nitsakuwa na totso kuna ghweghwe ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Lelo nokulomba, ndeka nene niwe mtumwa wako hanu ha msongolo yuno, na mleke msongolo yuno yoye ukaye hamwe na ndughu tsake. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Lelo nitsodahatse kumghendela aba wangu bila ya msongolo yuno? Sidaha baye ukwona ghehile ighatsomlawila aba wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu kowalongela ndughu tsake yeye yali nani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Kuya Yosefu ng'adahile baye kwikatsa hambele he iwanu iwemile habehi naye. Kadamilila, kalonga, “Laweni kunze!” Apfo Yosefu hayelanguse kwa ndughu tsake tsakuduhu imunu yungi hamwe naye. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Yosefu tsakalila ng'ani mbaka Wamisiri wamuhulika. Pfipfila ne iwanu iwali mkaye mwa Farao tsawahulika. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yosefu kawalongela ndughu tsake, “Nene na Yosefu! Pfii aba wangu mghima?” Ndughu tsake hawahulike apfi, tsawapfuka ghendo, apfo ng'awadahile baye kumwidika. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Kuya Yosefu kawalongela ndughu tsake, “Mtse kuna nene.” Hawamsoghelele, kawalongela, “Nene na Yosefu, ndughu yenu, iyamuutsile Misiri. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Lelo mleke kwona usungu na mleke kwiyonela maya kwa kuniutsa, kwaapfila Imulungu tsakanituma niwalongole ili nikombole ughima we iwanu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Aghuno mwaka ghwa keli ghwe nzala muisi, na ing'ali miyaka ingi mitano, iwanu ng'awatsolima wala kupfuna. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Lekeni Imulungu kanituma niwalongole ili niwekile chijo muisi na kuwakombolani kwa ukombotsi mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Apfo si mwemwe baye iyamnighalile kuno, ila Imulungu. Imulungu kanyika ka aba wa Farao, na imkulu wa kaye yake yose, na mtawala wa isi yose ya Misiri.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />“Lelo mghende himahima kwa aba wangu, mumlongele apfi pfipfo pfayolonga mwanagho Yosefu, ‘Imulungu kanitenda niwe mkulu wa isi yose ya Misiri, hulumka himahima uleke kukawa. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Naghwe kutsokala mna isi ya Gosheni, kutsokala habehi na nene, ghweghwe, iwanagho, watsukulu wako, wang'olo wako, wamene wako, ng'ombe wako na pfose pfauli napfo. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Ung'akala Gosheni, nitsokulolesa. Ing'ali miyaka ingi mitano ye nzala yakutsa. Nene sibama baye, ghweghwe, na wali akaye yako na wanyama wako mfe nzala.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Kuya Yosefu kalonga, “Mwemwe wenyegho mmbona kwa nenge tsenu, na ndughu yangu Benjamini naye kambona kwa nenge tsake, ka nene yanilonga na mwemwe na Yosefu ghendo. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Mumlongele aba wangu pfanili mkulu mna isi ya Misiri na ghose ghamwonile. Kuya mtende himahima mumghale hano aba wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Kuya Yosefu kamhabatila Benjamini, mdodo wake, kalila, Benjamini naye tsakalila aku wehabatila. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Yosefu tsakawahabatila ndughu tsake, kawanonela aku kolila. Baho ndughu tsake tsawanza kulonga naye.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Mbuli atso hatsipfikile mng'anda mwa Farao ka ndughu tsake Yosefu watsa, Farao na watumwa wake wose tsawadeng'elela. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Farao kamlongela Yosefu, “Walongele ndughu tsako wawabapitse pfihongwe wawo imitsigho, woye mna isi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />kuya wamghale hano aba wenu na iwanu wose wa kaye yenu. Nene nitsoweng'a hanu hanoghile mna isi ya Misiri, nawo watsobweda ukuja ipfijo pfa isi ino. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Pfipfila walaghitse wasole mituka yo ukukweghighwa na falasi kulawa hano Misiri, iwasole iwana wawo na wapinga wawo, watse na aba wawo. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Waleke kwalangula pfinu pfawoleka, kwaapfila ghanoghile ghendo gha Misiri ghatsakuwa ghawo.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Iwana wa Isiraeli tsawatenda ka pfawalaghitsighwe. Yosefu kaweng'a mituka ka Farao pfayalaghitse, pfipfila kaweng'a na mao. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Kuya tsakamwing'a chila munu mabwende ghangi gha sambi, lekeni tsakamwing'a Benjamini pfihindi miya ndatu pfa fetsa na maghwanda matano. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Yosefu kamtumila aba wake pfinu pfino kwa ghumwanza ghwake ghwa ukutsa Misiri, pfihongwe kumi iwaghalile pfinu pfinoghile kulawa Misiri, na pfihongwe wangi kumi wapinga iwaghalile ipfijo, pfighate na ipfijo pfimwenga. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Kuya Yosefu kawaagha ndughu tsake, hawang'ali wakuka kawalongela, “Mleke kwisonga mnzila.”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Apfo walawa Misiri woya Kanaani kwa Yakobu, aba wawo. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Wamlongela aba wawo, “Yosefu kamghima! Naye iyo mkulu wa isi yose ya Misiri!” Yakobu tsakakangawala ng'adahile baye kutoghola.<verse eid="GEN 45:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Lekeni hawamlongele ghose Yosefu ghayawalongele, na hayonile mituka Yosefu yaighalile kumsola kughenda Misiri, Yakobu tsakadeng'elela sideke. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Isiraeli kalonga, “Sambi notoghola, mwanangu Yosefu kamghima. Nitsoghenda kumwona ng'ana sina nyife.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu koghenda Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Yakobu tsakasola pfinu pfake pfose, kaghenda Misiri. Hayapfikile Beasheba kamlapfila nambiko Imulungu wa Isaka, aba wake. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Imulungu tsakalonga na Isiraeli mndoto nechilo, kalonga, “Yakobu, Yakobu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Yakobu kamwidika, “Oo, nokutegheletsa.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Imulungu kamlongela, “Nene na Imulungu, Imulungu wa aba wako. Uleke kupfuka kughenda Misiri, kwaapfila nitsokwing'a iwana ketseketse. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Nitsoghenda naghwe Misiri na nitsokuyitsa kuno. Hautsakufa Yosefu katsokala hamwe naghwe.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Kuya Yakobu tsakalawa Beasheba, iwana wa Isiraeli wamsola aba wawo, iwana wawo na iwapinga wawo mna imituka ila yaighalile Farao kuwasola. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Pfipfila tsawawasola iwanyama wawo na mali tsawo tsawapatile mna isi ya Kanaani, Yakobu kawasola iwatsukulu wake wose, <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />iwanaghe, watsukulu wake na lukolo lwake lwose kaghenda nawo mbaka Misiri.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Aghano mataghwa gha iwana wa Isiraeli iwaghendile Misiri, Rubeni, imwana chaudele wa Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Iwana wa Rubeni tsa Hanoki, Palu, Hesironi na Kami. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Simeoni na iwanaghe, Yemueli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Sohari na Shuli yelekighwe na ipinga Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Lawi na iwanaghe, Gerishoni, Kohati na Merari. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Yuda na iwanaghe, Eri, Onani, Shela, Peresi na Zera. Lekeni Eri na Onani tsawafila mna isi ya Kanaani. Iwana wa Peresi tsa Hesironi na Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Isakari na iwanaghe, Tola, Puva, Yashubu na Shimoni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Zabuloni na iwanaghe, Seredi, Eloni na Yaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Awo tsaiwana wa Lea, iyamwelekele Yakobu mna isi ya Padani aramu, hamwe na Dina, neghe wake. Iwanaghe wose na iwatsukulu wake wose tsa selasini na wadatu. <verse eid="GEN 46:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Gadi na iwanaghe, Sifioni, Hagi, Shuni, Esiboni, Eri, Arodi na Areli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Asheri na iwanaghe, Imna, Ishiva, Ishivi, Beria na Sera, lumbu wawo. Beria na iwanaghe, Heberi na Malikieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Awano iwana na watsukulu kumi na sita wa Yakobu na Zilipa, imtumwa Labani iyamwing'ile Lea, neghe wake.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Raheli tsakamwelekela Yakobu iwana weli, Yosefu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Hako Misiri, Asenati neghe Potifera iyakalile mlapfa nambiko wa isi ya Oni, tsakamwelekela Yosefu iwana weli, Manase na Efraimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Iwana wa Benjamini tsa Bela, Bekeri, Ashiberi, Gera, Naamani, Ehi, Roshi, Mupimu, Hupimu na Ardi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Awano tsa iwana wa Raheli ne watsukulu wake, iyamwelekele Yakobu, wose tsa kumi na nne.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Imwanaghe Dani yang'ali Hushimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Nafutali na iwanaghe, Yeseeli, Guni, Yeseri na Shilemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Awano saba iwana wa Yakobu na Bila, imtumwa Labani iyamwing'ile Raheli, neghe wake.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Iwana wa Yakobu na watsukulu wake tsa sitini na sita, iwapinga wa iwanaghe ng'awapetighwe baye. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Yosefu hayang'ali Misiri tsakeleka iwana weli. Iwanu wose wa kaye ya Yakobu iwaghendile Misiri tsa sabini.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu na lukolo lwake wopfika Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Yakobu tsakamtuma Yuda yalongole kumlomba Yosefu wetingane Gosheni. Hawapfikile Gosheni, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yosefu tsakadina mtuka ghwake, kaghenda kumbokela Isiraeli, aba wake ako Gosheni. Hawetingane, Yosefu kamkumbatila aba wake na kalila kwa chipindi chitali. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Yakobu kamlongela, “Sambi hata ning'afa si chinu baye, kwaapfila nikwona na nimanya ka kwamghima.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Kuya Yosefu kawalongela ndughu tsake na iwanu wa kaye ya aba wake, “Nogheluka kumlongela Farao ka ndughu tsangu na kaye ya aba wangu, iwang'ali wokala mna isi ya Kanaani ma wanitsila. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Nitsomlongela mwemwe mwa wadimi mana mwodima iwanyama, na mtsa na iwang'olo wenu, iwamene wenu, ng'ombe wenu na mali tsenu tsose. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Lelo, Farao hayatsowakema na kuwaghutsa, ‘Ng'onde yachi yamsang'ana?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Mmwidike, ‘Mkulu, twetwe watumwa wako, kulawa udodo wetu mbaka leloli twetwe twa wadimi, ka pfawakalile iwabala wetu,’ mlonge apfi ili mkale Gosheni.” Yosefu tsakalonga apfi kwaapfila Wamisiri wowahila iwadimi.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Apfo Yosefu kamghendela Farao, kamlongela, “Aba wangu na ndughu tsangu, hamwe na iwang'olo wawo, ng'ombe wawo na mali tsawo tsose, wapfika kulawa isi ya Kanaani. Lelo wa ako Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Yosefu kawasola ndughu tsake watano, kawaghala kwa Farao.<verse eid="GEN 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Farao kawaghutsa, “Ng'onde yachi yamsang'ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Wamwidika, “Twetwe watumwa wako twa wadimi, ka pfawakalile iwabala wetu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Kuya wamlongela Farao, “Twetwe watumwa wako tutsa kukala hano ka wahenza, kwaapfila mna isi ya Kanaani kuna nzala ng'ani na kuduhu ichijo kwa iwanyama. Apfo twokulomba twetwe watumwa wako tukale mna isi ya Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Farao kamlongela Yosefu, “Aba wako na ndughu tsako wakutsila ghweghwe, <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />isi yose yamna ghamoko ghako. Mwing'e aba wako na ndughu tsako hanu hanoghile mna isi ino. Na mna ndughu tsako, ung'awamanya iwanu iwosang'ana ghoya, wasaghule wawe wabetetsi wa iwanyama wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Kuya Yosefu kamghala Yakobu, aba wake kwa Farao. Yakobu hayambaliki Farao, <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Farao kamghutsa, “Angu kuna miyaka mingapi?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakobu kamwidika Farao, “Nina miyaka miya imwe na selasini yaning'ali nikwanga kwanga. Miyaka ayo iwa midodo na imema maghayo, na ng'aighala baye na miyaka iwakalile nayo aba tsangu mna ukwanga kwawo.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Kuya Yakobu kambaliki Farao, koka. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Kuya Yosefu kaweng'a aba wake na ndughu tsake hanu hakemighwe Ramesesi, hanu hanoghile mna isi ya Misiri, ka Farao pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yosefu tsakamwing'a chijo aba wake, ndughu tsake na iwanu wose wa kaye ya aba wake, hamwe na iwana wawo.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzala ng'ulu mna isi ya Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Mne isi yose tsakuduhu chijo. Nzala tsa ng'ulu ng'ani mbaka iwanu wa isi ya Misiri na Kanaani tsawasoka. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yosefu tsakakunga tsisendi kulawa mna isi ya Misiri na Kanaani kwa ipfijo ipfighulighwe, kuya kaghala sendi tsila kwa Farao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Sendi tsa iwanu wa Misiri na Kanaani hatsimalile, Wamisiri wose wamghendela Yosefu wamlongela, “Twing'e ichijo! Ule tufe hambele yako? Lola, sendi tsetu tsimala.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yosefu kawalongela, “Ka mwahela sendi, ngalileni iwanyama wenu kuya nene nitsoweng'a ichijo.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Apfo wamghalila Yosefu farasi, iwang'olo, iwamene na pfihongwe, naye kaweng'a ichijo. Ghumwaka ghula Yosefu yang'ali yoweng'a ipfijo na wawo wang'ali womwing'a iwanyama wawo.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Ghumwaka ghuwinzile, wamtsila keli wamlongela, “Ng'atudaha baye kukupfisa mkulu wetu ka sendi tsetu tsimala na iwanyama wetu wamna ghamoko ghako, kuduhu chinu ichisighale ila ngupfu tsetu na mighumda yetu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Ule tufe hambele yako na mighunda yetu ihinyike? Tughule twetwe na mighunda yetu, twetwe na mighunda yetu tutsakuwa pfinu pfa Farao. Twing'e mbeghu tukale waghima, tuleke kufa, na mighunda yetu ileke kusakala.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Apfo Yosefu kamghulila Farao isi yose ya Misiri. Kwaapfila nzala tsaikala ng'ulu ng'ani, Wamisiri wose tsawahutsa mighunda. Isi tsaiwa ya Farao. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Iwanu wose wa Misiri, kulawa hanu hamwe mbaka hanu hangi, wawa iwatumwa wa Farao. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Lekeni Yosefu ng'adahile baye kughula mighunda ya walapfa nambiko, kwaapfila Farao yang'ali yoweng'agha ipfijo. Apfo ng'awahutsile baye mighunda yawo. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Yosefu kawalongela iwanu, “Mlole, nimghulani mwemwe na nimghulila Farao imighunda yenu. Mbeghu tsino ano, mkatsihande mna mighunda yenu. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Lekeni hamtsopfuna mtsomwing'a Farao lifungu lya tano lya mapfuno ghenu. Mapfuno ighasighale ghatsakuwa mbeghu tsenu, chijo chenu, cha ndughu tsenu na iwanenu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Kuya wamwidika, “Mkulu wetu, kuukombola ughima wetu, kutwonela libatsi, na twetwe tutsakuwa watumwa wa Farao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Apfo Yosefu keka laghitso mbaka leloli Misiri, Wamisiri wobamighwa wamlihe Farao lifungu lya tano lya mapfuno ghawo. Mighunda ya walapfa nambiko iliyeka ng'aighulighwe na ng'aiwile mighunda ya Farao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laghitso lya Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Waisiraeli tsawakala Gosheni mna isi ya Misiri. Hamwo tsawapata mali, tsaweleka iwana no ukwongetseka. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobu tsakakala Misiri kwa miyaka kumi na saba, apfo ughima wake wose tsaukala miyaka miya imwe alubaini na saba. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Gamatsuwa ghake gha ukufa haghapfikile, Yakobu kamkema Yosefu imwanaghe, kamlongela, “Ka nokunoghela, wike ghumoko ghwako hane hatsa lyangu wilahe, ka kutsonangusa libatsi na uluso, nokulomba uleke kunitsika Misiri. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Hanitsakufa, uleke kunitsika mna isi ino. Lusole lukuli lwangu ukalutsike hanu kwawatsikighwe iwabala wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yosefu kamwidika, “Nitsotenda ka pfaulongile.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Yakobu kalonga, “Wilahe ka kutsonitendela apfi.” Yosefu kelaha, kuya Yakobu kenamila ubali wa lusatsi lwake kamlongela mighede Imulungu.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu kombaliki Efraimu na Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Hambele, iwanu wamlongela Yosefu, “Aba wako koghula.” Apfo kawasola iwanaghe weli Manase na Efraimu, waghenda kumwona Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Iwanu hawamlongele Yakobu, “Imwanagho Yosefu kakutsa kukulola,” Isiraeli kapata ngupfu na kakala mlusatsi. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Yakobu kamlongela Yosefu, “Imulungu Iyane Ngupfu ng'ani tsakandawila ako Luzu, mna isi ya Kanaani, kanibaliki. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Kanongela, ‘Nitsokwing'a iwana wengi, apfo watsukulu wako watsakuwa kolo nyingi, nitsoweng'a watsukulu wako waitawale isi ino matsuwa ghose.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Yakobu kaghendelela kulonga, “Yosefu, iwanagho weli, yuweleke ano Misiri ng'ana nene sina mvike baye, awo wose wanangu, Efraimu na Manase watsakuwa wanangu ka pfawali Rubeni na Simoni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Ung'eleka iwana wangi, awo watsakuwa wako, ng'awatsogholighwa baye isi yangu, ila watsogholighwa kubitila mataghwa gha Efraimu na Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Notenda pfino kwa achila ichimlawile mai wako, Raheli. Haning'ali nikuya kulawa isi ya Padani Raheli tsakafila mna isi ya Kanaani, habehi na kupfika Efrata, tsambona usungu ng'ani. Apfo tsanimtsika baho, mmbalimbali mwa nzila ighenda Efrata, sambi yokemighwa Betilehemu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Isiraeli hawonile iwana wa Yosefu, kamghutsa, “Awano tsina nani?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yosefu kamwidika aba wake, “Awano wanangu, iyangaile Imulungu haning'ali hano Misiri.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Kuya Isiraeli kalonga, “Chondechonde ngalile hano habehi niwabaliki.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Nenge tsa Isiraeli ng'atsing'ali kwona pfinoghile baye kwaapfila tsakalala. Apfo Yosefu kawasoghetsa iwanaghe habehi na aba wake, naye kawahaghatila na kawanonela. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Isiraeli kamlongela Yosefu, “Tsanyaghitsa sitsokwona keli baye, lekeni pfipfila Imulungu kabama niwone iwanagho.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Kuya Yosefu kawasola iwanaghe mmahatsa mwa Isiraeli na kamwinamila mbaka chihanga chake chidonza hasi.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Yosefu kamwika Efraimu ubali wa kumoso wa Isiraeli na Manase ubali wa kujilo. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Lekeni Isiraeli kaghugholosa ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo na kaghwika mwitwi mwa Efraimu, iyali mdodo, na ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso kaghwika mwitwi mwa Manase, iyali mkulu, mwana chaudele. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Kuya Isiraeli kambaliki Yosefu, kamlongela, “Ghwe Imulungu wa aba tsangu Abrahamu na Isaka iwakutegheletse mna ukukala kwao kose, Imulungu iyanilongotse mna ughima wangu mbaka leloli! Yawabaliki. <verse eid="GEN 48:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Malaika, iyang'ombole nene kulawa mna ghehile ghose, yawabaliki wasongolo wano. Taghwa lyangu na mataghwa gha iwabala wangu, Abrahamu na Isaka yakale mna iwasongolo wano, na wawe na iwana ketseketse na watsukulu ketseketse!”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Yosefu hayonile aba wake kamwikila Efraimu mwitwi ghumoko ghwa kujilo kona maya. Apfo kaghusola ghumoko ghwa aba wake kulawa mwitwi mwa Efraimu kaghwika mwitwi mwa Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Yosefu kamlongela aba wake, “Bae aba wangu. Ayuno ano chaudele, wike ghumoko ghwako mwitwi mwake.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Lekeni aba wake tsakalema, kalonga, “Mwanangu nomanya chanitenda. Pfipfila iwana wa Manase watsakuwa wakulu. Lekeni mdodo wake kakuwa mkulu kubita yeye, na watsukulu wake watsakuwa wengi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Apfo Isiraeli kawabaliki litsua lilila kalonga, “Waisiraeli watsoghakema mataghwa ghenu hawotsobaliki, watsolonga, ‘Imulungu yakutendele ghanoghile ka Efraimu na Manase.’ ” Kwa kutenda apfo kamwika Efraimu hambele ya Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Kuya Yakobu kamlongela Yosefu, “Ka pfaumbona, nene nahabehi kufa, lekeni Imulungu katsokala hamwe naghwe, naye katsowoitsa mna isi ya iwabala wenu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Nokwing'a ghweghwe isi ya Shekemu na simwing'a baye ndughu yako yungi, isi ila ine lidongo linoghile niibokile kulawa kwa Waamori kwa kwitowa nawo kwa lipanga na uminde wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu kowabaliki iwanaghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Yakobu kawakema iwanaghe kawalongela, “Mwitingane hamwe niwalongele ighatsowalawila ghamatsuwa ighakutsa.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Mwitingane na mtegheletse, mwemwe iwana wa Yakobu. Mnitegheletse nene Isiraeli, aba wenu.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Rubeni, ghweghwe kwa mwanangu chaudele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Ghweghwe mwanangu wa mwanduso na usongolo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Ghweghwe kwa mkulu na kuna ngupfu kubita iwanangu wose.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Ghweghwe kweghala na ghamatsi ighopiruka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Lekeni ng'autsolongola keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Mana tsakuwasa na chimada wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Na kuluhinya lusatsi lwa aba wako.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />Simoni na Lawi wawo ndughu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">Wotumila mimaghe kutenda ughobo.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Lekeni nene sitselunga mna mtingano ghwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Sibama baye kwilunga na mtingano ghwawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Kwaapfila kwa maya yawo tsawamkoma imunu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Na tsawamghana ng'ombe nyughe ye mghulu kwa uhonzolomo wawo.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Noilani maya yawo, mana tsa ng'ali ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Na maya yawo tsayahela libatsi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Nitsowabaghula mna isi ya Yakobu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Nitsowapwililisa mna isi ya Isiraeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Ghwe Yuda, ndughu tsako watsokutunitsa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Kutsowabota iwanebe wako msingo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Ndughu tsako watsokupfughumila ghamafindi.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Ghwe Yuda, kweghala na simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Iyalawile kuwinda na kukwila mchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Iyagholose na kuwasa hasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Simba iyane ngupfu, yuhi iyodaha kumlamsa?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Yuda kutsokindagha ng'weku ya chindewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">na ng'weku yo kutawala mmaghulu mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">mbaka hayatsopfika mwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Na iwanu wose watsomtoghola.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Katsomwoha chihongwe wake mna mtsabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na imwana wa chihongwe mna mtsabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Katsotsapfa lighwanda lyake mna dipfai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na maghwanda ghake mna dipfai ndung'u.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Nenge tsake tsitsakuwa ndung'u kwa kunwa dipfai, na matsino ghake ghatsakuwa matselu kwa kunwa matombo.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Zabuloni katsokala kumwani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Naye katsakuwa hanu ho ukwikila minumbwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Isi yake itsobakana na Sidoni.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Isakari keghala na chihongwe iyane ngupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">Iyowasa haghati mwa mitsigho yake.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Katsakona hanu ho ukubwihila hanoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Na isi iinoghelesa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Katsakwinama na kuhughala mtsigho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Katsakuwa mtumwa kwa sang'ano ng'omu.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Dani katsakuwa mlamutsi yanoghile kwe iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">ka kolo tsingi tsa Isiraeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Dani katsakuwa ka nzoka mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Nzoka iyane sumu mmbalimbali mwe inzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Katsomluma chihongwe chisegheyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Naye imunu iyamdinile katsoghwila chisogho.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />Ghwe Imtwatsa, nokubeta ung'ombole!<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Gadi katsotowighwa na iwanu iwoboka pfinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">Lekeni yeye katsowawinza kuchisogho na kuwatowa.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Isi ya Asheri itsomela pfijo pfingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">Naye katsomwing'a mfalume chijo ichinoghile.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Nafutali keghala na funo iyalekelighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">iyakweleka iwana iwanoghile.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Yosefu keghala na mbiki ighukweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">Mbiki ighukweleka ghamatunda ighuli habehi na mbwibwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">Ghamaputila ghake ghatanda mbanda.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Iwanebe wake tsawamtowa ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">Tsawamwasila mighowa na wamtsupfa ng'ani.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Lekeni uminde wake tsaukala pfinoghile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Ghamoko ghake tsaghapata ngupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Kwa ghamoko gha Yane Ngupfu wa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Kwa taghwa lya Mdimi, iyokemighwa Bambalawe lya Isiraeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Kwaapfila Imulungu wa aba wako katsokwapfila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Imulungu Yane Ngupfu Ng'ani katsokubaliki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">balaka tse imvula kulawa mlanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">balaka tsa ghamatsi ighaghendese kulawa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">balaka tsa iwapinga kweleka iwana wengi na iwanyama kweleka iwana wengi.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Aba wako katsokubaliki kubita balaka itsilawa mna pfidunda pfa ghumwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Kubita ipfinu pfinoghile ipfikoneka mna pfidunda ghamatsuwa ghose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Na pfinu apfo pfikale mwitwi mwa Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">pfikale mnotsi mwake, yeye iyali mkulu kwa ndughu tsake.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />Benjamini keghala na yumbwa mkali wa kumuhulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">Nemitondo kakuja chawingile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">nemihe kowinga na kughola chawingile.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Atsino kolo kumi na mbili tsa Isiraeli, na atso tsitso mbuli tsayawalongele Yakobu hayawabaliki, chila yumwe ka pfayabamighwe<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu kakufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Kuya Yakobu kawalaghitsa iwanaghe, “Nene nahabehi ukufa na kughenda kwe iwanu wangu. Mnitsike hamwe na iwabala wangu mna mango ilili mna mghunda mwa Efuroni Mhiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />ako Makipela, ubali wa kumoso wa Mamre, mna isi ya Kanaani. Abrahamu tsakaghula mango na mghunda aghwo kwa Efuroni Mhiti, ghuwe hanu hake ha kutsikila. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Ako kuko kwayatsikighwe Abrahamu na Sara, mwehe wake, Isaka na Rebeka, mwehe wake, na ako kuko kwanimtsikile Lea. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Mghunda aghwo na mango ayo tsapfighulighwa kwa Wahiti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Yakobu hayamalitse kuwalaghitsa iwanaghe, kagholosa maghulu ghake mlusatsi na baho kafa.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Yosefu kamwinamila aba wake kamuhabatila, kamlilila na kamnonela. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Kuya Yosefu kawalaghitsa iwaghanga wake, wambakatse dawa Isiraeli, aba wake, ili aleke kwola. Nawo tsawatenda pfipfo. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Sang'ano ya kulubaka dawa lukuli tsaisola matsuwa alubaini. Wamisiri tsawamlilila Yakobu kwa matsuwa sabini.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Chililo hachimalile, Yosefu kawalongela iwanu iwali mkaye mwa Farao, “Nomlombani, mghende kwa Farao mumlongele pfino, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‘Aba wangu hayanga'ali habehi no ukufa tsakanilomba nilahe, kanilaghitsa nimtsike mna mango yaiihongole mwenyegho mna isi ya Kanaani.’ Apfo nomlomba andeke ng'ende kumtsika aba wangu, kuya nitsakuya.”<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Farao kamwidika, “Ughende ukamtsike aba wako ka pfayakulaghitse.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Apfo Yosefu kaghenda kumtsika aba wake. Yosefu kaghenda hamwe na iwakulu wose wa Farao, wanzehe wa ing'anda ya Farao, hamwe na iwakulu wa isi yose ya Misiri. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Iwanu wa kaye ya Yosefu, ndughu tsake na iwanu wa kaye ya aba wake tsawaghenda naye. Mne isi ya Gosheni tsawawaleka iwana waliyeka hamwe na iwang'olo, iwamene na ng'ombe wawo. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Pfipfila tsawaghenda hamwe na iwadina farasi na mituka ye falasi. Tsalikala kingili kulu ng'ani.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Hawapfikile chibwalu cha kupetela, ichili Atadi, kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani, tsawalila kwa usungu ng'ani, naye Yosefu tsakamtendela aba wake matanga gha matsuwa saba. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Wakanaani iwokala hala hawawonile iwanu pfawodomboketsa mna chibwalu cha Atadi, walonga, “Chililo chino cha Wamisiri chikulu!” Achino chicho chitendile ihanu aho hali kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani hakemighwa Abeli Misiri.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Iwana wa Yakobu tsawamtendela aba wawo ka pfayawalaghitse, <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />wamsola mbaka isi ya Kanaani, tsawamtsika mna mango ilili mna mghunda akula Makipela, habehi na Mamre. Imango hamwe na mghunda aghwo Abrahamu tsakapfighula kwa Efuroni Mhiti, kuwe hanu ho ukutsikila. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Yosefu hayamtsikile aba wake, koya Misiri hamwe na ndughu tsake na iwanu wose iwaghendile naye kumtsika aba wake.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu kowalongela ndughu tsake waleke kumpfuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Ndughu tsake Yosefu hawonile aba wawo kafa, walonga, “Pfii katsotuhila na kutuliha aghala ghehile ighatumtendele?” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Apfo tsawawatuma iwanu kughenda kwa Yosefu, walonga, “Aba wako ng'ana yafe tsakatulaghitsa, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />katulongela tukulongele pfino, ‘Chondechonde uwaleghusile ndughu tsako ghehile.’ Lelo twokulomba utuleghusile ghehile ighatukutendile twetwe watumwa wa Imulungu wa aba wako.” Yosefu hayahulike pfino kalila.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Kuya ndughu tsake wamghendela, wamwinamila, walonga, “Lola, twetwe twa watumwa wako.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Lekeni Yosefu kawalongela, “Mleke kupfuka, pfii nene na Imulungu iyowahigha iwanu? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Mwemwe tsambama kunitendela ghehile, lekeni Imulungu kaghalusa ghawe ghanoghile, ili niukombole ughima we iwanu wengi ka pfamkona leloli. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Mleke kupfuka. Nene nitsomwing'ani chijo mwemwe na iwanenu.” Kuya kawakanza.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu kakufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yosefu tsakaghendelela kukala Misiri hamwe na iwanu wa kaye ya aba wake. Yosefu tsakakala na miyaka miya imwe na kumi. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Naye tsakawona iwana na iwatsukulu wa Efraimu, imwanaghe, pfipfila kawona iwana wa Makiri, imwana wa Manase. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Yosefu kawalongela ndughu tsake, “Nene nahabehi ukufa. Imulungu katsowatsilani ghendo kumwapfilani. Katsowalapfa mna isi ino na kuwaghala mna isi iyawalongele katsoweng'a Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Kuya Yosefu kawalongela iwana wa Isiraeli welahe, kalonga, “Imulungu ang'atsowatsila kumwapfilani, msole mipate yangu kulawa kuno, mke nayo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Kuya Yosefu tsakafa hayang'ali na miyaka miya imwe na kumi. Tsawalubakatsa lukuli lwake dawa luleke kwola, tsawalwika mna sanduku ako Misiri.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>